<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="DEU" style="id">- Mpoto Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Komb</para>
  <para style="toc1">Chitabu cha Kombukombu la Tolati</para>
  <para style="toc2">Kombukombu la Tolati</para>
  <para style="toc3">Komb</para>
  <para style="mt2">Chitabu cha</para>
  <para style="mt1">Kombukombu la Tolati</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongulelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu cha Kombukombu la Tolati nde makelabhukilu gha shelia yeilongaleka kubhohakeka mkati ja itabu yengi nhwanu ya Tolati (itabu nhwanu ya kutumbula mu Lulaghilu lwa Mwande). Lihina la Kiebulania la chitabu chenjenu libhi na ndandi jenjenu, “Malobhi.” Kwa kila ntundu ihobhaleka kubha Musa nde joakachilembiki chitabu chenjenu, pangakubha pandu pachokopi pela pa kujomulela chechilandila kupotela kwaki. Chitabu chenjenu chitumbula na malobhi ghaghapwagha, “Ghangani nde malobhi ambaghu Musa akabhapwaghili Izilaeli.” Liholalelu la kupwagha kubha Musa nde joakabhili mlemba wa chitabu chenu cha Kombukombu la Tolati libhonikana mu pandu patali patali mu Lulaghilu Lwahenu. Ulenganesu ghumu upatikana mu chitabu cha Matendu 3:22-23 mu pandu ambapu Petulu anukuu kuhuma mu Kombukombu la Tolati 18:15-18 na kuloghola kubha aghagha ghakabhili malobhi ghaka Musa. Iwezikana Musa akachilembiki chitabu cha Kombukombu la Tolati, papamu na itabu ya Utumbulilu, Kubhoka, Bhalawi, na Hesabu pachilanda ja hyaka ya 1400 au 1300 K. K. (Mangani ja kubhelakeka kwaka Yesu Kristo).</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu cha Kombukombu la Tolati chakalembakiki ngati majetanganelu pachilanda jaka nkolongwa na ukolongwa ghongi ghoubhili pahi ja lujiniku lwaki, ngati mokwahengakike mu machobha gha mwande. Nde majetanganelu pachilanda jaka Chapanga na bhandu bha Izilaeli. Chapanga akajetakili kubhapengalela bhandu ngati pela bhandu bhanihabha anabhajengalela na kutii shelia yaki. Ngati Bhaizilaeli bhakabhili bhakaniki kuikamula amuli yaka Chapanga, bhela bhakabya bhalapulike. Haleli nde lijambu lelilongaleka mu pandu pakolongwa pa chitabu chenjenu; nambu nakanopi mu sula ja 27 na sula ja 28 ibhili na msisitizu wa uchakaka ghongone koni ikaloghulaje mbengalelu maalumu na masolu ambaghu ghakabya ghabhokini na kukamula amuli yaka Chapanga au kukana kukamula amuli yaka Chapanga kwa bhandu bha inchi ja Izilaeli. Makabila patali patali gha Izilaeli ghakajemiki pa itombi ibheli tofauti yeyakabhi ilingalanila na yeyakabhi na majetanganelu, na kupwaghanila mbengalelu yeniheyi na masolu ghanihagha ngati indela ja kulutenda lulaghilu loniholu kubha bhalujetakile.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ghaghabhihomu</para>
  <para style="io">Musa abhakombosha ghaghapitalile mu mwanja wa Izilaeli kulomboka lipololu, mu sula ja 1 mbaka ja 3.</para>
  <para style="io">Mashaliti gha lulaghilu pachilanda jaka Chapanga na bhandu bhaki, mu sula ja 4 mbaka 26.</para>
  <para style="io">Bhandu bha Izilaeli bhaipwagha mbengalelu na masolu kwa sauti ngolongwa kulangiha kubha kutumbula chikahi chenihechi lulaghilu lukabhili lujemakike, mu sula ja 27 mbaka 30.</para>
  <para style="io">Kujomulela, Musa alongela malobhi gha kutokulesha kwaka Yoshua, na kwa kila likabila la Izilaeli mangani ja kupotela kwaki, mu sula ja 31 mbaka 34.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="DEU 1" />
  <para style="s">Ulongulelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 1:1" />Chitabu chenjenu chibhi na malobhi ambaghu Musa akabhapwaghili bhandu bhokapi bha Izilaeli chikahi pabhakabhi kulipololu upambala wa kolipita lyobha wa nkoka Yoludani. Bhakabhi ku libondi la Yoludani pambipi na Sufu, pachilanda ja muchi wa Palani upambala ghumu na muchi wa Tofeli, Labani, Hezeloti na Dizahabu, upambala ghonge. <verse eid="DEU 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 1:2" />Nde lujendu lwa machobha komi na jimu kuhuma ku chitombi cha Holebu mbaka ku Kadeshi Balinea kwa indela ja chitombi cha Seili. <verse eid="DEU 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 1:3" />Lichobha la kutumbula la mwehi wa komi na jimu, chaka cha alobaini, pabhakajomwi kubhoka ku Misili, Musa akabhapwaghi Bhaizilaeli mambu ghokapi Bambo Chapanga ghaakundaghalaki abhapwaghilaje. <verse eid="DEU 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 1:4" />Akahengiki bhenibhela chikahi paakajomwi kumbweza Sihoni nkolongwa wa Bhaamoli, joakabhi atawala ku muchi wa Heshiboni, na bhelabhela akamuweziki nkolongwa Ogu joakabhi atawala muchi wa Ashitaloti na muchi wa Edilei. <verse eid="DEU 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 1:5" />Musa akatumbwi kubhalandila bhandu Shelia jaka Chapanga chikahi pabhakabhi kwihi ja nkoka Yoludani upambala wa kolipiti lyobha.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 1:5">Akabhapwaghile, <verse eid="DEU 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 1:6" />“Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga witu, akalongi na tepani ku Holebu hoku, akapwaghaje, ‘Ntami pa chitombi chenjenu kwa chikahi chilacho. <verse eid="DEU 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 1:7" />Mbombulaje likambi linu na njendalya kulongi kujenda ku inchi ja itombi ja Bhaamoli, na pandu pa inchi ja pambipi ja Alaba, ku itombi, upambala wa kolijibhi lyobha pahi ja itombi, ku Negebu na pandu pa mumaheku, ena, njendaje mbaka ku inchi ja Kanaani, na inchi ja Lebanoni, mbaka ku nkoka ukolongwa wa Eufulati. <verse eid="DEU 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 1:8" />Ndingalyaje, numpeki mwehapa inchi jenjenu jokapi. Njingalaje mkatamaje mu inchi ambaju Bambo Chapanga akabhalapili akahokolu bhinu, Ibulahimu, Isaka na Yakobo, papamu na ibheleku yabhu pabhapetiki bhombe.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Musa abhahaghula bhatemula</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 18:13-27">Kubhoka 18:13-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 1:9" />Bhela Musa akabhapwaghi bhandu, “Chikahi patukabhi pachitombi Sinai, nepani nakumpwaghile, ‘Lihengu la kundongoha mwehapa nde likolongwa namaa kwangu nepani kanjika jango. <verse eid="DEU 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 1:10" />Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, akunjonjukili mwehapa kubha bhamaheli, nanamu ndingalyaje, lalenu mbi bhamaheli ngati ndondwa ya kunani. <verse eid="DEU 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 1:11" />Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga wa akahokolu bhinu, na anjonjukya mwehapa kubha bhamaheli mala elufu kupeta mombelile, na kumpengalela ngati moakundaghalile! <verse eid="DEU 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 1:12" />Nambu nepani ananhweza bhole kughatola mang'ahiku ghinu, na kulonda lukwale kwa kulochana kwinu kanjika jango? <verse eid="DEU 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 1:13" />Muhaghulaje bhandu bhakumu bhabhabhi na mbulau, bhabhabhi na umanyi na bhabhatopela kuhuma mu makabila ghinu, na nepani ananabhabheka bhakubha ihongozi bhino.’ ” <verse eid="DEU 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 1:14" />Nanamu mkanyetakili, na kumbwaghila, “Lijambu leulongile nde lamboni kulihenga.” <verse eid="DEU 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 1:15" />Bhela nakabhatoliki ihongozi bhala bhabhabhi na mbulau, na bhabhatopela bhamubhahawili kuhuma mu makabila ghino, na kubhabheka kubha ihongozi bhino. Nakabhabhekiki bhangi kubha ihongozi bhakolongwa bha mabhongelu gha maelufu gha bhandu, mabhongelu gha bhandu mia mia, mabhongelu gha bhandu hamsini hamsini, na mabhongelu gha bhandu makomi makomi. Bhelabhela nakahawili kabheti ihongozi bhangi bha kujemalela kila likabila.<verse eid="DEU 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 1:16" />“Nanatu chikahi chela nakabhalaghalaki bhatemula bhinu, nakapwaghaje, ‘Njowanyaje malochanu pachilanda ja bhalongu bhino Bhaizilaeli. Mkatemulaje ngati moipalakila pachilanda jaka mundu na ndongu waki wa Kiizilaeli, au ngeni joatama papamu naku. <verse eid="DEU 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 1:17" />Ngamwampendale mundu chikahi pantemula, mubhajowanyaje kwa kulengana, nchoku na nkolongwa. Ngamwanjoghopa mundu jokapi, maghambu utemulu ghokapi ghoubhoha uhuma kwaka Chapanga. Lighambu lokapi lelibhi likolongwa nakanope kwinu mwehapa, mnetila nepani, nanatu ananyowanyaje.’ <verse eid="DEU 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 1:18" />Chikahi chenihechi, nakundalaghalaki mambu ghokapi ghaghumpalika mwehapa kughahenga.<verse eid="DEU 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bhapelelezi bhatumakika kujenda kujipeleleza inchi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="NUM 13:1-33">Hesabu 13:1-33</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 1:19" />“Bhela, ngati Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga witu moakatulaghalakile, tukahengiti kila chindu, tukabhokiki ku Holebu na kujenda ku inchi ja itombi ja Bhaamoli, na tukapetiki pachilanda ja lipololu likolongwa na la kujoghoha lela, lela lemukaliweni, na tukahikiki ku Kadeshi Balinea. <verse eid="DEU 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 1:20" />Panihapa nakumpwaghile, ‘Tuhikiki mu inchi ja itombi ja Bhaamoli, jeatupekeha tepani Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga witu. <verse eid="DEU 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 1:21" />Ndingalyaje, Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu ampekihi inchi jenjeno. Haya, njingalaje mkatama monihomu ngati Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga wa akahokolu bhinu, moakundaghalakile. Ngamwijoghopa wala ngamwihekateka mtima.’<verse eid="DEU 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 1:22" />“Nambu mwehapa mkanhikili na kumbwaghila, ‘Tubhapelaka bhandu bhatulongulyaje kujipeleleza inchi kwa ndandi jito, na kutuletela malobhi kubhokana na indela jetupalika kupeta, na michi jetwihikilaje.’<verse eid="DEU 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 1:23" />“Lijambu leniheli lakabhonakini kubha lamboni kwangu nepane, bhela nakahawili bhandu komi na bhabheli, mwanalomi jumu kuhuma mu kila likabila. <verse eid="DEU 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 1:24" />Bhandu bhanihabha bhakabhokiki na kukwela ku inchi ja itombi, na kuhika ku Libondi la Eshikoli na kupeleleza pandu pokapi. <verse eid="DEU 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 1:25" />Bhakatoliki mapambiku ghakumu gha inchi jenijela mumabhoku ghabhu, bhakatuletili na kutupwaghila: Inchi jenjenu jeatupekeha Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga witu nde jinyahi namaa.<verse eid="DEU 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 1:26" />“Nambu mwehapa ngachemwajetakile kukwela konihoko, mkakaniki amuli jaka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga wino. <verse eid="DEU 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 1:27" />Mkang'ong'utiki mu mahema ghinu na kupwagha, ‘Bambo Chapanga atenda kutuhakalila, nde ndandi akatubhohiki ku inchi ja Misili, nahuli atupelakaje mu mabhoku gha Bhaamoli, na kutuyonanga. <verse eid="DEU 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 1:28" />Bho, tukwela kujenda kwako? Bhalongu bhitu bhatutendiki tuhekatika mitima. Bhakatupwaghili: Bhandu bha konihoku bhabhi na makili namaa, na nde bhalachu namaa, na kubha michi jabhu nde mikolongwa na jibhi na lumatu loluhika kumahunde. Nakanopi ja ghanihagha konihoku tukabhaweni bhabhelakeka bha Bhaanaki!’<verse eid="DEU 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 1:29" />“Nambu nakumpwaghile, ‘Ngamwajoghopa bhandu bhanihabha. <verse eid="DEU 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 1:30" />Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, joandongulela, anaankomanyaje, ngati moakahengile kwa ndandi jinu ku Misili hoku, palongi ja mihu ghino, <verse eid="DEU 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 1:31" />na kulipololu hoku, komukaweni ntundu Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu moakuntolile, ngati mundu moantolela mwana wake, mu indela jokapi jemwapetike, mbaka mkahikiki pandu pambane.’ <verse eid="DEU 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 1:32" />Nambu papamu na kubhapwaghila mambu ghokapi, ngachemunhobhali Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga wino, <verse eid="DEU 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 1:33" />joakundongulili mwindela, ikilu kwa moto, na kundangiha indela jempalika kupeta, na muhi kwa lihundi, nahuli kundondela pandu pa kujemeka mahema ghino.<verse eid="DEU 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bambo Chapanga abhalapula Bhaizilaeli</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="NUM 14:20-45">Hesabu 14:20-45</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 1:34" />“Chikahi Bambo Chapanga paakajowini mang'ong'uteku ghanihagha, akayomiki na kulapa, akapwaghaje, <verse eid="DEU 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 1:35" />‘Njeta mundu nga jumu wa chibheleku chenjenu chihakau joanaajibhona inchi jela jinyahi, jenakalaghile kubhapekeha akahokolu bhino. <verse eid="DEU 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 1:36" />Nambu Kalebu mwana waka Yefune pela, jonihoju nde joanaajibhonaje. Nanatu ananumpekya jombi na bhana bhaki inchi jeniheji jeakapiti kujipelaleza, maghambu akabhi ndongwana kwangu nepani Bambo Chapanga kwa kila lilobhi.’ <verse eid="DEU 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 1:37" />Bhela bhela Bambo Chapanga akaniyomili nepani kwa ndandi jino, akapwaghaje, ‘Hata wehapa, wa Musa, ngawijingi mu inchi jeniheje. <verse eid="DEU 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 1:38" />Nambu njangatila waku, Yoshua mwana waka Nuni, anaajingala mu inchi jeniheje. Bhela, unjeghala mtima, kwa kubha jombi anaabhalonguha Bhaizilaeli kujitola inchi jeniheje.’<verse eid="DEU 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 1:39" />“Bhela, Bambo Chapanga akatupwaghile, ‘Bhana bhinu bhamwapwaghiki kubha anabhakamulikikaje na anabhatolakika kwa makili, ambabhu ngachebhamanyi lamboni na lihakau, bhanihabha nde bhabhijingalaje mu inchi jeniheje. Ananabhapekya inchi jeniheje ikubha jabhu, nabhombi anabhatama monihomo. <verse eid="DEU 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 1:40" />Nambu mwehapa mng'anambukaje, na kukelabhuka kulipololu kwa kujengalela indela ja Bahali ja Shamu.’<verse eid="DEU 1:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 1:41" />“Panihapa mkayangiki, na kumbwaghila, ‘Tepani tuntendili Bambo Chapanga mahoku. Nambu sajenu anatukwelaje kujenda kukomana ngondu, ngati Bambo Chapanga witu, moatulaghalakile.’ Bhela kila mundu akalingongaje silaha yaki ya ngondo, koni mkaholalya kubha nde lijambu lelipepwike kukwela mu inchi ja itombi jela.<verse eid="DEU 1:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 1:42" />“Nambu Bambo Chapanga akambwaghile, ‘Ubhakanakyaje, ngabhijenda kukomana ngondu nabho, maghambu nepani nganikubhi papamu na mwehapa, ngamwihika kulapulika palongi ja adui bhino.’ ” <verse eid="DEU 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 1:43" />Bhela nakumpwaghile, nambu ngachemwapaliki kujowanela. Mkakaniki kutii amuli jaka Bambo Chapanga, na kwa ing'omu yinu mkapiti ku inchi heji ja itombi. <verse eid="DEU 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 1:44" />Bhaamoli bhabhakabhi bhatama mu chitombi chenihechi, bhakapitalili ngati injuche na kubhalapula, bhakundapwili ku Seili mbaka ku Holima. <verse eid="DEU 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 1:45" />Panihapa mkakelawiki na kulela palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga, nambu Bambo Chapanga ngacheanjowanili chilelu chinu, wala kundolakela.<verse eid="DEU 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Matamu gha Bhaizilaeli mulipololu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 1:46" />“Bhela mkatami ku Kadeshi kwa machobha ghamaheli, kwa chikahi chela chokapi mkatami konihoko.<verse eid="DEU 1:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="DEU 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 2:1" />“Bhela, tukang'anambwiki na kutumbula mwanja wa kujenda kulipololu kwa kupetela indela ja bahali ja Shamu, ngati moakalaghalakile Bambo Chapanga. Kwa machobha ghamaheli tukabhi tujenda kuiyongolota itombi ya inchi ja Seili.<verse eid="DEU 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 2:2" />“Bambo Chapanga akambwaghile: <verse eid="DEU 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 2:3" />Njendiki kuchiyongolota chitombi achechi kwa machobha ghamaheli, sajenu mng'anambukaje upambala wa kungonde. <verse eid="DEU 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 2:4" />Ubhapekya bhandu malaghalakilu aghagha: ‘Mbi pambipi kupeta pachilanda ja inchi ja bhalongu bhino, bhabhelakeka bhaka Esau, bhabhatama mu inchi ja Seili. Anabhunjoghupa mwehapa, nambu mlilingalyaje. <verse eid="DEU 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 2:5" />Ngamubhatumbula kwa ngondo maghambu nganumpekehi mwehapa pandu pokapi pala pa inchi jabhu ng'o, hata pandu pa kujaghanila kukanyata lwaju lwa chigholu. Kwa kubha numpekihi Esau na bhabhelakeka bhaki inchi ja itombi ja Seili kubha jabhu. <verse eid="DEU 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 2:6" />Anampala kuhemela chilebhi au machi impalika muhemalaje kwa madini gha feza.’<verse eid="DEU 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 2:7" />“Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu ampengalili mwehapa kwa mahengu ghokapi ghamuhenga kwa mabhoku ghino. Amanyi ntundu monjendile mu lipololi aleli likolongwa. Na kwa hyaka alobaini ayeyi Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, akabhi papamu na mwehapa, na ngachemwakepakiwi na chindu chokapi chela.<verse eid="DEU 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 2:8" />“Bhela tukapetiki kwa bhalongu bhitu bhabhelakeka bhaka Esau bhabhatama ku inchi ja Seili. Tukang'anambwiki kuhuma ku indela ja Alaba, jejihumila ku Elati na Esioni Gebeli, na kujendalela na mwanja kujengalela indela ja lipololu laku Moabu. <verse eid="DEU 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 2:9" />Bhela Bambo Chapanga akambwaghile, ‘Ngaubhang'aha bhandu bha Moabu, wala ngawikomana nabhu ngondo, maghambu nganakupekehi pandu pokapi pala pa inchi jabhu kutawala, maghambu inchi ja Ari nabhapekihi bhabhelakeka bhaka Lutu kubha labhu.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 2:10" />Pamwandi hapa mu inchi heji ja Ali bhakabhili bhatama bhandu bhamaheli bhahakabhi na makili bhabhalohakikaje Bhaemi na bhakabhili bhalachu ngati Bhaanaki. <verse eid="DEU 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 2:11" />Ngati mobhakabhelile Bhaanaki, bhanihabha nabhombi bhakabhi ngati Bhalefai, nambu Bhamoabu bhakabhalohiki Bhaemi. <verse eid="DEU 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 2:12" />Pamwandi hapa Bhaholi bhakabhi bhatama mu inchi ja Seili, nambu bhabhelakeka bhaka Esau bhakabhatopwili na kubhayonanga, na kutama mu inchi heji pandu pabhu, Bhaizilaeli nabhombi bhakatendiki bhelabhela mu inchi jebhakapekiwi na Bambo Chapanga kubha jabhu bheni.<verse eid="DEU 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 2:13" />Bambo Chapanga akatupwaghile, “Sajenu mbokanyaje, mkalombuka chikoka cha Zeledi.” Natatu tukachilombwiki chikoka cha Zeledi. <verse eid="DEU 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 2:14" />Hyaka selasini na nane yakabhi ipetike kutumbu chikahi patwabhokiki kuhuma ku Kadeshi Balinea mbaka patwalombwiki chikoka cha Zeledi. Kwa chikahi chenihechi chibheleku chokapi cha akanalomi kutumbula bhabhaweza kujenda kungondo chakabhi chipotile, ngati Bambo Chapanga moakabhili abhapwaghile. <verse eid="DEU 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 2:15" />Kwa kubha chiwoku chaka Bambo Chapanga chakabhi panani jabhu nahuli kubhayonanga ku likambi hoku, mbaka bhokapi pabhakajomwike.<verse eid="DEU 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 2:16" />“Bhela, akanalomi bhokapi bhabhakabhi na makili gha kujenda kungondo pabhakajomwi kukomakeka bhokapi, <verse eid="DEU 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 2:17" />Bambo Chapanga akambwaghile, <verse eid="DEU 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 2:18" />‘Lalenu ndombukaje inchi ja Ari, kupetela malindakanilu gha Moabu. <verse eid="DEU 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 2:19" />Chikahi pamwihika kwa Bhaamoli, ngamubhang'aha, wala kubhatumbula kwa ngondo, maghambu nganampekehi pandu pokapi pa inchi jeniheji ja Bhaamoli kubha pino. Kwa kubha nabhapekihi lubheleku lwaka Lutu kubha jabho.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 2:20" />Inchi jeniheji najombi jakamanyakini kubha nde inchi ja Bhalefai, bhabhakabhi bhatama konihoko, nambu Bhaamoli bhakabhalohiki bhandu bhanihabha Bhazamzumi. <verse eid="DEU 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 2:21" />Bhalefai habha bhakabhi bhandu bhamaheli, bhakolongwa, na bhalachu ngati Bhaanaki. Nambu Bambo Chapanga akabhayoningi kubhoka palongi ja Bhaamoli, ambabhu bhakabhatopwili na kutama pandu pabho. <verse eid="DEU 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 2:22" />Ngati Bambo Chapanga moakahengile kwa bhabhelakeka bhaka Esau, bhabhakabhi bhatama ku Seili, chikahi paakabhayoningi Bhaholi bhabhokaje palongi jabho. Bhakabhatopwili palongi jabhu, nabhombi bhakatami pandu pabhu mbaka laleno. <verse eid="DEU 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 2:23" />Nabhombi Bhaavi bhakabhi bhatama ku ijiji ya mumaheku ja bahali ja Meditelania mbaka ku muchi wa Gaza, nambu Bhakafitoli pabhakahikiki kuhuma ku chilu cha Kafitoli, yani Kilete, bhakabhayoningi na kutama pandu pabho.<verse eid="DEU 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 2:24" />“Patukajomwi kulomboka ku Moabu, Bambo Chapanga akatupwaghile, ‘Sajenu mbokanyaje, ntumbula mwanja winu na kulomboka libondi la Alinoni, lingalyaje, nutendiki Sihoni wa likabila la Bhaamoli nkolongwa wa Heshiboni, na inchi jaki bhalepalyaje palongi jaku. Nkomana naku ngondo na kutumbu kujitawala inchi jake. <verse eid="DEU 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 2:25" />Lichobha la lalenu anandumbula kubhajeghela choghohi bhandu bhokapi bha pundema bhunjoghupa mwehapa. Pabhijowanaje malobhi ghinu, anabhabhaghajaje na kujingiwa na choghoi kwa ndandi jino.’<verse eid="DEU 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bhaizilaeli bhundapula nkolongwa Sihoni</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="NUM 21:21-30">Hesabu 21:21-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 2:26" />“Kuhuma ku lipololu la Kedemoti nakabhatumiki bhatenga bhabhakabhili na malobhi gha lukwale kwaka Sihoni nkolongwa wa ku Kedemoti, kupwagha, <verse eid="DEU 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 2:27" />‘Utujetakalyaje tupetaje pa inchi jako. Anatupetaje mu indela ngolongwa, ngatwing'anambuki ku chiwoku cha kumalelelu wala chiwoku cha kumangeja. <verse eid="DEU 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 2:28" />Utuhemalyaje chilebhi kwa madini gha feza nahuli tukulaje, na utuhemalyaje machi kwa madini gha feza nahuli tukunywaje. Utujetakalyaje pela tupetaje pa inchi jaku kwa mogholu, <verse eid="DEU 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 2:29" />ngati mobhakatuhengile bhabhelakeka bhaka Esau bhabhatama ku Seili, na Bhamoabu bhabhatama ku Ari, mbaka tulombukaje nkoka Yoludani na kujingila mu inchi jetupekewa na Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga wito.’<verse eid="DEU 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 2:30" />“Nambu Sihoni, nkolongwa wa Heshiboni akakaniki ngatwipeta pa inchi jake. Kwa kubha Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku akuntendiki kubha na roho ja kunonopa, na kunjeghela ing'omu mu mtima wake, nahuli anjeghalaje mu mabhoku ghinu ngati moahengi laleno.<verse eid="DEU 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 2:31" />“Bhela, Bambo Chapanga akambwaghile, ‘Lingalyaje, ndumbwili kumboha nkolongwa Sihoni palongi jako. Sajenu ntumbulaje kukomana nabhu, na kujitola inchi jeniheji kubha jino.’ <verse eid="DEU 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 2:32" />Panihapa nkolongwa Sihoni akatupitalili na bhandu bhaki bhokapi, nahuli kukomana na tepani ku muchi wa Yahasa hoku. <verse eid="DEU 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 2:33" />Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga witu, akumbohiki palongi jitu, tukundapwili jombi na bhana bhaki, papamu na bhandu bhaki bhokapi. <verse eid="DEU 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 2:34" />Chikahi chenihechi tukajitoliki kwa makili michi jaki jokapi, tukauyoningi kila muchi ghoukabhi na akanalomi, akambomba na bhana, panga kundeka mundu jokapi jola kubha mwome. <verse eid="DEU 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 2:35" />Nambu tukaitoliki kwa makili hinyama ya kudimakika na mali kuhuma mu michi jenijela, kubha yitu tabhete. <verse eid="DEU 2:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 2:36" />Kuhuma ku muchi wa Aloeli, muchi ghoubhile mu ukengu wa libondi la Alinoni, na muchi ghoubhile mkati ja libondi la Alinoni, mbaka kuhika ku Gileadi, ngachepabhili na muchi hata ghumu wa kuweza kutulapula. Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga witu, akatupekihi tepani michi jokapi. <verse eid="DEU 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 2:37" />Nambu kubhokana na amuli jaka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga witu, akatukanakili kujingila mu inchi jokapi jela ja Bhaamoli, wala pandu pokapi pala papabhili pambipi na nkoka Yaboki, wala michi jejibhili ku itombi.<verse eid="DEU 2:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="DEU 3" />
  <para style="s">Bhaizilaeli bhundapula nkolongwa Ogu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="NUM 21:31-35">Hesabu 21:31-35</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 3:1" />“Bhela, tukang'anambwiki, na kukwela kujengalela indela ja Bashani, na Ogu nkolongwa wa Bashani akatupitalili jombi na bhandu bhaki bhokapi, kuhika kukomana na tepani pambipi na muchi wa ku Edilei. <verse eid="DEU 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 3:2" />Bambo Chapanga akambwaghile, ‘Ngawanjoghopa maghambu jomwi kuntenda lepalyaje palongi jaku, jombi na bhandu bhaki bhokapi na inchi jaki jokapi. Nanau untendila ngati mountendile Sihoni, nkolongwa wa Bhaamoli, joakabhi atama ku Heshiboni.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 3:3" />Bhela, Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga witu, akuntendiki Ogu nkolongwa wa Bashani na bhandu bhaki bhokapi bhalepalyaje palongi jitu. Tukabhayoningi bhokapi, panga kunhighakila mundu hata jumu.<verse eid="DEU 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 3:4" />Chikahi chenihechi tukajitoliki kwa makili michi jaki jokapi. Njeta muchi hata ghumu pachilanda ja michi jaki sitini wangakuutola kwa makili. Michi jeniheji jokapi jakabhi mu Aligobu, pandu papatawaliwi na nkolongwa Ogu ghoubhi mu Bashani. <verse eid="DEU 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 3:5" />Michi jeniheji jokapi jakabhi na lumatu ilachu, na milyangu mikolongwa na makabali makolongwa, bhelabhela kukabhili na ijiji yamaheli namaa yangakuchengakeka lumatu. <verse eid="DEU 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 3:6" />Tukabhayoningi bhokapi, ngati motukunhengile Sihoni, nkolongwa wa Heshiboni. Tukauyoningi kila muchi ghoukabhi na akanalomi, akambomba na bhana. <verse eid="DEU 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 3:7" />Nambu tukaitoliki hinyama ya kudimakika na mali kuhuma mu michi jenijela, kubha yitu tabhete.<verse eid="DEU 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 3:8" />“Bhela kwa chikahi chenihechi tukajitoliki inchi heji kuhuma kwa bhakolongwa bhabheli bha Bhaamoli bhabhakabhi bhatama kwihi ja nkoka Yoludani, kutumbula ku libondi la Alinoni mbaka ku chitombi cha Helimoni. <verse eid="DEU 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 3:9" />Bhasidoni bhachiloha chitombi hechi cha Helimoni, Silioni, nabhombi Bhaamoli bhachiloha Senili. <verse eid="DEU 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 3:10" />Tukajitoliki kwa makili michi jokapi ja ku uwanda wa kundonda, na bhelabhela pandu pokapi pa Gileadi, na Bashani jokapi, mbaka kuhika ku Seleka na Edeli, michi ja utawala waka nkolongwa Ogu ku Bashani hoku.”<verse eid="DEU 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 3:11" />Nkolongwa Ogu wa Bashani nde joakahighalile kanjika jaki pachilanda ja mahighalilu gha Bhalefai. Chitanda chaki chakabhi cha choma chechabhili na ulachu wa futi komi na ibheli na upana wa futi sita, kwa ipemu ya kawaida. Chitanda hechi chikali chibhile mbaka sajeno ku muchi wa Bhaamoli ghoubhi ku Raba.<verse eid="DEU 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Makabila ghaghatami ku upambala wa kolipita lybha wa Yoludani</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="NUM 32:1-42">Hesabu 32:1-42</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 3:12" />“Patukajitoliki inchi jeniheji kubha jitu, nakabhapekihi likabila laka Leubeni na Gadi pandu pokapi papabhili upambala wa kungonde ja muchi wa Aloeli pambipi na libondi la Alinoni, na nusu ja pandu pa itombi ya Gileadi, papamu na michi jake. <verse eid="DEU 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 3:13" />Bhela nusu ja likabila laka Manase nakabhapekihi pandu pa Gileadi papahighalile papamu na Bashani jokapi, jejakabhili jitawaliwa na nkolongwa Ogu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 3:13">Pandu pokapi pa Aligobu mu Bashani pakamanyakini ngati inchi ja Bhalefai. <verse eid="DEU 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 3:14" />Yaili, mbelakeka waka Manase, akatoliki pandu pokapi pa inchi ja Aligobu, mbaka malindakanilu gha Bhageshuli na Bhamaaka, akailohiki inchi yeniheyi Hawoti Yaili, yani lihina laki mwene, bhela mbaka lalenu Bashani jilowakeka Hawoti Yaili, yani ijiji yaka Yaili.<verse eid="DEU 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 3:15" />Bhandu bha lukolu lwaka Makili bha likabila laka Manase, nakabhapekihi inchi ja Gileadi. <verse eid="DEU 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 3:16" />Nambu bhandu bha makabila ghaka Leubeni na Gadi nakabhapekihi kutumbula ku Gileadi mbaka ku libondi la nkoka Alinoni, pachilanda ja libondi heli pakabhi nde malindakanilu, mbaka ku nkoka Yaboki, ambau nde malindakanilu gha inchi ja Bhaamoni. <verse eid="DEU 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 3:17" />Kwa upambala wa kolijibhi lyobha malindakanilu ghabhu ghakabhi nkoka Yoludani, kutumbula nhwanga Galilaya mbaka Bahali ja Alaba, yani Bahali ja Mwinyo, ku mihelelu ja Pisiga upambala wa kolipita lyobha.<verse eid="DEU 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 3:18" />“Chikahi chenihechi nakundaghalakile, ‘Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, ampekihi mwehapa inchi jenjenu ja upambala wa kolipita lyobha jikubha jino. Nambu ipalika akanalomi bhokapi bhabhabhi na makili, bhakabya bhabhi na silaha yabhu kwa ngondo, bhalombukaje kwihi ja kabhele palongi ja bhalongu bhinu Bhaizilaeli. <verse eid="DEU 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 3:19" />Nambu bhahanu bhinu na bhana bhinu, na hinyama hinu ya kudimakika, manyi mbili na hinyama yamaheli ya kudimakika, bhahighalyaje mu michi jinu jenumpekihe. <verse eid="DEU 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 3:20" />Mbaka chikahi Bambo Chapanga paabhajangatyaje bhalongu bhinu kupomulela ngati mwehapa, nabhombi bhelabhela bhapwelilaje inchi jela jebhapekewa na Bambo Chapanga, kwihi ja nkoka Yoludani. Paghipeta ghanihagha, mwikelabhukaje mu inchi jenjenu jenumpekihe kubha jinu.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 3:21" />“Chikahi chenihechi nakundaghalaki Yoshua, ‘Wehapa ulibhonili kwa mihu ghaku wamwete mambu ghokapi ambaghu Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, akabhahengili bhakolongwa bhabheli, Sihoni na Ogu. Bambo Chapanga anaabhahengila bhelabhela bhakolongwa bha inchi yokapi konjenda hoku. <verse eid="DEU 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 3:22" />Ngamubhajoghopa, kwa kubha Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, anaakomanaje kwa ndandi jino.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Musa alolakela inchi ja Kanaani kuhuila ku Pisiga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 3:23" />“Chikahi chenihechi nakalihelihi palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga, na kumpwaghila, <verse eid="DEU 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 3:24" />‘Wenga wa Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga Weubhi na Makile, utumbwili kundangiha mtumika waku ukolongwa waku, na uwezu waku. Ndandi kubhi na kichapanga bhole kunani kumahundi na pundema joaweza kuhenga lihengu na matendu makolongwa ngati ghauhenga wehapa? <verse eid="DEU 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 3:25" />Nanatu nukulobha uneka nombukaje nakajibhona inchi jinyahi jejibhi upambala wa kolijibhi lyobha kwihi ja nkoka Yoludani, na inchi jela jinyahi ja itombi ya Lebanoni.’<verse eid="DEU 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 3:26" />“Nambu kwa ndandi jinu Bambo Chapanga akaniyomile, na kukana kunyowanela. Bambo Chapanga akambwaghile, ‘Ijaghanila! Ngawijendalela kulongela lijambu aleli na nepani nakanope. <verse eid="DEU 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 3:27" />Ukwelaje mbaka kunani ja chitombi cha Pisiga, na ukalingaje ku upambala wa kolijibhi lyobha, kungonde, kunkache na kolipita lyobha. Ukajilingaje inchi jeniheji kwa mihu ghako, maghambu ngaulomboki nkoka aghoghu wa Yoludani ng'o. <verse eid="DEU 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 3:28" />Nambu undaghalakya Yoshua, akangamalaje na akubha na makili, kwa kubha jonihoju nde joanalombukaje palongi ja bhandu abhabha, na inchi jeanaujibhonaje anaabhapekya jombi kujipwelela.’<verse eid="DEU 3:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 3:29" />“Bhela tukatami ku libondi la nkoka Yoludani pambipi na muchi wa Beti Peoli.”<verse eid="DEU 3:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="DEU 4" />
  <para style="s">Musa abhalaghalaki bhandu kuntii Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 4:1" />Bhela Musa akajendali kupwagha, “Bhandu bha Izilaeli, sajenu njowanyaje amuli na shelia yeananumbolaje, nahuli mpata kuikamula, na mpata kujingila na kutama mu inchi jeampekeha Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga wa akahokolu bhino. <verse eid="DEU 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 4:2" />Ngamwijonjukela wala kupunguza chokapi chela chenundaghalaki mwehapa, mpata kuikamula amuli yaka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, yenundaghalakila. <verse eid="DEU 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 4:3" />Mwehapa mkaweni mabheti kwa mihu ghinu ghala ghaakahengiki Bambo Chapanga kwaka kichapanga Baali Peoli. Maghambu Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, akabhayoningi kuhuma pachilanda jinu kila mundu joakunjengalile kichapanga Baali Peoli. <verse eid="DEU 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 4:4" />Nambu mwehapa mwemkabhi bhalongwana kwaka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, mkali mabhomi kila jumu winu mbaka lalenu.<verse eid="DEU 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 4:5" />“Ndingalyaje, numboliki amuli na shelia ngati Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga wangu, moakanaghalakile nepane, nahuli muijengalyaje mu inchi jenjingila kutama. <verse eid="DEU 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 4:6" />Muikamulaje wichu, na kuijengalela, maghambu kwa kuhenga bhenibhela bhandu bha inchi nayengi pabhihika kuimanya shelia yeniheyi yokapi, anabhapwaghaje, ‘Chakaka inchi ajeji jikolongwa nde ja bhandu bhabhabhi na mbulau na malango!’<verse eid="DEU 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 4:7" />“Kwa ndandi kubhi na bhandu bha inchi bholi jikolongwa, jejibhi na Chapanga joabhi pambipe nabhu, ngati Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga witu, moabhelile na tepani chikahi chokapi patundobha? <verse eid="DEU 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 4:8" />Kabhete kubhi na bhandu bha inchi bholi jengi jejibhi jikolongwa anana, jejibhi na amuli na shelia inyahi na yeipalika ngati ayeyi, yenibheka palongi jinu laleno? <verse eid="DEU 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 4:9" />Nambu mlilingalyaje mabhete, na kulilenda nakanopi nahuli ngamwihika kughajewa mambu ghamughaweni kwa mihu ghino, wala kughaleka ghabhokaje mumitima jinu mu machobha ghokapi gha matamu ghino. Nambu mwabholaje mambu ghanihagha bhana bhinu na bhachokolu bhino. <verse eid="DEU 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 4:10" />Nkombukaje lichobha lemwajemiki palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, ku chitombi cha Holebu kola, chikahi Bambo Chapanga paakambwaghile, ‘Wabhongana bhandu bhanihabha palongi jangu bhajowanyaje malobhi ghangu, nahuli bhalibhola kundopela nepane kwa chikahi chokapi chebhitamaje pundema, nabhombi bhakabhabholaje bhana bhabhu kuhenga bhenibhela.’<verse eid="DEU 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 4:11" />“Mkaheghalili na kujema pahi ja chitombi chela, chitombi chakabhelili moto mbaka kunani kumahunde, papamu na mahundi mapili na lubhendu lukolongwa. <verse eid="DEU 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 4:12" />Bhela Bambo Chapanga akalongili na mwehapa mu moto. Mkajowini sauti ja malobhi ghaki, nambu ngachemumbweni moabhelile, mkajowini sauti pela. <verse eid="DEU 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 4:13" />Akuntangazili lulaghilu lwaki, ambalu nde Amuli Komi, yeakundaghalakile muikamulaje, na kuilemba panani ja mbau ibheli ya maganga. <verse eid="DEU 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 4:14" />Chikahi chenihechi Bambo Chapanga akanaghalakili numbolaje mwehapa shelia na amuli yeimpalika kuijengalela mu inchi jendomboka kujenda kujitola kubha jinu.<verse eid="DEU 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lilakalilu la kujojabhela imong'umong'u</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 4:15" />“Mlilingalyaje mabhete, maghambu ngachemumbweni Chapanga moabhelile mu lichobha lela Bambo Chapanga paakalongili na mwehapa ku chitombi cha Holebu hoku kuhuma mu moto. <verse eid="DEU 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 4:16" />Nahuli ngamwihenga mahoku kwa kulilenganakela mabhete imong'umong'u ya kubacha, ulenganesu wa sula jokapi jela, ulenganesu waka mwanalomi au mbomba, <verse eid="DEU 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 4:17" />au kwa ulenganesu wa chinyama chokapi chela chechibhi pundema, au ulenganesu wa chijuni chokapi chela chechigholoka munani, <verse eid="DEU 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 4:18" />au ngati chiumbi chokapi chela chechikwabha panani ja luhombi, au ulenganesu wa homba jokapi jela jejibhili mkati ja machi. <verse eid="DEU 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 4:19" />Na paulingalila kunani na kulibhona lyobha, mwehi na ndondwa na hindu yokapi ya kunani kumahunde, ngawaijojabhela, wala kuitumakila, maghambu hindu yeniheyi Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, abhaghabhili bhandu bhokapi bha pundema. <verse eid="DEU 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 4:20" />Nambu kwinu mwehapa, Bambo Chapanga ambohiki kuhuma mu mang'ahiku makolongwa, ku Misili hoku, nahuli mpata kubha bhandu bha upwelelu waki, ngati mombelili lalenu. <verse eid="DEU 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 4:21" />Bambo Chapanga akaniyomili kwa ndandi jinu mwehapa, na akalapiki kubha nepani nganilomboki nkoka Yoludani, na kujingila mu inchi jela jinyahi, jempekewa na Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, kubha upwelelu winu. <verse eid="DEU 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 4:22" />Nepani anambotilaje mu inchi jenjenu, nganilomboki nkoka Yoludani, nambu mwehapa mbili pambipi kulomboka, na kujitola inchi jela jinyahi. <verse eid="DEU 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 4:23" />Mlilingalyaje ngamwijewa lulaghilu lwaka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, lola loatendiki na mwehapa. Ngamwalilenganakela chimong'umong'u cha kubacha chechilengana na chindu chokapi chela chemkanakiwi na Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu. <verse eid="DEU 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 4:24" />Kwa kubha Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, nde moto ghoukula, jombi nde Chapanga joabhi na wihu.<verse eid="DEU 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 4:25" />“Pamwikubha mtami mu inchi jeniheji kwa chikahi chilachu, na kupata bhana na bhachokolu na kubha bhazee, ngati anamtumbwili kuhobha na kulilenganakela chimong'umong'u cha kichapanga cha ntundu wokapi ghola, na kuhenga mahakau palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, na kuntenda akubha na inyela, <verse eid="DEU 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 4:26" />bhela, nepani lalenu niiloha mbengu na ndema ikubha ngati bhalandilu pachilanda jino, kubha anamuyonangikaje mala punkamu mu inchi jendomboka nkoka Yoludani kujenda kujitola. Ngamwitami konihoku kwa chikahi chilachu, nambu kwa chakaka anamuyonangikaje. <verse eid="DEU 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 4:27" />Bambo Chapanga anaantendaje mpechanganaje pachilanda ja inchi nayenge, na bhachokopi bhinu pela nde bhabhihighalyaje pachilanda ja inchi yeniheyi ambayu Bambo Chapanga anaantopulyaje. <verse eid="DEU 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 4:28" />Konihoku anamuitumakyaje ichapanga yeilenganakiki kwa mikongu na maganga, yeilenganakiki na bhandu, yangakuweza kulola, wala kujowana, ngacheikula, wala ngacheinuha. <verse eid="DEU 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 4:29" />Nambu konihoku, ngati anamundondiki Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, anamumpataje, ngati anamundondiki kwa mtima winu wokapi, na kwa roho jinu jokapi. <verse eid="DEU 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 4:30" />Chikahi pamwikubhaje mu mang'ahiku, na mambu ghanihagha ghokapi anaghumpatike, pakujomukela machobha ghanihagha, mwankelabhukya Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, na kuntii. <verse eid="DEU 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 4:31" />Maghambu Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, nde Chapanga joabhi na chiha, ngaandeki wala kunjonanga, wala ngaalujewi lulaghilu loakatendiki na akahokolu bhinu, loakalutendiki kwa kubhalapila.<verse eid="DEU 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 4:32" />“Sajenu ulalukyaje kubhokana na machobha gha mwande, ghaghakabhili mangane jaku wehapa, kutumbula lichobha lela Chapanga paakumbombiki mundu panani ja ndema, ulalukyaje kutumbula kunani kumahunde mbaka pundema pokapi. Bho, kulabhalili lelu kupitalila lijambu lengi lelibhi likolongwa ngati lendeno, au kubhi na lijambu lengi lelilabhali kujowaneka ngati alale? <verse eid="DEU 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 4:33" />Bho, kubhi le na bhandu mu chikahi chokapi chela bhabhajowini sauti jaka Chapanga jakalongilaje kuhuma pachilanda ja moto, ngati mwehapa momwajowanile, na bhombi bhakajendali kubha bhome? <verse eid="DEU 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 4:34" />Bho, kubhi le na Chapanga jongi jokapi jola joalabhalile mweni kujenda kubhatola bhandu bha inchi jaki kuhuma mu inchi jenge, kwa malengakeku, na kwa nginyulila na ngangachu, na kwa ngondo, na kwa chiwoku chechibhili na makili na chechihatambwike au kwa matendu makolongwa gha kujoghoha, ngati ghala ambaghu Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, ghaakahengiki kwa ndandi jinu ku Misili hoku palongi ja mihu ghino? <verse eid="DEU 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 4:35" />Mwehapa mkaghaweni mambu ghanihagha nahuli mpata kumanya kubha Bambo Chapanga nde Chapanga, njeta jongi nambu jombe. <verse eid="DEU 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 4:36" />Kuhuma kunani kumahunde Chapanga akabhatendiki bhajowanaje sauti jake, nahuli kubhabhola kuntii jombi. Na pani pundema akabhalangihi moto waki ukolongwa, nanamu mkaghajowini malobhi ghaki kuhuma mu moto ghola. <verse eid="DEU 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 4:37" />Maghambu akabhapaliki akahokolu bhinu na akabhahawili bhabhelakeka bhabhu baada jabhu, akabhabhohiki kuhuma mu inchi ja Misili kwa kubha akabhili papamu nabhu, kwa uwezu waki ukolongwa. <verse eid="DEU 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 4:38" />Akabhatopwili palongi jinu bhandu bha inchi ikolongwa, na bhabhabhi na makili kupeta mwehapa, na kundeta mwehapa mu inchi jabhu na kumpekeha mwehapa kubha upwelelu winu, ngati mokubheli mbaka lalenu. <verse eid="DEU 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 4:39" />Njetakyaje na mbekaje mu mitima jinu lalenu kubha Bambo Chapanga nde Chapanga kunani kumahundi, na pani pundema pahi, njeta jonge. <verse eid="DEU 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 4:40" />Bhela, mkamulaje amuli na malaghalakilu ghaki ghanumpeke mwehapa lalenu, nahuli mpataje kuneng'anela mwehapa na bhana bhinu baada jinu mwehapa, na mpataje kutama matamu malachu mu inchi jempekewa na Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, machobha ghokapi.”<verse eid="DEU 4:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Michi ja kutilila upambala wa kolipita lyobha wa nkoka Yoludani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 4:41" />Bhela Musa akajighabhiki michi jitatu kwihi ja nkoka Yoludani, upambala wa kolipita lyobha, <verse eid="DEU 4:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 4:42" />nahuli mundu jokapi joankomiki njaki panga kumanya, wala ngacheakunhakalile mangani ja panihapa, nahuli apata kutama mu muchi ghumu pachilanda ja michi jeniheje. <verse eid="DEU 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 4:43" />Michi jeniheji nde Beseli mu uwanda wa lipololu kwa ndandi ja bhandu bha likabila laka Leubeni, muchi wa Lamoti mu inchi ja Gileadi kwa ndandi ja bhandu bha likabila laka Gadi, na muchi wa Golani mu inchi ja Bashani kwa ndandi ja bhandu bha likabila laka Manase.<verse eid="DEU 4:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Musa abhapwaghi Bhaizilaeli shelia kwa mala ja kabheli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 4:44" />Jenjenu nde Shelia jaka Chapanga jeakabhekiki Musa palongi ja Bhaizilaeli. <verse eid="DEU 4:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 4:45" />Ghangani nde malaghalakilu, amuli na shelia ambayu Musa akabhapwaghili Bhaizilaeli pabhakabhili ku inchi ja Misili, <verse eid="DEU 4:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 4:46" />bhakabhili kwihi ja nkoka Yoludani, ku libondi lelijaghanile ku Beti Peoli, ku inchi jaka Sihoni, nkolongwa wa Bhaamoli, joakabhi atawala ku Heshiboni, ambaju akalapuliki na Musa na Bhaizilaeli pabhakahikiki kuhuma ku inchi ja Misili. <verse eid="DEU 4:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="DEU 4:47" />Bhakajitoliki inchi jaki, na inchi jaka Ogu nkolongwa wa Bashani, bhanihabha nde bhakolongwa bhabheli bha Bhaamoli, bhabhakabhili kwihi ja nkoka Yoludani upambala wa kolipita lyobha. <verse eid="DEU 4:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="DEU 4:48" />Inchi jenjenu jakajaghanili kutumbula ku Aloeli ukengu wa libondi la Alinoni mbaka ku chitombi cha Sioni, yani chitombi cha Helimoni, <verse eid="DEU 4:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="DEU 4:49" />papamu na uwanda wokapi wa kolipita lyobha wa nkoka Yoludani, na kujaghanila mbaka ku Bahali ja Araba, ku mihelelu ja Pisiga.<verse eid="DEU 4:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="DEU 5" />
  <para style="s">Amuli Komi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 20:1-17">Kubhoka 20:1-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 5:1" />Musa akabhalohiki Bhaiziaeli bhokapi, na kubhapwaghila, “Mwenga Bhaiziaeli, njowanyaje amuli na shelia yenuntangazila palongi jinu lalenu. Mulibholaje yeniheyi na kuikamula ngati moipalakila. <verse eid="DEU 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 5:2" />Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga witu, akatendiki lulaghilu na tepani pa chitombi cha Holebu, yani chitombi cha Sinai. <verse eid="DEU 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 5:3" />Bambo Chapanga ngacheakatendiki lulaghilu loni na akahokolu bhito, nambu na tepani, yani tepani tabhokapi tetubhi tukali tabhomi pambane. <verse eid="DEU 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 5:4" />Bambo Chapanga akalongili na mwehapa pamihu kwa pamihu, kuhuma pachilanda ja moto panani ja chitombi. <verse eid="DEU 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 5:5" />Chikahi chenihechi nepani nakajemiki pachilanda jaka Bambo Chapanga na mwehapa nahuli kuntangazila lilobhi laka Bambo Chapanga, maghambu mkajowipi moto ghola, nanamu ngachemwakweliki kuchitombi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 5:5">“Najombi Bambo Chapanga akapwaghike, <verse eid="DEU 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 5:6" />‘Nepani nde Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku, nenukubhohiki mu inchi ja Misili, koukabhi untumwa.<verse eid="DEU 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 5:7" />“ ‘Ngawikubha na ichapanga yengi nambu nepani pela.<verse eid="DEU 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 5:8" />“ ‘Ngawalitendela imong'umong'u ya ichapanga ya kubacha yeilengana na chindu chokapi chechibhili kunani kumahundi, wala chechibhili pahi pundema, wala chechibhili mumachi pahi ja ndema. <verse eid="DEU 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 5:9" />Ngawaichikamila wala kuijojabhela, kwa kubha nepani Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku, nde Chapanga nemili na wihu, nabhatemula bhana kwa mahoku gha akatati bhabhu mbaka chibheleku cha katatu na cha kachechi cha bhala bhabhanhakalila, <verse eid="DEU 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 5:10" />nambu nabhalangiha upalu wangu hibheleku elufu ya bhala bhabhambala na kuikamula amuli yangu.<verse eid="DEU 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 5:11" />“ ‘Ngawaliloghola waka lihina laka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku, kwa kubha Bambo Chapanga ngayikotoki kumbalangila mahoku mundu jola joaliloghola lihina laki waka.<verse eid="DEU 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 5:12" />“ ‘Ulikamulaje lichobha la Sabato, na uligholulaje, ngati Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku, moakulaghalakile. <verse eid="DEU 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 5:13" />Machobha sita uhengaje mahengu ghaku, na uhengaje mambu ghaku ghokapi, <verse eid="DEU 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 5:14" />nambu lichobha la saba nde lichobha la Sabato kwaka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku. Lichobha leniheli ngawihenga lihengu lokapi lela, wehapa wala mwana waku wa chikambaku au kamwali waku, wala mtumwa waku, wala mtumika waku wa chikambaku au wa chimbomba, wala chinyama chaku, wala ngeni joabhi mkati ja nyumba jaku, nahuli bhatumika bhaku bha chikambaku na bha chimbomba bhapataje kupomulela bhelabhela ngati wehapa. <verse eid="DEU 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 5:15" />Nkombukaje kubha mkabhili bhatumwa ku Misili hoku, na Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, akumbohiki konihoku kwa chiwoku chechibhili na makili na kwa chiwoku chechihatambwike. Bhela Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, andaghalakili mlikamulaje lichobha la Sabato.<verse eid="DEU 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 5:16" />“ ‘Watopilaje tati waku na mabhu waku, ngati Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku, moakulaghalakile, nahuli machobha ghaku ghapata kubha ghamaheli, na kujonjukeka mu inchi jeupekewa na Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku.<verse eid="DEU 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 5:17" />“ ‘Ngawikoma.<verse eid="DEU 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 5:18" />“ ‘Ngawitenda ugone.<verse eid="DEU 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 5:19" />“ ‘Ngawijibha.<verse eid="DEU 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 5:20" />“ ‘Ngawandandila njaku upuhi.<verse eid="DEU 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 5:21" />“ ‘Ngawantokulela nhwanu waka njaku. Ngawajitokulela nyumba jaka njaku, wala ngonda waki, wala mtumika waki wa chikambaku, wala mtumika waki wa chimbomba, wala ng'ombi yaki, wala maponda ghaki, wala chindu chokapi cheabhi nachu njaku.’<verse eid="DEU 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 5:22" />“Ayeyi nde amuli ambayu Bambo Chapanga akalipwaghili lipogha linu lokapi kwa sauti ngolongwa kuhuma pa moto, na lihundi na lubhendu lukolongwa, wala ngacheakajonjukili chokapi chela nakanope. Bhela akailembiki panani ja hibau ibheli ya maganga, na kumbekeha nepani.<verse eid="DEU 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bhandu bhajoghopa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 20:18-21">Kubhoka 20:18-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 5:23" />“Bhela, pamwajowini sauti kuhuma mu lubhendu, chikahi chitombi pachakabhi chibhelela moto, panihapa ihongozi bha makabila ghinu ghokapi na bhazee bhinu bhakanhikili nepani, <verse eid="DEU 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 5:24" />na kumbwaghila, ‘Lingalyaje! Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga witu, atulangihi ulumbalilu waki, na ukolongwa waki, na tepani tujowini sauti jaki kuhuma pachilanda ja moto. Lalenu tuweni kubha mundu aweza kubha mwome hata, ngati Chapanga anaalongi naku. <verse eid="DEU 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 5:25" />Nambu henu, maghambu kike tupotilaje? Maghambu moto aghoghu ukolongwa anautuyonangaje, na ngati anatujendalili kujijowana sauti jaka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga witu nakanope, anatupotilaje! <verse eid="DEU 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 5:26" />Bho, mundu bholi joabhi na hyegha joalabhalili kujijowana sauti jaka Chapanga joabhi mwomi akalongilaje kuhuma mu moto, ngati tepani motujowanile, na kuhighalila kubha mwome? <verse eid="DEU 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 5:27" />Ujendaje pambipi wehapa wa Musa, ukajowanyaje ghokapi ghaipwaghaje Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga witu, na bhela uhikaje utupwaghilaje ghokapi ghaakupwaghilaje Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga witu, na tepani anatughajowanyaje na kughatii.’<verse eid="DEU 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 5:28" />“Bambo Chapanga akunjowini chikahi pamukabhi ndongela na nepani, na Bambo Chapanga akambwaghile, ‘Nyowini malobhi gha bhandu abhabha, na kila chindu chebhalongile nde chinyahi. <verse eid="DEU 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 5:29" />Ngati bhakabhili na mtima ngati aghoghu mkati jabhu, wa kunyoghopa na kuikamula amuli yangu machobha ghokapi, mambu ghabhu ghakabya ghabhajendili wichu machobha ghokapi bhombi na bhana bhabhu mileli. <verse eid="DEU 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 5:30" />Ujendaje ukabhapwaghilaje bhakelabhukaje mu mahema ghabhu. <verse eid="DEU 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 5:31" />Nambu wehapa uhighalyaje pambani pambipi na nepani, nahuli nhwezaje kukupekeha malaghalakilu, amuli na shelia, ambayu anaubhabholaje, nahuli bhawezaje kuikamula mu inchi jenabhapekyaje kubha jabhu.’<verse eid="DEU 5:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 5:32" />“Bhela mlilingalyaje, na mtendaje ngati mondaghalakiwi na Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, ngamwikotoka kukamula amuli yangu yokapi ngati moipalakila. <verse eid="DEU 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 5:33" />Njengalyaje mambu ghokapi Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu ghaandaghalakile, nahuli mambu ghinu ghunjendila wichu, na mpataje kutama matamu malachu mu inchi jeananumpekyaje kubha jinu.<verse eid="DEU 5:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="DEU 6" />
  <para style="s">Amuli ngolongwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 6:1" />“Yenjenu nde amuli, shelia na malaghalakilu ambaghu Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, akanaghalakili numbolaje mwehapa, nahuli mpataje kuikamula mu inchi jela jendomboka kujenda kujitola, <verse eid="DEU 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 6:2" />nahuli mwehapa, bhana bhinu na bhana bhabhu baada jabhu bhunjojabyaje Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, machobha ghokapi gha matamu ghinu kwa kukamula amuli yaki, na shelia yaki yokapi yenumpekeha, nahuli mpataje kutama matamu malachu. <verse eid="DEU 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 6:3" />Njowanyaje, mwenga Bhaizilaeli, impalika kutii, nahuli mambu ghinu ghapataje kubha wichu, na kujonjukeka nakanope, ngati Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga wa akahokolu bhinu, moandaghalile, mu inchi jejibhile na mahibha na buse.<verse eid="DEU 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 6:4" />“Ujuwanyaje, wenga Izilaeli, Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku, nde jumu pela. <verse eid="DEU 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 6:5" />Umpalaje Bambo Chapanga waku kwa mtima waku wokapi, na kwa roho jaku jokapi, na kwa makili ghaku ghokapi. <verse eid="DEU 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 6:6" />Na amuli yenjenu yenukupekeha lalenu ubhekaje muntima waku. <verse eid="DEU 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 6:7" />Ubhabholaje bhana bhaku kwa kukangamala, na kuilongela pautama panyumba jaku, paujenda mu indela, paughonela na paujumuka. <verse eid="DEU 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 6:8" />Ukongaje ngati alama panani ja chiwoku chaku, na ukongaje ngati ukombukelu pa chibhongi ja pamihu jako. <verse eid="DEU 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 6:9" />Bhelabhela ulembaje mu ngelakete ya nyumba jaku, na munani ja milyangu jinu mikolongwa.<verse eid="DEU 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malakalilu kwa bhandu bhangakupala kutii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 6:10" />“Bhela chikahi Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku, anaajomwili kukuleta mu inchi jeakabhalapili kubhapekeha akahokolu bhaku, Ibulahimu, Isaka na Yakobo, kubha anaakupekyaje wehapa, inchi jejibhili na michi minyahi mikolongwa jangakujichenga wehapa, <verse eid="DEU 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 6:11" />nyumba yeitwelili hindu hinyahi ya kila ntundu yangakuitwelakela wehapa, na hilibha yeikembakiki yangakuikemba wehapa, na mighonda ja mizabibu na mizeituni jangakupanda wehapa, bhela pawikulaje na kutupila, <verse eid="DEU 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 6:12" />ulilingalyaje ngawihika kundeka Bambo Chapanga joakubhohiki ku inchi ja Misili, komukabhi bhatumwa. <verse eid="DEU 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 6:13" />Untopilaje Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku, na untumakyaje jombi kanjika jaki, na kulapa kwa lihina lake. <verse eid="DEU 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 6:14" />Ngamwijengalela ichapanga yengi, ichapanga ya bhandu bhabhunyongalota mwehapa. <verse eid="DEU 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 6:15" />Maghambu Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku, joabhili pachilanda jaku nde Chapanga joabhi na wihu, ngajihika kubhelela panani jako inyela jaka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku, na kukuyonanga kuhuma panani ja ndema.<verse eid="DEU 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 6:16" />“Ngamwandenga Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, ngati momwahengile ku Masa hoku. <verse eid="DEU 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 6:17" />Nkamulaje kwa ukangamalu shelia yaka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, na malaghalakilu ghaki, na amuli yaki yeandaghalakile. <verse eid="DEU 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 6:18" />Uhengaje lijambu lelipalika, na lambone, palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga, nahuli mambu ghaku ghakubhaje wichu, na upataje kujingila na kujitamila inchi jinyahi ambaju Bambo Chapanga akabhalapili kubhapekeha akahokolu bhaku, <verse eid="DEU 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 6:19" />kubha anaabhatopulaje kwa makili adui bhaku bhokapi palongi jaku, ngati Bambo Chapanga moakapwaghile.<verse eid="DEU 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 6:20" />“Mu machobha ghaghahika, anaakulalukili mwana waku, na kukupwaghila, ‘Malaghalakilu aghagha ndandi jaki kike, na amuli na shelia ayeyi yealaghalakile Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga witu?’ <verse eid="DEU 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 6:21" />Panihapa wampwaghila mwana wako, ‘Tepani tukabhili bhatumwa bhaka Falao ku Misili hoku, nambu Bambo Chapanga akatubhohiki tepani kuhuma ku Misili kwa chiwoku chaki chechibhili na makili. <verse eid="DEU 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 6:22" />Palongi ja mihu ghitu Bambo Chapanga akahengiki nginyulila na ngangachu ikolongwa, na ya kujoghoha, kwa bhandu bha inchi ja Misili, na panani jaka Falao, papamu na bhandu bhokapi bha munyumba jaki. <verse eid="DEU 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 6:23" />Nambu Chapanga akatubhohiki konihoku, na kutupekeha inchi jenjenu, ngati moakalapile kubha anaabhapekyaje akahokolu bhitu. <verse eid="DEU 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 6:24" />Bhela Bambo Chapanga akatulaghalakili kutii amuli yaki ayeyi yokapi, na tuntopilaje jombi Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga witu, nahuli tupataje kuneng'anela machobha ghokapi na kujendalela kutughoha kubha tabhomi ngati motubheli lalenu. <verse eid="DEU 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 6:25" />Ngati anatujendalili kubha na ukangamalu kuikamula amuli ayeyi yokapi palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga witu, ngati moakatulaghalaki tepani, panihapa anatukubhaje tujetakalewa na Chapanga.’<verse eid="DEU 6:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="DEU 7" />
  <para style="s">Bhandu bhabhahaghuliki na Chapanga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 34:11-16">Kubhoka 34:11-16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 7:1" />“Bhela Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, paampelakaje mu inchi jenjenda kujitola kwa makili na kubhatopola bhandu bha inchi yamaheli palongi jinu, inchi saba ikolongwa na yeibhi na makile: Bhahiti, Bhagiligashi, Bhaamoli, Bhakanaani, Bhapelizi, Bhahivi na Bhayebusi, <verse eid="DEU 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 7:2" />kabhete chikahi Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, paanjangatyaje kubhakamula na kubhaweza, panihapa impalika kubhayonanga nakanope. Ngamwihenga lulaghilu nabhu, wala ngamubhabhone chiha. <verse eid="DEU 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 7:3" />Ngamwitoghulana nabhu, wala ngamwatoghukela akakamwali bhinu kwa bhana bhabhu bha chikambaku, au bhana bhinu bha chikambaku ngabhitoghola akakamwali bhabhu. <verse eid="DEU 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 7:4" />Maghambu kwa kuhenga bhenibhela, anaantendaje mwana waku wa chikambaku ngayinyengalela nepani, nahuli apataje kuijojabhela ichapanga nayengi, na panihapa inyela jaka Bambo Chapanga anajibhelalaje panani jinu, najombi anaanjonangaje mwehapa manyata. <verse eid="DEU 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 7:5" />Nambu wehapa ubhatendilaje anana: Utunyulanaje pandu pabhu pa kubhokeha nyambiku, na ubombulanaje nguzu ya maganga ghabhu ghaghabhekakiki palongi ja ichapanga yabhu, muhekatanaje nguzu yabhu ya Ashela, na kuijocha imong'umong'u yabhu kwa moto. <verse eid="DEU 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 7:6" />Maghambu wehapa nde bhandu bha inchi jihuhu kwaka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu. Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku, anhawili mwehapa kubha bhandu bhaki mweni, kupeta bhandu bha inchi yokapi bhabhabhili panani ja ndema.<verse eid="DEU 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 7:7" />“Bambo Chapanga ngacheakumpaliki mwehapa na kunhaghula mwehapa kwa kubha mkabhili bhamaheli nakanope kupeta bhandu bhange, mwehapa mkabhili bhachokopi namaa kupeta bhandu bhokapi. <verse eid="DEU 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 7:8" />Nambu nde kwa ndandi Bambo Chapanga akumpaliki mwehapa na kughoha kulapa kwaki koakabhalapile akahokolu bhitu kubha anaamboha mwehapa kwa chiwoku chaki chechibhili na makili, na kunkombola mwehapa kuhuma mu inchi jemukabhili bhatumwa, na mabhoku ghaka Falao, nkolongwa wa Misili. <verse eid="DEU 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 7:9" />Bhela umanyaje kubha Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku, nde Chapanga, Chapanga ndongwana, joakamula lulaghilu lwaki lwa upalu kwa maelufu gha ibheleku ya bhala bhabhumpala na kuikamula amuli yaki. <verse eid="DEU 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 7:10" />Nambu kwa bhala bhabhunhakalila, anaabhalepaje palongi ja mihu ghabhu kwa kubhayonanga. Ngayikabhakile kubhalepa palongi ja mihu ghabhu bhala bhabhunhakalila. <verse eid="DEU 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 7:11" />Bhela, mkamulaje amuli yaki, shelia na malaghalakilu ghaki yenundaghalakila lalenu kuijengalela.<verse eid="DEU 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbengalelu kwa bhabhakamu shelia</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="DEU 28:1-14">Kombukombu la Tolati 28:1-14</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 7:12" />“Ngati ananjowanela shelia yenjenu kwa kuijengalela na kuitenda, bhela, Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, anaalughohaje lulaghilu lwaki lwa upalu na mwehapa, ngati moakabhalapile akahokolu bhinu. <verse eid="DEU 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 7:13" />Anaampala mwehapa na kumpengalela, nanamu ananjonjukikaje na kubha na bhabhelakeka bhamaheli, anaajipengalyaje mighonda jinu nahuli mpataje mahunu, divai na mahuta gha zeituni. Anaampengalyaje kwa kujonjukeka kwa mapogha gha ng'ombi hinu, na mapogha gha mambeleli ghinu mu inchi jela jeakalapike kubhapekeha akahokolu bhinu kubha anaampekya mwehapa. <verse eid="DEU 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 7:14" />Anampengaliwaje kupeta bhandu bha inchi yengi yokapi. Njeta mwanalomi wala mbomba pachilanda jinu joanalepaje kubha na bhana, wala hinyama hinu ya kudimakika ngayikubhi ngulumba. <verse eid="DEU 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 7:15" />Bambo Chapanga anaakulendaje na itamu yokapi. Chapanga ngayijegheli panani jaku itamu yokapi yela ya kujoghoa ngati yewimanyi ku Misili hoku, nambu anajeghalaje itamu panani ja bhokapi bhabhakuhakalila wehapa. <verse eid="DEU 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 7:16" />Impalika kubhayonanga bhandu bhokapi ambabhu Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, anaantendaje mubhawezaje. Ngamubhalingalila kwa kubhabhonela chiha, wala ngawaitumakila ichapanga yabhu, maghambu mambu ghanihagha anaghakubha chimbenda kwinu.<verse eid="DEU 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 7:17" />“Ngati anampwaghiki mu mitima jinu, ‘Bhandu bha inchi ayeyi nde bhamaheli kupeta tepani. Bho, anatuweza bholi kubhatopola?’ <verse eid="DEU 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 7:18" />Nambu ngamubhajoghopa, nkombukaje namaa ntundu Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, moakahengile kwaka Falao na inchi jokapi ja Misili. <verse eid="DEU 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 7:19" />Mkaghaweni kwa mihu ghinu mabheti malengakeku makolongwa, nginyulila na ngangachu ya kukangacha, na chiwoku chechibhili na makili, na chiwoku chechihatambwike, ambachu kwa chiwoku chenihechi Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, akumbohiki ku Misili. Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, anaabhatendilaje bhelabhela bhandu bhokapi bhamubhajoghopa sajenu. <verse eid="DEU 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 7:20" />Nakanopi ja ghanihagha, Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, anaatumaje manyiwa pachilanda jabhu, na kubhayonanga bhandu bhala ambabhu anabhatilaje nahuli kulihiya. <verse eid="DEU 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 7:21" />Ngamwijingiwa na choghoi kwa ndandi jabhu, kwa kubha Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, joabhili pachilanda jinu, nde Chapanga nkolongwa, na wa kujoghoha. <verse eid="DEU 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 7:22" />Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, anaabhatopulaje bhandu bha inchi yeniheyi pachoku pachoku. Ngamwiwezi kubhayonanga bhokapi kwa papamu, nangabhela, hinyama ya muchitengu inaijonjukikaje na kubha pambipi na mwehapa. <verse eid="DEU 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 7:23" />Nambu Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, anaantendaje mwehapa mubhawezaje bhandu bhanihabha, na kubhajeghela choghoi nakanopi mbaka bhayonangikaje nakanopi. <verse eid="DEU 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 7:24" />Anaantendaje mubhakamulaje bhakolongwa bhabhu, nanamu anamughahungulaje mahina ghabhu ghabhokaje pani pundema. Njeta mundu joanawezaje kujema palongi jinu, mbaka pamwijomulaje kubhayonanga bhokapi. <verse eid="DEU 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 7:25" />Mwijochaje kwa moto imong'umong'u ya kubacha ya ichapanga yabhu. Ngamwitokulela madini gha feza wala zahabu yabhu, wala ngamwitola na kuitenda kubha mali ghinu. Kuhenga bhenibhela anakukubhaje chimbenda kwinu, na nde lihakalilu kwaka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu. <verse eid="DEU 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 7:26" />Ngamwileta hindu ambayu nde lihakalilu mkati ja nyumba hinu, ngawihika wehapa kubha lihakalilu ngati chindu hechi, uchihakalyaje nakanope, na kuchikana nakanope, maghambu chenihechi nde chindu ambachu Bambo Chapanga achipekihi masolu.<verse eid="DEU 7:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="DEU 8" />
  <para style="s">Inchi jinyahi jenjenda kujitola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 8:1" />“Amuli yenjenu yenumpekeha lalenu, impalika kuikamula na kuijengalela wichu nahuli mpataje kutama na kujonjukeka, na muwezaje kujingila kujitamila inchi ambaju Bambo Chapanga akalaghili kwa kulapa kubhapekeha akahokolu bhino. <verse eid="DEU 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 8:2" />Nkombukaje ntundu Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, moakundongwihe mu indela jokapi mu lipololu kwa hyaka alobaini, nahuli kuntenda mulihelihaje na kundenga nahuli amanyaje ghamuholalela mu mitima jinu, na ngati anamkamulaje amuli yaki au ngabhela. <verse eid="DEU 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 8:3" />Akuntendiki mulihelihaje, na kuntenda mbonaje injala, na akundehiki kwa mana, chilebhi ambachu mwehapa na akahokolu bhinu ngachemkachimanye. Akahengiki bhenibhela nahuli apataje kumbola kubha mundu ngacheaweza kubha mwomi kwa kula libumunda pela, nambu atama kwa kila lilobhi lelipita mundomu waka Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="DEU 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 8:4" />Mu chikahi hechi cha hyaka alobaini ingobhu hinu ngacheyalalike, wala magholu ghinu ngacheghahimbike. <verse eid="DEU 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 8:5" />Bhela mmanyaje mkati ja mitima jinu kubha ngati mundu moandapulila mwana waki, bhenibhela nde Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, moanaandapula mwehapa. <verse eid="DEU 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 8:6" />Henu, mkamulaje amuli yaka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, nahuli mpataje kujenda mu indela yaki na kuntopela. <verse eid="DEU 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 8:7" />Kwa kubha Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, andeta mu inchi jinyahi, inchi jejibhili na ikoka, matanda gha machi, na chemuchemu yeinyila kumabondi na ku itombi, <verse eid="DEU 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 8:8" />inchi jejibhili na inganu na shayili, mizabibu na mitini, mikomamanga, mizeituni na buse, <verse eid="DEU 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 8:9" />inchi ambaju chilebhi ngachikepi na ngamwikosi chindu chokapi chela. Inchi ambaju matalaghu ghaki nde choma na muweza kukemba madini gha shaba kuhuma mu tutombi. <verse eid="DEU 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 8:10" />Chikahi pamwikubhaje mkuliki na kutupila, mundumbalyaje Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, kwa ndandi ja inchi jinyahi jeampekihe.<verse eid="DEU 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lilakalilu la kunjewa Bambo Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 8:11" />“Mlilingalyaje, ngamwihika kunjewa Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, kwa kulepalela kukamula amuli yaki, malaghalakilu ghaki, na shelia yaki yenundaghalakila lalenu. <verse eid="DEU 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 8:12" />Ndingalyaje, chikahi pamwikubha mkuliki na kutupila, na kulichengela nyumba hinyahi na kutama monihomu, <verse eid="DEU 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 8:13" />na chikahi mapogha ghinu gha ng'ombi na mambeleli paghijonjukikaje, na madini gha feza na zahabu paghikubhaje ghajonjukike, na kila chindu cheubhi nachu pachikubhaje chijonjukike, <verse eid="DEU 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 8:14" />bhela mitima jinu ngajikubha na ing'omu na kunjewa Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, joakumbohiki mu inchi ja Misili, pandu pamukabhili bhatumwa. <verse eid="DEU 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 8:15" />Jombi nde joakundongwihe mu lipololu lela likolongwa na la kujoghoha, lelibhili na majoka ghaghabhili na chikau, na ipeleli. Inchi jela jejibhili na inywita jangakubha na machi, jombi akumpikihi machi kuhuma mu litalaghu lelinonwipe. <verse eid="DEU 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 8:16" />Akumpekihi mana ja kula kulipololu, chilebhi ambachu akahokolu bhinu ngachebhachimanye. Akahengiki bhenibhela nahuli kuntenda mwehapa mlihelihaje na kundenga mwehapa, nahuli pakujomukela apataje kuntendela mambu ghambone. <verse eid="DEU 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 8:17" />Bhela, ulilingalyaje ngawalipwaghi muntima waku, ‘Uwezu wangu na makili gha mabhoku ghangu nde yeimbekihe wamaheli ghoni wa hindu.’ <verse eid="DEU 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 8:18" />Nambu mkombukaje Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, nde joampekeha mwehapa uwezu wa kupata hindu yamaheli. Ahenga bhenibhela nahuli kulujemakela lulaghilu lwaki loakabhapekihi akahokolu bhinu kwa kulapa, ngati mokubheli lalenu. <verse eid="DEU 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 8:19" />Nambu ngati anamunjewiki Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, na kuijengalela ichapanga nayengi, kwa kuitumakila na kuijojabhela, nundakalila mwehapa lalenu kubha chakaka anamyonangikaje. <verse eid="DEU 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 8:20" />Ngati ngachenjowanela sauti jaka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, ananjonangikaje ngati bhandu bha inchi nayengi, bhala ambabhu Bambo Chapanga abhayonanga palongi jinu.<verse eid="DEU 8:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="DEU 9" />
  <para style="s">Bhandu bhalepalela kutii</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 32:1-35">Kubhoka 32:1-35</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 9:1" />“Njowanyaje, mwenga Bhaizilaeli! Sajenu mheghalili kulomboka nkoka Yoludani kujenda kuitola inchi ikolongwa na yeibhi na bhandu bhabhabhi na makili kupeta mwehapa. Michi jabhu nde mikolongwa, jejibhi na lumatu loluhika kunani. <verse eid="DEU 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 9:2" />Bhandu bhabhatama konihoku nde bhalachu na bhabhi na makili, nde bhana bha Bhaanaki. Mmanyi malobhi ghabhu na njowini bhandu mobhapwaghila, ‘Bho, nde nane joaweza kujema palongi ja bhana bhaka Anaki?’ <verse eid="DEU 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 9:3" />Nambu lalenu mmanyaje chakaka kubha Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, nde joanaandongulyaje kulomboka palongi jinu ngati moto ghouyonanga. Najombi anaabhatopulaje na kubhayonanga manyata, ngati Bambo Chapanga moandaghile.<verse eid="DEU 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 9:4" />“Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, anaajomwili kubhatopola bhandu bhanihabha palongi jinu, ngamwipwagha mumitima jinu, ‘Bambo Chapanga atuletiki pambani kutama mu inchi jenjenu kwa ndandi ja wamboni witu.’ Ngabhela, nambu nde kwa ndandi ja uhakau wa bhandu bha inchi ayeyi nde ndandi Bambo Chapanga abhatopola palongi jinu. <verse eid="DEU 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 9:5" />Muweza kujitama inchi jabhu nga kwa ndandi mwehapa nde mabhandu bhambone au mabhandu mwembili na mitima jambone, nambu Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, abhatopola bhandu bha inchi ayeyi palongi jinu kwa ndandi ja uhakau wabhu, na kulitimiza lilobhi lela leakabhalapile akahokolu bhinu Ibulahimu, Isaka na Yakobo. <verse eid="DEU 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 9:6" />Bhela, mmanyaje kubha Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, ngacheampekeha inchi jenjenu jinyahi kujitama kwa ndandi ja wamboni winu, maghambu mwehapa nde mabhandu mwembi na hingu yeinonwipe.<verse eid="DEU 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 9:7" />“Mkombukaje na ngamwijewa ng'o ntundu momwakuntendile Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, kubha na inyela kulipololu kola. Kutumbula lichobha lela pamwabhokiki ku Misili mbaka lalenu pamuhikiki pambane, mbili mabhandu mwemumpenga Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="DEU 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 9:8" />Ku chitombi cha Holebu hoku, mwakuntendiki Bambo Chapanga kubha na inyela, bhela Bambo Chapanga akayomiki nakanopi, mbaka akapaliki kunjonanga mwehapa. <verse eid="DEU 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 9:9" />Panakweliki pachitombi kujenda kuijopalela ibau ibheli ya maganga, nayombi nde ibau ya lulaghilu loakahengiki Bambo Chapanga na mwehapa, nakatami kuchitombi machobha alobaini ikilu na muhi, ngachenakuliki chilebhi wala kunywa machi. <verse eid="DEU 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 9:10" />Bambo Chapanga akambekihi ibau ibheli ya maganga yeyalembakiki kwa lukonji lwaki mweni Chapanga. Panani ja ibau heyi pakalembakiki malobhi ghokapi ambaghu Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghili mwehapa pachitombi pala kuhuma mu moto mu lichobha la uhimanganu. <verse eid="DEU 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 9:11" />Pakujomukela machobha alobaini hagha ikilu na muhi, Bambo Chapanga akambekihi ibau ibheli ya maganga, ambayu nde ibau ya lulaghilu.<verse eid="DEU 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 9:12" />“Bhela Bambo Chapanga akambwaghile, ‘Uhelalaje pahi manyata, maghambu bhandu bhaku bhaubhabhohiki ku inchi ja Misili bhahobhike. Bhang'anambwiki manyata kuhuma mu indela jela jenabhalaghalakile, na kulilenganakela chimong'umong'u cha kuyeyusha.’<verse eid="DEU 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 9:13" />“Bhelabhela, Bambo Chapanga akambwaghile, ‘Nabhaweni bhandu abhabha kubha nde bhandu bhabhabhi na ing'omu namaa! <verse eid="DEU 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 9:14" />Unekaje, nahuli mbataje kubhayonanga, na kulihungula lihina labhu pani pundema. Nanatu ananukutendaje wehapa ukubhaje litaifa likolongwa na lelibhili na makili nakanopi kubhapeta bhombi.’<verse eid="DEU 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 9:15" />“Bhela, nakang'anambwiki na kuhelela kuhuma pachitombi, koni nakabya ndotwili ibau ibheli ya lulaghilu yela mumabhoku ghangu ghabheli, na koni moto ukabhi ubhelela pachitombi pala. <verse eid="DEU 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 9:16" />Panakalingalili, nakaweni kubha muntendiki mahoku Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, mkabhili mlilenganakili chimong'umongu cha kuyeyusha kwa liumbu la litoli la ng'ombi. Mng'anambwiki manyata na kujileka indela jela jeakundaghalakile Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="DEU 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 9:17" />Bhela, nakaikamwi kwa makili ibau ibheli yela kuhuma mu mabhoku ghangu ghabheli, na kuikajula ipandi ipandi palongi ja mihu ghinu. <verse eid="DEU 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 9:18" />Panihapa nakaghoni ukutama palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga kwa machobha alobaini ikilu na muhi. Ngachenakuliki libumunda wala kunywa machi, kwa ndandi ja mahoku ghinu ghokapi ghamwahengike, kwa kuhenga mahakau palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga, na kwa kuntenda kubha na inyela. <verse eid="DEU 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 9:19" />Nakajowipi inyela na imbuka yaka Bambo Chapanga, kwa kubha akunhyomili namaa mwehapa na kupala kunjonanga. Nambu Bambo Chapanga akanyowanili kabhete. <verse eid="DEU 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 9:20" />Bhelabhela Bambo Chapanga akamuyomili namaa Haluni, na akapaliki kunjonanga, nanatu nakundobhili Haluni chikahi chochochu. <verse eid="DEU 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 9:21" />Bhela nakatoliki chindu chela chihakau, yani chimong'umong'u cha litoli chemwalenganakile na kuchijocha pamoto. Nakajipondiki na kujiyagha nakanopi na kubha uhembi laini ngati luhombi, na kulujitila luhombi holu mu chikoka chechinyilikaje kuhuma pachitombi.<verse eid="DEU 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 9:22" />“Bhelabhela mwakuntendiki Bambo Chapanga kubha na inyela chikahi pamukabhi ku Tabela, ku Masa na ku Kibuloti Hataava. <verse eid="DEU 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 9:23" />Na chikahi Bambo Chapanga paakabhatumiki kuhuma ku Kadeshi Balinea, akapwaghike, ‘Nkwelaje, mkajitolaje inchi jenumpekihe mwehapa.’ Nambu mwehapa mkapengiki lilaghalakilu laka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu. Ngachemunhobhalili wala kunjowanela sauti jaki. <verse eid="DEU 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 9:24" />Mwehapa mbili mumpenga Bambo Chapanga kutumbula lichobha panakummanyi mwehapa.<verse eid="DEU 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 9:25" />“Bhela, nakaghonili ukutama palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga kwa machobha ghala alobaini, ikilu na muhi, maghambu Bambo Chapanga akabhili apwaghiki kubha anaanjonangaje. <verse eid="DEU 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 9:26" />Nukundobhiki Bambo Chapanga, nakapwaghaje, ‘Wenga wa Bambo Chapanga, ngaubhayonanga bhandu bhaku, bhandu bhaku wamwete, bhaubhakombwile kwa uwezu waku ukolongwa, na kubhabhoha kuhuma mu inchi ja Misili kwa chiwoku chaku chechibhili na makile. <verse eid="DEU 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 9:27" />Ubhakombukaje bhatumika bhaku Ibulahimu, Isaka na Yakobo. Ngawilingalila ing'omu ya bhandu abhabha, wala uhakau wabhu, wala mahoku ghabhu.’ <verse eid="DEU 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 9:28" />Bhandu bha inchi jela jeutubhohike ngabhihika kupwagha, ‘Bambo Chapanga ngacheakaweziki kubhatola mbaka mu inchi jela jeakabhalaghile, maghambu akatei kubhahakalila, na akabhaletiki kunja nahuli ahikaje kubhakoma kulipololu. <verse eid="DEU 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 9:29" />Nambu bhombi nde bhandu bhaku, bhandu bhaku wamwete, bhandu ambabhu ukabhabhohiki ku Misili kwa makili ghaku makolongwa na kwa chiwoku chaku chechihatambwike.’<verse eid="DEU 9:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="DEU 10" />
  <para style="s">Musa ajopalela kabhete Amuli Komi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 34:1-10">Kubhoka 34:1-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 10:1" />“Bhela chikahi chela Bambo Chapanga akambwaghile, ‘Ubachaje ibau ibheli ya maganga ngati yela ya kutumbula, na uhika nayu kongoni panani ja chitombi. Bhelabhela ulenganakyaje na lisanduku la mbau. <verse eid="DEU 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 10:2" />Nanatu ananembaje panani ja ibau yeniheyi malobhi ghaghakabhile panani ja ibau ya kutumbula, ambayu wehapa ukatehi kwiheketa. Panihapa waibhekaje mkati ja lisanduku la mbau heli.’<verse eid="DEU 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 10:3" />“Bhela nakalenganakili lisanduku kwa mbau ya nkongu wa mshita, na nakalenganakili ibau ibheli ya maganga ngati yela ya kutumbula. Panihapa nakakweliki panani pachitombi koni nakabya ndotwile ibau ibheli mumabhoku ghangu. <verse eid="DEU 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 10:4" />Bhela Bambo Chapanga akalembiki panani ja ibau yeniheyi malobhi ghala ghala ngati ghaakabhili aghalembiki pakutumbula. Amuli Komi ambayu Bambo Chapanga akabhili ampwaghile panani pachitombi, kuhuma mu moto mu lichobha lela la kuhimangana. Panihapa Bambo Chapanga akambekihi nepani. <verse eid="DEU 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 10:5" />Panihapa nakahelili kuhuma pachitombi na kuibheka ibau heyi mkati ja lisanduku lenakalenganakile, na ibhili konihoku mbaka sajenu, ngati Bambo Chapanga moakanaghalakile.”<verse eid="DEU 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 10:6" />Bhaizilaeli bhakabhokiki kuhuma ku ilibha ya Bene Yaakani mbaka ku Mosela. Konihoku Haluni akapotili na kutaghakika, najombi Eleazali mwana waka Haluni, akatoliki pandu paki pa lihengu ngati mpenganyambiku. <verse eid="DEU 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 10:7" />Kuhuma panihapa, bhakajendalili na mwanja mbaka ku Gudigoda, na kuhuma ku Gudigoda mbaka ku Yotibata, inchi jejibhi na ikoka yamaheli ya machi. <verse eid="DEU 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 10:8" />Chikahi chenihechi Bambo Chapanga akalihawili likabila la Lawi kulitotola lisanduku la lulaghilu laka Bambo Chapanga, nahuli bhajemaje palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga na kuntumakila ngati bhapenganyambiku, na kubhapengalela bhandu kwa lihina laki, ngati mobhahengela mbaka lalenu. <verse eid="DEU 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 10:9" />Jeniheji nde ndandi Bhalawi ngachebhabhili na pandu pa inchi jebhakapekiwi kubha jabhu papamu na bhalongu bhabhu. Chebhakajopalili nde utopelu wa kubha bhapenganyambiku bhaka Bambo Chapanga, ngati Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga wabhu moakabhapwaghile.<verse eid="DEU 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 10:10" />“Bhela nepani nakatami kuchitombi kwa machobha alobaini ikilu na muhi, ngati monahengile pakutumbula hapa. Bambo Chapanga akanyowanili kabhete chikahi chenihechi, na akajetakili kubha ngaanjonange. <verse eid="DEU 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 10:11" />Bhela Bambo Chapanga akambwaghile: Ubhokaje, ujendalyaje na mwanja waku wa kubhalongoha bhandu mu indela jabhu nahuli bhawezaje kujingila na kujitola inchi jela jenakalapike kubhapekeha akahokolu bhabhu.<verse eid="DEU 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cheapala Bambo Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 10:12" />“Sajenu, wenga wa Izilaeli, Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku, apala kike kwaku wehapa nambu kunjojabhela Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku, na kujenda mu indela yaki, kumpala na kuntumakila Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku, kwa mtima waku wokapi na kwa roho jaku jokapi, <verse eid="DEU 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 10:13" />na kukamula malaghalakilu ghaka Bambo Chapanga na amuli yaki yenukulaghalakila lalenu, kwa ndandi ja nyonjeka jaku wamwete? <verse eid="DEU 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 10:14" />Lingalyaje, mbengu na hata mbengu ya kunani nakanope, ndema na yokapi yeibhili mkati jaki nde mali ghaka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku. <verse eid="DEU 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 10:15" />Hata bhela Bambo Chapanga akabhahekalili na kubhapala namaa akahokolu bhinu, akunhawili mwehapa bhabhelakeka bhabhu baada ja bhombi kubha bhandu bhaki, kupeta bhandu bha inchi ghokapi, ngati mokubhelile lalenu. <verse eid="DEU 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 10:16" />Bhela mujigholulaje mitima jinu, na ngamwikubha na ing'omu kabhete. <verse eid="DEU 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 10:17" />Maghambu Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, nde Chapanga wa ichapanga, na Bambo wa mabambo. Jombi nde Chapanga nkolongwa na joabhi na makili, na wa kujoghoha, jwangakulingalila sula ya bhandu, wala ngacheajopa ngolukelu. <verse eid="DEU 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 10:18" />Abhahengela bhana bhakebha, na akambomba bhabhaweliwi na bhalomi bhabhu utemulu ngati moaipalakila, ampala ngeni na kumpekeha chilebhi na ingobhu. <verse eid="DEU 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 10:19" />Bhela, mumpalaje ngeni, maghambu mwehapa mabhete mkabhili bhagheni ku inchi ja Misili. <verse eid="DEU 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 10:20" />Untopilaje Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku, na untumakyaje jombi pela. Ukamulana naku na kulapa kwa lihina lake. <verse eid="DEU 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 10:21" />Jombi nde joupalika kundumbalika, najombi nde Chapanga waku, joakuhengile mambu aghagha makolongwa, gha kujoghoha ghaughaweni kwa mihu ghaku wamwete. <verse eid="DEU 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 10:22" />Akahokolu bhinu bhakahelili kujenda ku inchi ja Misili na bhandu sabini, nambu sajenu Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, antendiki mwehapa kubha bhamaheli ngati ndondwa ya kunani.<verse eid="DEU 10:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="DEU 11" />
  <para style="s">Ukolongwa waka Bambo Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 11:1" />“Kwa ndandi jeniheji, umpalaje Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku, na kukamula machobha ghokapi ghala ghaaghapala Chapanga, amuli yaki, shelia yaki na malaghalakilu ghaki. <verse eid="DEU 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 11:2" />Nanamu lalenu mmanyaje, kubha ngachenongela na akakombu bhinu ambabhu ngachebhakamanyi, wala ngachebhakaweni utemulu waka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, na chiwoku chaki chechibhi na makili, na uwezu waki ukolongwa, <verse eid="DEU 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 11:3" />na nginyulila yaki, na mambu ghokapi ghaakahengiki ku Misili, kwaka Falao nkolongwa wa Misili na inchi jaki jokapi, <verse eid="DEU 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 11:4" />na ntundu moakalihengile linjolinjoli lokapi la Misili, falasi yabhu, na magali ghabhu gha kuhutakika gha ngondo, ntundu moakabhajibhihe mu machi gha Bahali ja Shamu pabhakabhili bhunjengalela mwehapa, na ntundu Bambo Chapanga moakabhayonangile mbaka lalenu. <verse eid="DEU 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 11:5" />Bhelabhela mmanyaje kubha nga bhana bhinu bhabhakaghaweni mambu ghala Bambo Chapanga ghaakuntendile mwehapa ku lipololu hoku, mangane ja kuhika pambane, <verse eid="DEU 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 11:6" />na wala mambu ghala ghaakahengiki kwaka Datani na Abilamu, bhana bhaka Eliabu wa likabila laka Leubeni, chikahi ndema paukahowili ndomu waki pachilanda ja bhandu bhokapi bha Izilaeli, na kubhamila papamu na bhala bhabhakabhili munyumba yabhu, mu mahema ghabhu na kila chindu chechakabhili chomi ambachu chakabhili mali ghabhu. <verse eid="DEU 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 11:7" />Nambu mihu ghinu mwehapa mabhete nde ghaghakaweni mambu ghanihagha makolongwa ghaakahengiki Bambo Chapanga.<verse eid="DEU 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbengalelu ya inchi ja chilanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 11:8" />“Bhela nkamulaje malaghalakilu ghokapi ghanumpekeha mwehapa lalenu, nahuli mpataje kubha na makili gha kujingila na kujitola kwa makili inchi ambaju ndomboka nkoka Yoludani kujenda kujitola kubha jinu, <verse eid="DEU 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 11:9" />nahuli mpataje kutama machobha ghamaheli mu inchi jela ambaju Bambo Chapanga akalapiki kubhapekeha akahokolu bhinu, kubha anaabhapekya bhombi na chibheleku chabhu, inchi jejitwelile mahibha na buse. <verse eid="DEU 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 11:10" />Inchi jenjingila kujenda kujitola ngachejilengana na inchi ja Misili komuhuma, ambaku mkabhili mpanda imbeju hinu na kuijitalila machi kwa magholu, ngati ngonda wa likolo. <verse eid="DEU 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 11:11" />Nambu inchi jendomboka kujenda kujitola, nde inchi ja itombi na mabondi, jipata machi gha iyula kuhuma kunani kumahunde. <verse eid="DEU 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 11:12" />Jeniheji nde inchi jejighohakeka na Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, na mihu ghaka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, ghajilingalila chikahi chokapi kutumbula pachitumbula chaka mbaka ujomukelu wa chaka.<verse eid="DEU 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 11:13" />“Bhela ngati anamkamula kwa chakaka malaghalakilu ghangu ghanundaghalakila lalenu, kwa kumpala Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, na kuntumakila jombi kwa mitima jinu jokapi na roho hinu yokapi, <verse eid="DEU 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 11:14" />panihapa anaajinelilaje iyula inchi jinu kwa chikahi chaki, ihula ja chihuku na ihula ja palumu, nahuli mpataje kuhuna mahunu ghinu, divai jahenu na mahuta gha zeituni. <verse eid="DEU 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 11:15" />Nanatu ananumpekyaje manyonyoli kwa ndandi ja ng'ombi hinu, na mwehapa anamkulaje na kutupila. <verse eid="DEU 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 11:16" />Nambu mlilingalyaje, ngamwahika kukoluweka na kung'anambuka na kujojabhela ichapanga nayengi na kuichikamila. <verse eid="DEU 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 11:17" />Ngati anamtendiki bhenibhela, inyela jaka Bambo Chapanga anaimbelalyaje mwehapa, najombi anaakongaje mbengu nahuli iyula ngajitonya na inchi ngajipiha mahunu ghaki, nanamu anamuyonangikaje manyata mu inchi jinyahi jempekewa na Bambo Chapanga.<verse eid="DEU 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 11:18" />“Bhela mghabhekaje malobhi ghangu aghagha mu mitima jinu na mu roho hinu, mghakongaje ghakubhaje nginyulila ja kunkomboha panani ja mabhoku ghinu, na pa ibhongi ya pamihu jinu. <verse eid="DEU 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 11:19" />Mubhabholaje bhana bhinu, mghalongilaje chikahi pamtama panyumba na chikahi panjenda mwindela, chikahi pangonela na chikahi panjumuka. <verse eid="DEU 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 11:20" />Bhelabhela mghalembaje mu ngelakete ya milyangu ja nyumba hinu na mu milyangu jinu mikolongwa ja michi, <verse eid="DEU 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 11:21" />nahuli machobha ghinu na machobha gha bhana bhinu ghapataje kubha ghamaheli mu inchi jela ambaju Bambo Chapanga akalapiki kubhapekeha akahokolu bhinu. Ananjendalyaje kutama mu inchi jeniheji ngati mbengu mojijendalela kutama panani ja ndema.<verse eid="DEU 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 11:22" />“Bhela ngati anamkamwili kwa chakaka malaghalakilu aghagha ghokapi ghanumpekeha kughajengalela, gha kumpala Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, na kujenda mu indela yaki yokapi na kukamulana naku kwa ulongwana, <verse eid="DEU 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 11:23" />panihapa Bambo Chapanga anaabhatopulaje bhandu bha inchi ayeyi yokapi palongi jinu, nanamu anamubhatopulaje bhandu bha inchi ikolongwa na bhabhabhi na makili kupeta mwehapa. <verse eid="DEU 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 11:24" />Kila pandu pamwikanyataje kwa magholu ghinu anapakubha pinu. Inchi jinu anajijaghanyaje kutumbula ku lipololu upambala wa kunkache, mbaka ku itombi ya Lebanoni upambala wa kungonde, na kuhuma ku nkoka Eufulati upambala wa kolipita lyobha, mbaka ku Bahali ja Meditelania, upambala wa kolijibhi lyobha. <verse eid="DEU 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 11:25" />Ngapikubhi na mundu joanawezaje kunhibhalakila palongi jinu. Na pokapi pamwijendaje mu inchi jeniheji, Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, anaabhatendaje bhandu bhunjoghupaje mwehapa, ngati moakundaghile.<verse eid="DEU 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 11:26" />“Ndingalyaje, lalenu mekiki palongi jinu mbengalelu na masolu. <verse eid="DEU 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 11:27" />Mbengalelu anamkubha nayu ngati anamkamula amuli yaka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, yenumpekeha lalenu. <verse eid="DEU 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 11:28" />Nambu masolu anamkubha naghu ngati ngechemkamula amuli yaka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, na kujileka indela ambaju nundaghalakila lalenu, kwa kujengalela ichapanga nayengi, ambayu ngachemwimanye. <verse eid="DEU 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 11:29" />Chikahi Bambo Chapanga payikubhaje andetiki mu inchi jendomboka kujenda kujitola kubha jinu, mkatangaza mbengalelu kuhuma ku chitombi cha Gelizimu, na mkatangaza masolu kuhuma pachitombi cha Ebali. <verse eid="DEU 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 11:30" />Ngati mommanyila, itombi ayeyi ibhili kwihi ja nkoka Yoludani, upambala wa kolijibhi lyobha, kujenda ku upambala wa kolipita lyobha, pambipi na mikongu mikolongwa ja ku muchi wa Mole, mu inchi ja Bhakanaani bhabhatama ku Alaba, pambipi na ku Giligali. <verse eid="DEU 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 11:31" />Mwehapa muheghalile kulomboka kwihi ja nkoka Yoludani na kujenda kujitama inchi jela jeampekeha Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu. Chikahi pamwikubhaje mjitoliki na kutama monihomu, <verse eid="DEU 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 11:32" />impalika kuikamula amuli na shelia yokapi yenibheka palongi jinu mwehapa lalenu.<verse eid="DEU 11:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="DEU 12" />
  <para style="s">Pandu pa kanjika pa kujojabhela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 12:1" />“Hayeyi nde amuli na shelia ambayu impalika kuikamula na kuijengalela mu inchi ambaju Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga wa akahokolu bhinu, ampekihi kubha jinu, kwa chikahi chokapi pamwikubhaje mtama mu inchi jeniheji. <verse eid="DEU 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 12:2" />Mpayonangaje nakanopi pandu pabhu pa kujojabhela mu itombi ilachu, tutombi na pahi ja kila nkongu ukolongwa ghoubhili na mahamba mabhei, ambamu bhandu bha inchi ayeyi bhanjenda kutola inchi jabhu bhaijojabhela ichapanga yabhu. <verse eid="DEU 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 12:3" />Mbombulaje pandu pabhu pa kujojabhela, mbombulaje nguzu ya maganga yebhajojabhela, njochaje moto nguzu yabhu ya Ashela, na imong'umong'u ya ichapanga yabhu ya kubacha, na muhungulaje mahina ghabhu pandu panihapa.<verse eid="DEU 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 12:4" />“Wala ngamwanjojabhela Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, ngati mobhajojabhela bhombi ichapanga yabhu. <verse eid="DEU 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 12:5" />Nambu mwijendaje pandu ambapu Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, anaapahaghulaje, mu makabila ghinu ghokapi nahuli kulibheka lihina laki na matamu ghaki panihapa, konihoku nde kompalika mwehapa kujenda kunjojabhela. <verse eid="DEU 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 12:6" />Mpelakaje nyambiku hinu ya kujochakeka, na nhupu hinu, na zaka hinu, na michangu jinu, yela yemwalaghile kubhoha, nhupu hinu ya kupala mabhete, na bhabhelakeka bha kutumbula bha mapogha ghinu gha ng'ombi na mambeleli. <verse eid="DEU 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 12:7" />Konihoku anamkulaje palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, mwehapa papamu na bhandu bha munyumba hinu, muhekalyaje kwa kila chindu chekipatakine kubhokana na lihengu la mabhoku ghinu, maghambu Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, atehi kumpengalela.<verse eid="DEU 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 12:8" />“Ngamwihenga ngati motuhengela sajenu pambane, kila mundu ngati moapalila kuhenga mweni pamihu jake, <verse eid="DEU 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 12:9" />maghambu mwakali ngakuhika pandu pamwitamaje kwa lukwali, pandu ambapu Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu atenda kumpekeha. <verse eid="DEU 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 12:10" />Nambu pamwilombukaje nkoka Yoludani na kutama mu inchi ambaju Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, ampekeha kubha jinu, najombi anaantendiki kutama kwa lukwali, na kunkengalela kubhokana na adui bhinu nahuli mtamaje kwa lukwali, <verse eid="DEU 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 12:11" />bhela konihoku pandu ambapu Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, anaapahaghulaje nahuli lihina laki litamaje, panihapa nde pamwipelakaje kila chindu chenundaghalakila: Nyambiku hinu ya kujochakeka, na nhupu hinu, na zaka hinu, na michangu jinu, papamu na hindu hinu ya mbija yamaheli yemwalaghile kumbokeha Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="DEU 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 12:12" />Panihapa muhekalyaje palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, mwehapa papamu na bhana bhinu bha chikambaku, akakamwali bhinu, bhatumika bhinu bha chikambaku na bha chimbomba, na Bhalawi bhabhatama mu michi jinu, maghambu bhombi ngachebhabhili na pandu pabhu bheni pabhapekiwi pachilanda jinu. <verse eid="DEU 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 12:13" />Mlilingalyaje, ngamwibhoha nyambiku hinu ya kujochakeka kila pandu pamupabhona. <verse eid="DEU 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 12:14" />Mwibhoha pela mu pandu pala ambapu Bambo Chapanga anaapahaghulaje mu pandu pamu pa makabila ghinu. Panihapa nde pamwibhohaje nyambiku hinu ya kujochakeka, na pamwihengaje kila lijambu lenundaghalakila.<verse eid="DEU 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 12:15" />“Hata bhela muweza kuichinja hinyama hinu mu michi jinu jokapi jela na kula inyama jamaheli mompalila ngati ananchinjiki holoku au mbabhala, kulengana na mbengalelu yeanaampekyaje Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu. Mundu joajetakalewa palongi jaka Chapanga au mundu mhakau aweza kula inyama jeniheji. <verse eid="DEU 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 12:16" />Nambu ngamwikula mwahi ng'o, ujitalaje mwahi hoghu panani ja luhombi ngati machi. <verse eid="DEU 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 12:17" />Ngamwikula hindu ayeyi pandu pamtama: Zaka ya mahunu ghinu, wala divai hinu, wala mahuta ghinu gha zeituni, wala bhabhelakeka bha kutumbula bha mapogha gha ng'ombi, na mapogha gha mambeleli, wala chindu chokapi chendaghile kuchibhoha ngati nhupu, wala nhupu ya kupala mabheti, wala nhupu yengi yokapi. <verse eid="DEU 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 12:18" />Nambu mwikulaje hindu yeniheyi palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, pandu ambapu Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, anaapahaghulaje. Mwikulaje mwehapa papamu na bhana bhinu bha chikambaku na bha chimbomba, bhatumika bhinu bha chikambaku na bha chimbomba, na Bhalawi bhabhatama mu michi jinu. Impalika kuhekalela palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, mu mambu ghokapi ghamwihengaje kwa mabhoku ghinu. <verse eid="DEU 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 12:19" />Bhelabhela impalika ngamubhajewa Bhalawi, chikahi chokapi pamwitamaje mu inchi jinu.<verse eid="DEU 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 12:20" />“Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, payikubhaje ajijonjukili inchi jinu ngati moakalaghile, nanamu pamwipwaghaje, ‘Mbala kula inyama,’ kwa kubha roho jaku jitokulela kula inyama, panihapa uweza kula inyama ngati roho jaku mojipalila. <verse eid="DEU 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 12:21" />Ngati pandu ambapu Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, anaapahaghulaje kubheka lihina laki nde patali nakanopi kuhuma kwinu, muweza kuchinja hinyama kuhuma mu mapogha ghinu gha ng'ombi au mambeleli ambaghu Bambo Chapanga ampengalili mwehapa, ngati monundaghalakile, na muweza kula inyama jamaheli ngati mompalila anambili mu michi jino. <verse eid="DEU 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 12:22" />Mkulaje inyama jeniheji ngati momkulila inyama ja holoku au inyama ja mbabhala. Mundu jokapi aweza kula, jola joajetakalewa palongi jaka Chapanga au mhakau. <verse eid="DEU 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 12:23" />Nambu ndingalyaje kubha impalika ngamwikula mwahi, maghambu mwahi nde womi, bhela ngamwikula womi papamu na inyama ng'o. <verse eid="DEU 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 12:24" />Ngamwikula mwahi ng'o, njitalaje mwahi hoghu panani ja luhombi ngati machi. <verse eid="DEU 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 12:25" />Ngamwikula mwahi ng'o, nahuli mpataje kuneng'anela mwehapa papamu na bhana bhinu baada jinu mwehapa, maghambu anamkubha mlihenga lijambu lelipalika palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="DEU 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 12:26" />Nambu mtolaje hindu hinu yemumbokili Bambo Chapanga, na nhupu hinu yendaghili kuibhoha, na kujenda nayu pandu pala paapahawili Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="DEU 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 12:27" />Ndetaje nyambiku hinu ya kujochakeka, inyama na mwahi, pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku paka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu. Mwahi wa nyambiku heji mmichaje munkeghi ja pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku paka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, nambu inyama ja chinyama hechi muweza kula. <verse eid="DEU 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 12:28" />Impalika kughakamula malaghalakilu aghagha ghokapi ghanumpekeha, nahuli machobha ghokapi mpataje kuneng'anela, mwehapa papamu na bhana bhinu baada jinu mwehapa, maghambu anamkubhaje mlihenga lijambu lamboni na lelipalika palongi ja mihu ghaka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu.<verse eid="DEU 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lilakalilu la kujojabhela imong'umong'u</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 12:29" />“Chikahi Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, payikubhaje abhayoningi bhandu bha inchi yeibhi palongi jinu, ambabhu henu kateki anamubhalapulaje na kubhatopola, na mwehapa kutama mu inchi jabhu, <verse eid="DEU 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 12:30" />na baada ja kuyonangeka palongi jinu, mlilingalyaje ngamwihika kujingila mu chimbenda kwa kulalukila malobhi gha ichapanga yabhu, mkapwaghaje, ‘Bho, bhandu bha inchi ayeyi bhajojabhe bholi ichapanga yabho? Natatu anatuhenga bhelabhela.’ <verse eid="DEU 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 12:31" />Ngamwanjojabhela Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, kwa indela yebhajojabhela ichapanga yabhu ng'o, maghamu pabhajojabhela ichapanga yabhu, bhahenga kila ntundu wa mahakalilu ghaaghahakalila Bambo Chapanga. Hata kubhajocha bhana bhabhu bha chikambaku na bha chimbomba pa moto, nahuli kubhoha nyambiku kwa ichapanga yabhu.<verse eid="DEU 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 12:32" />“Ndingalyaje kubha impalika kuhenga kila chindu chenundaghalakila, ngamwijonjukela chindu, wala ngamwipunguza chindu.<verse eid="DEU 12:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="DEU 13" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 13:1" />“Ngati anaapitalili mlota, au mundu joalota kwa indela ja ndoto pachilanda jinu, na kumpwaghila nginyulila au ngangachu, <verse eid="DEU 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 13:2" />na nginyulila au ngangachu heji anajipitalile, najombi anaapwaghiki, ‘Tujengalyaje ichapanga nayengi, ichapanga ambayu ngachemwimanyi, na kuitumakila,’ <verse eid="DEU 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 13:3" />ngamwijowanela malobhi ghaka mlota hoju au mundu jola joalota ndoto. Maghambu Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, atenda kundenga nahuli abhonaje ngati anamumpala kwa mitima jinu jokapi na kwa roho hinu yokapi. <verse eid="DEU 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 13:4" />Munjengalyaje na kuntopela Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, kwa kukamula amuli yaki na kutii sauti jaki, muntumakya jombi na kukamulana naku jombi. <verse eid="DEU 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 13:5" />Nambu mlota hoju au mundu jola joalota kwa ndoto apalika akomakikaje, maghambu atangizi uasi panani jaka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, joakumbohiki kuhuma mu inchi ja Misili na kunkombola mwehapa kuhuma mu inchi jemkabhi bhatumwa, nahuli mjilekaje indela ambaju Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, akundaghalakili mjijengalyaje. Bhenibhela nde momwitendilaje nahuli kubhoha uhakau pachilanda jinu.<verse eid="DEU 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 13:6" />“Ngati ndongu waku wa lutumbu lumu, au mwana waku wa chikambaku, au mwali waku, au nhwanu waku joumpala nakanopi, au nkochi waku wa pambipi nakanopi, anaakupwaghili kwa sili, ‘Tumbokaje tukajojabyaje ichapanga nayengi,’ ichapanga ambayu mwehapa wala akahokolu bhinu ngachemwimanyi, <verse eid="DEU 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 13:7" />au ichapanga ya bhandu bhabhunyongolota mwehapa, bhabhatama kutali au pambipi, kutumbula ujomukelu ghumu wa ndema mbaka ujomukelu ghongi wa ndema, <verse eid="DEU 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 13:8" />ngawijetakela kokuluheka wala kunjowanela. Wala lihu laku ngalambonela chiha, wala ngawandeka abhokaje, wala kunhiya. <verse eid="DEU 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 13:9" />Chakaka ikupalika unkomaje! Ikupalika chiwoku chaku chikubhaje cha kutumbula kunkoma, na panihapa nde mabhoku gha bhandu bhangi bhokapi ghaweza kunkoma. <verse eid="DEU 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 13:10" />Mundapulaje kwa maganga mbaka apotilaje! Maghambu akalengiki kukung'anambula ubhokaje kwaka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku, joakakubhohiki kuhuma ku inchi ja Misili, mu inchi jeukabhi untumwa. <verse eid="DEU 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 13:11" />Bhela Bhaizilaeli bhokapi anabhajowanaje na kujoghopa, wala njeta mundu jokapi pachilanda jinu joanahengaje uhakau kabhete.”<verse eid="DEU 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 13:12" />“Ngati ananjowini ipwaghakika kubha ghumu wa michi ambaju Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, ampekeha ntamaje mkati jaki, <verse eid="DEU 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 13:13" />kupitalili akanalomi bhabhabhi na milomu pachilanda jinu, na kubhahoa bhandu bha muchi, bhakapwaghaje, ‘Tumbokanyaje tukajojabyaje ichapanga nayengi,’ ichapanga ambayu mwehapa ngachemwimanyi, <verse eid="DEU 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 13:14" />panihapa anaimpalikaje kulalukila, kupema na kuchunguza kwa mkati nakanope. Ngati nde chakaka, kubha lijambu leniheli la kuhakaliha lihengakiki pachilanda jinu, <verse eid="DEU 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 13:15" />chakaka impalika mubhakomaje bhenehi bha muchi ghonihoghu kwa lipanga. Muuyonangaje nakanopi muchi hoghu, papamu na hindu yokapi yeibhi monihomu, na hinyama yokapi ya kudimakika kwa lipanga. <verse eid="DEU 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 13:16" />Mbonganaje hindu yokapi yentoliki kwa makili mu muchi na kuipeleka mbaka pa uwanda wa lubhanja lwa muchi na kuujocha nakanopi muchi hoghu kwa moto, papamu na hindu yokapi yentoliki kwa makili ngati nyambiku ja kujochakeka kwaka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu. Muchi hoghu anauhighalya mahame mileli, na wala ngawichengakeki kabhete. <verse eid="DEU 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 13:17" />Ngamwitola mu mabhoku ghinu chindu chokapi chechibhohakiki chiyonangikaje, nahuli Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, ang'anambulaje inyela jaki ngolongwa. Anaambonilaje chihomu na chiha, na kuntenda ubhalangiku winu ujonjukikaje, ngati moakabhalaghile akahokolu bhinu, <verse eid="DEU 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 13:18" />kwa kubha pela untii Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku, ngati anaukamwili amuli yaki yokapi yenukulaghalakila lalenu, na kuhenga lela lelibhi lamboni palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku.<verse eid="DEU 13:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="DEU 14" />
  <para style="s">Ntetu wa maombulezu ghoukanakiwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 14:1" />“Mwehapa nde bhana bhaka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu. Ngamwaliheketa nembu hyegha hinu, wala ngamwimogha lupanja pamutu jinu kwa ndandi jaka mundu joapotile. <verse eid="DEU 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 14:2" />Maghambu mwehapa nde mabhandu bhahuhu bhaka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu. Bambo Chapanga anhawili mwehapa kubha bhandu bhaki mweni, kupeta bhandu bha inchi yokapi yeibhi pundema.<verse eid="DEU 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hinyama yeijetakaliwi na yeikanakika palongi jaka Chapanga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LEV 11:1-47">Bhalawi 11:1-47</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 14:3" />“Ngamwikula chindu chokapi chela changakujetakalewa palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="DEU 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 14:4" />Hayeyi nde hinyama yemuweza kula inyama yabhu: Ng'ombi, limbeleli, imbuhi, <verse eid="DEU 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 14:5" />mbabhala, holoku, kongoni, imbuhi ja muchitengu, holoku jihuhu, pofu na imbuhi ja muchitombi. <verse eid="DEU 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 14:6" />Muweza kula kila chinyama chechikajwiki lingolokoto mala pabheli, na kubokola na kumemena kabhete. <verse eid="DEU 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 14:7" />Nambu, pachilanda ja hinyama yela yeibokola na kukajuka lingolokoto ngamwikula ngamia, kipecha na chibhela. Kwa kubha itenda kubokola, nambu ngacheikajwiki ngolokoto yabhu mala pabheli, yeniheyi anayuntenda ngamwijetakalewa palongi jaka Chapanga. <verse eid="DEU 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 14:8" />Bhelabhela ngamwikula ligholobhi, kwa kubha likajwiki lingolokoto mala pabheli, nambu ngachelibokola, jonihoju nde mhakau kwinu. Ngamwikula inyama yabhu, wala ngamwikamula mituhi jabhu.<verse eid="DEU 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 14:9" />“Kwa ihumbi yokapi yeitama mumachi: Muweza kula kila chechibhili na mapezi na mang'amba. <verse eid="DEU 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 14:10" />Nambu kila chekitama mumachi changakubha na mapezi na mang'amba ngamwikula, yeniheyi anayuntenda ngamwijetakalewa palongi jaka Chapanga.<verse eid="DEU 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 14:11" />“Muweza kula chijuni chokapi chela chechijetakalewa palongi jaka Chapanga. <verse eid="DEU 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 14:12" />Nambu ngamwikula hijuni hayeyi: Ngwahe, fulukombe, kapongu, <verse eid="DEU 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 14:13" />kengewa, kozi, na limbanga kwa ntundu waki, <verse eid="DEU 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 14:14" />na likongolu kwa ntundu waki, <verse eid="DEU 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 14:15" />mbuni, kihombandela, litipitipi, na chununkwangula kwa ntundu waki, <verse eid="DEU 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 14:16" />litungutu, mumbi, linhinhita, <verse eid="DEU 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 14:17" />mwali, ndeli, mnandi, <verse eid="DEU 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 14:18" />kolongo, koikoi kwa ntundu waki, hudihudi, na lilemalema.<verse eid="DEU 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 14:19" />“Hidudu yokapi yeikwabha na kugholoka kwa mapapanilu ghaki ngacheijetakalewa palongi jaka Chapanga, ngamwikula. <verse eid="DEU 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 14:20" />Nambu ihumbi yokapi yeibhi na mapapanilu yeijetakalewa palongi jaka Chapanga muweza kula.<verse eid="DEU 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 14:21" />“Ngamwikula chindu chokapi chela chemwachihimanyaje chiwili cheni. Muweza kumpekeha ngeni jokapi jola joatama mu michi jinu, nahuli akulaje, au muweza kundombasela mundu wa inchi najengi. Maghambu mwehapa nde bhandu bhahuhu kwaka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 14:21">“Ngamwitutuha mwanambuhi mu mahibha ghaka mabhu waki.<verse eid="DEU 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shelia panani ja lifungu la komi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 14:22" />“Ngawikotoka kubhoha lifungu la komi la mahunu ghaku ghokapi gha mighonda jaku mu kila chaka. <verse eid="DEU 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 14:23" />Mwikulaje lifungu la komi la mahunu ghinu, divai jahenu, mahuta gha zeituni na bhabhelakeka bhinu bha kutumbula bha mapogha ghinu gha ng'ombi, mambeleli na imbuhi palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, pandu pala paanahaghulaje kubha ngati matamu gha lihina laki, nahuli mpataje kulibhola kuntopela Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, chikahi chokapi. <verse eid="DEU 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 14:24" />Anangati mwanja nde ulachu, kwa kubha Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, apahawili pandu pa kubheka matamu gha lihina laki pandu ambapu nde patali nakanopi na mwehapa, nanamu ngachemuweza kutotola mafungu gha komi gha mahunu ghinu ambaghu Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, ampengalili mwehapa, bhela, mtendaje anana: <verse eid="DEU 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 14:25" />Muhemalyaje mahunu ghanihagha kwa mbija, na kutotola mbija heyi mbaka pandu pala paapahawili Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu. <verse eid="DEU 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 14:26" />Mtumilaje mbija jeniheji kuhemela chokapi chela chemchipala: Ng'ombi, limbeleli, divai au chakunywa chokapi chela chechibhi na ubhabha, au chokapi chela chemchipala. Panihapa mwehapa papamu na bhandu bha munyumba hinu, mwikulaje na kuhekalela palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu.<verse eid="DEU 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 14:27" />“Ngamubhajewa Bhalawi bhabhatama mu michi jinu, maghambu bhanihabha ngachebhabhi na pandu pa inchi pachilanda jinu. <verse eid="DEU 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 14:28" />Mu ujomukelu wa kila chaka cha katatu, ndetaje mafungu gha komi gha mahunu ghinu gha hyaka yeniyela na kughaghoha mu michi jinu, <verse eid="DEU 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 14:29" />nahuli Bhalawi ambabhu ngachebhabhili na pandu pa inchi jabhu papamu na mwehapa, na bhagheni, bhakebha, na akambomba bhabhaweliwi na bhalomi bhabhu, ambabhu bhatama mu michi jinu, bhakulaje na kutupila. Mtendaje bhenibhela nahuli Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, ampengalyaje mwehapa mu mahengu ghokapi ghamughahenga kwa mabhoku ghinu.<verse eid="DEU 14:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="DEU 15" />
  <para style="s">Chaka cha saba</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LEV 25:1-7">Bhalawi 25:1-7</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 15:1" />“Kila ujomukelu wa chaka cha saba impalika kubhalekakela bhala bhamubhadai. <verse eid="DEU 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 15:2" />Anana nde momwihengilaje: Kila mundu joanjahiki njaki, ahungulaje lideni leniheli, wala ngaandepesha njaki wala ndongu waki, maghambu Bambo Chapanga mweni nde joatemwile kubha lideni leniheli lihunguliwaje. <verse eid="DEU 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 15:3" />Uweza kudai kuhuma kwaka ngeni, nambu ikupalika uhungulaje kila lideni leundai ndongu waku.<verse eid="DEU 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 15:4" />“Hata bhela, ngakwikubhi na kahochu pachilanda jinu, maghambu mu inchi ambaju Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, ampekeha kujenda kujitola kubha jinu, anaampengalyaje namaa, <verse eid="DEU 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 15:5" />ngati pela anamjijowanili sauti jaka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, kwa kujengalela na kuitenda ngati moipalakila amuli ayeyi yokapi yenumpekeha lalenu. <verse eid="DEU 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 15:6" />Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, anaampengalyaje ngati moakalaghile. Nanamu anamubhajahikaje bhandu bha inchi yamaheli, nambu mwehapa ngamwijahiki kwaka jokapi jola. Anamughatawalaje bhandu bha inchi yamaheli, nambu mwehapa ngamwitawaliwi na bhandu bha inchi jokapi jela.<verse eid="DEU 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 15:7" />“Ngati anakubhili na mundu kahochu pachilanda ja bhalongu bhaku, mu muchi wa inchi jokapi jela ambaju Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku, akupekihi kutama, ngawikubha undohu wala ngawikotoka kunjangatila ndongu waku kahochu hoju. <verse eid="DEU 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 15:8" />Nambu unhoghulyaje mabhoku ghaku, na unjahikaje kwa kupala wamwete chindu chokapi chela cheachipala. <verse eid="DEU 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 15:9" />Ndingalyaje ngamwibheka liholalelu aleli lihakau mu mitima jinu: ‘Chaka cha saba, nde chaka cha kuhungula madeni chiheghalile,’ ngawilangiha liholalelu lihakau kwaka ndongu waku kahochu na kukana kumpekeha chokapi chela cheachipala. Jombi aweza kundelela Bambo Chapanga kwa ndandi jinu, nanamu anamkubhaje mpatakini na mahoku. <verse eid="DEU 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 15:10" />Umpekyaje kwa mtima wamboni na pangakung'ong'uteka mu mitima jinu, maghambu kwa ndandi ja leniheli Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, anaampengalyaje mwehapa mu mahengu ghinu ghokapi, na kwa kila chindu chemwihengaje kwa mabhoku ghinu. <verse eid="DEU 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 15:11" />Kwa ndandi machobha ghokapi akakahochu anabhakubha mu inchi. Bhela nukulaghalakila kubha, ikupalika ukubhaje na mtima wamboni wa kubhajangatila bhalongu bhaku akakahochu, na bhokapi bhaipalika kubhajangatila mu inchi jaku.<verse eid="DEU 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ntundu wa kubhahengela bhatumwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 21:1-11">Kubhoka 21:1-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 15:12" />“Ngati Muebulania njaku, mwanalomi au mbomba, anaalilombisi kwaku na kukutumakila kwa hyaka sita, mu chaka cha saba ikupalika undekaje abhokaje kuhuma kwaku akabya alijeka. <verse eid="DEU 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 15:13" />Nanau pawandekaje abhokaje kuhuma kwaku akabya alijeka, ngawandeka abhokaje mabhoku matopu. <verse eid="DEU 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 15:14" />Umpekyaje kwa mtima wamboni kuhuma mu libheghi laku la mambeleli na imbuhi, kuhuma mu pandu paku pa kughohela mahunu, na kuhuma mu pandu paku pa kuminyila divai. Umpekyaje ngati Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku, moakupengalile. <verse eid="DEU 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 15:15" />Nkombukaje kubha mwehapa nanamu mkabhili bhatumwa ku Misili hoku, nambu Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, akunkombwile. Jeniheji nde ndani numpekeha lilaghalakilu lendenu lalenu.<verse eid="DEU 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 15:16" />“Nambu mtumika waku anaakupwaghile, ‘Ngachembala kubhoka kwaku wehapa,’ kwa kubha akupala wehapa, na bhandu bha munyumba jaku na apala kujendalela kutama na wehapa, <verse eid="DEU 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 15:17" />bhela, wantolaje mbaka pa ubau wa ndyangu wa nyumba jaku, witolaje lukombu na kuhotola likutu laki mbaka lukombu holu lujingalaje, najombi anaakubhaje mtumika waku mileli. Uhengaje bhelabhela na kwaka mtumika waku wa chimbomba. <verse eid="DEU 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 15:18" />Wala ngawibhona kunonopa kundeka mtumika waku kulijeka, maghambu utumika waki kwaku wehapa kwa hyaka ayeyi sita ubhili na samani ja nusu jaka mundu joundepiki kukuhengela lihengu. Undekaje kulijeka, najombi Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku, anaakupengalyaje wehapa kwa kila lijambu leanauhengaje.<verse eid="DEU 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bhabhelakeka bha kutumbula bha ng'ombi na mambeleli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 15:19" />“Bhabhelakeka bha kutumbula bha chikambaku bhokapi bhabhibhelakikaje mu lipogha laku la ng'ombi na mambeleli, umbokihaje Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku. Ngaughahengesha lihengu mapongu ghanihagha gha ng'ombi, wala ngaughamogha mangoma gha bhabhelakeka bha kutumbula bha lipogha laku la mambeleli. <verse eid="DEU 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 15:20" />Kila chaka, wehapa papamu na bhandu bha munyumba jaku anaimpalikaje kula hinyama yeniheyi palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, pandu pala paanahaghulaje. <verse eid="DEU 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 15:21" />Ngati chinyama chenihechi anachibhili na dosali, yani anachibhi chilema, ngalola, au anachibhili na dosali jokapi jela ngolongwa, ngawachibhoha kubha nyambiku kwaka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku ng'o. <verse eid="DEU 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 15:22" />Wikulaje chinyama cha ntundu ghonihoghu mkati ja muchi waku. Mundu jokapi joajetakaliwi palongi jaka Chapanga, na jola jwangakujetakalewa palongi jaka Chapanga bhaweza kula chinyama chenihechi, ngati mobhakulila inyama ja holoku au inyama ja mbabhala. <verse eid="DEU 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 15:23" />Nambu ngawikula mwahi waki ng'o, ujitalaje paluhombi ngati machi.<verse eid="DEU 15:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="DEU 16" />
  <para style="s">Lichobha la Pasaka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 12:1-20">Kubhoka 12:1-20</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 16:1" />“Ntendaje uwangalalu wa Pasaka mu mwehi wa Abibu, kwa kuntopela Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, maghambu mu mwehi ghonihoghu wa Abibu, Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, akumbohiki ku Misili ikilu. <verse eid="DEU 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 16:2" />Mwibhohaje nyambiku ja Pasaka kuhuma mu lipogha la mambeleli au la ng'ombi, kwa kuntopela Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, pandu pala ambapu Bambo Chapanga anaapahaghulaje kubha matamu gha lihina laki. <verse eid="DEU 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 16:3" />Ngamwikula inyama jeniheji papamu na mabumunda ghaghajeghaliki amila. Nambu kwa machobha saba anamkulakaje mabumunda ghangakujeghaleka amila, yani mabumunda gha kuling'aha, maghambu mkabhokiki ku Misili kwa manyata, nahuli machobha ghokapi gha matamu ghinu, mkombukaje lichobha pamkabhokiki ku Misili. <verse eid="DEU 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 16:4" />Kwa chikahi cha machobha saba mundu jokapi ngayibheka amila munyumba jaki mu inchi jinu jokapi, wala inyama jokapi jela ja nyambiku jemwichinjaje pakamihi ja lichobha la kutumbula, ngajihighalila mbaka lukela.<verse eid="DEU 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 16:5" />“Ngamwibhoha nyambiku ja Pasaka mu muchi wokapi ghola ghoanaampekyaje Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, <verse eid="DEU 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 16:6" />nambu pandu pala paanahaghulaje Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, kubheka matamu gha lihina laki. Panihapa nde paimpalika mwehapa kubhoha nyambiku ja Pasaka pakamihe, lyobha palijibhila, kwa chikahi ngati chemwabhokiki ku Misili. <verse eid="DEU 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 16:7" />Ntelakaje inyama jeniheji na kula pandu pala payihaghulaje Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, na lukela mwikelabhukaje ku mahema ghinu. <verse eid="DEU 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 16:8" />Kwa machobha sita mwikulaje mabumunda ghangakujeghaleka amila, na mu lichobha la saba mkubhaje na uhimanganu uhuhu wa kunjojabhela Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, na ngamwihenga lihengu mu lichobha leniheli.<verse eid="DEU 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uwangalalu wa Mahunu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 34:22">Kubhoka 34:22</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 23:15-21">Bhalawi 23:15-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 16:9" />“Mbalangaje majuma saba, kutumbula pamtola chisenga na kutumbula kuhuna mahunu. <verse eid="DEU 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 16:10" />Bhela, muhekalyaje Uwangalalu wa Majuma kwa kuntopela Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, kwa kubhoha nhupu ya kupala mabhete, kubhokana na Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, moampengalile. <verse eid="DEU 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 16:11" />Mwihekalyaje palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, mwehapa papamu na bhana bhinu bha chikambaku, akakamwali bhinu, bhatumika bhinu bha chikambaku na bha chimbomba, Bhalawi, bhagheni, bhakebha, na akambomba bhabhaweliwi na bhalomi bhabhu bhabhatama papamu na mwehapa. Mtendaje bhenibhela pandu pala payihaghulaje Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, kubheka matamu gha lihina laki. <verse eid="DEU 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 16:12" />Mkombukaje kubha mkabhili bhatumwa ku Misili hoku, bhela mkamulaje amuli ayeyi na kuijengalela.<verse eid="DEU 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uwangalalu wa Indamba</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LEV 23:33-43">Bhalawi 23:33-43</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 16:13" />“Mtendaje Uwangalalu wa Indamba kwa machobha saba ananjomwili kubhongana mahunu ghinu, na ananjomwili kuminya divai. <verse eid="DEU 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 16:14" />Mwihekalyaje uwangalalu ghonihoghu mwehapa papamu na bhana bhinu bha chikambaku, akakamwali bhinu, bhatumika bhinu bha chikambaku na bha chimbomba, Bhalawi, bhagheni, bhakebha, na akambomba bhabhaweliwi na bhalomi bhabhu, bhabhatama mu michi jinu. <verse eid="DEU 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 16:15" />Kwa machobha saba muntendilaje uwangalalu Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, pandu pala payihaghulaje Bambo Chapanga. Kwa kubha Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, anaampengalyaje mu mahunu ghinu ghokapi na mu mahengu ghinu ghokapi, nanamu anamuhekalyaje nakanope.<verse eid="DEU 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 16:16" />“Akanalomi bhokapi bha inchi jinu ibhapalika bhahikaje palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, mala patatu kwa kila chaka, pandu pala payihaghulaje: Chikahi cha Uwangalalu wa Mabumunda Ghangakujeghaleka Amila, Uwangalalu wa Majuma, na Uwangalalu wa Indamba. Wala ngabhihika palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga mabhoku matopu. <verse eid="DEU 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 16:17" />Kila jumu winu impalika aletaje nhupu yaki kulengana na Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, moampengalile mu chaka chenihechi.<verse eid="DEU 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bhatemula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 16:18" />“Mubhaghulaje bhatemula na ihongozi bhangi kuhuma mu makabila ghinu mu kila muchi ambau Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, anaampekyaje, nabhombi anabhatemulaje bhandu kwa kulengana. <verse eid="DEU 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 16:19" />Mtemulaje ngati moipalakila, wala ngamwilingalila sula jaka mundu. Ngamwijetakela kutola ngolukelu, maghambu ngolukelu jichuchuha mihu gha bhala bhabhabhili na mbulau, na kung'anambula malobhi ghaka mundu wambone. <verse eid="DEU 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 16:20" />Mubhahengilaje bhandu mambu ghala ghaghapalika pela, nahuli mpataje kutama na kujitola inchi jempekewa na Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu.<verse eid="DEU 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 16:21" />“Ngamwijemeka nguzu jokapi jela jaka kichapanga wa upuhe Ashela pambipi na pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku pamunchengile Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu. <verse eid="DEU 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 16:22" />Wala ngamwijemeka liganga la kujojabhela, maghambu Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, ayihakalila hindu ayeyi.<verse eid="DEU 16:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="DEU 17" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 17:1" />“Ngawambokeha Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku, nyambiku ja lipongu la ng'ombi au limbeleli lelibhili na dosali, au chilema cha ntundu wokapi ghola, maghambu leniheli nde lihakalilu kwaka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku.<verse eid="DEU 17:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 17:2" />“Ngati mwanalomi au mbomba joatama mu ghumu wa michi jeampekihe Bambo Chapanga, ahimaniwi akahengaje uhakau palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, kwa kuheketa lulaghilu lwaki, <verse eid="DEU 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 17:3" />najombi apiti kuitumakila ichapanga nayengi, na kuijojabhela, ngati lyobha, mwehi au hindu yengi yokapi yela ya kunani kumahunde, yangakulaghalaki nepani, <verse eid="DEU 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 17:4" />nanau anabhukupwaghili leniheli na anaujowine, ikupalika kulichunguza lijambu leniheli kwa mkati nakanope. Anangati nde chakaka kubha lijambu leniheli ambalu nde lihakalilu lihengakiki mu Izilaeli, <verse eid="DEU 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 17:5" />panihapa untolaje mwanalomi hoju au mbomba joahengiki lihakalilu leniheli mbaka kunja ja muchi, na kundapula kwa maganga mbaka apotilaje. <verse eid="DEU 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 17:6" />Nambu mundu jonihoju anaakomakikaje kwa ulandilu wa bhandu bhabheli, au bhalandilu bhatatu, nambu ngayikomakeka kwa ulandilu waka mundu jumu pela. <verse eid="DEU 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 17:7" />Mabhoku gha bhalandilu nde ghaghapalika kubha gha kutumbula kunkoma mundu jonihoju, na bhajengalyaje bhangi bhokapi nabhombi bhundapulaje. Bhenibhela nde momwibhokihaje uhakau pachilanda jinu.<verse eid="DEU 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 17:8" />“Ngati matakilu ghaghanonwipe kwinu mwehapa kughatemula ghaletakiki mu michi jinu, anakubhili kujitila kwa mwahi, kudayana, na kupotikana, mughapelakaje pandu pala payihaghulaje Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu. <verse eid="DEU 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 17:9" />Njendanyaje kwa bhapenganyambiku Bhalawi, na kwaka mtemula joanakubhaje palihengu lichobha leniheli, mubhalandilaje matakilu ghinu, nabhombi anabhabhohaje utemulu wabhu. <verse eid="DEU 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 17:10" />Impalika kuhenga ngati moipalakila kubhokana na utemulu ghobhampekyaje pandu pala payihaghulaje Bambo Chapanga. Nanamu impalika kuhenga kila chindu chebhambolaje kuhenga. <verse eid="DEU 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 17:11" />Impalika kuhenga ngati moipalakila kubhokana na shelia yebhumbola na utemulu ghobhampekyaje. Ngamwing'anambuka ku chibhoku cha kumalelelu au chibhoku cha kumangeja kwa kukotoka kughahenga ghala ghabhampwaghilaje. <verse eid="DEU 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 17:12" />Mundu jokapi joanalangihaje kunjojoha mtemula au mpenganyambiku joabhekakiki kuntumakila Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku, mundu jonihoju apalika akomakikaje. Bhenibhela nde momwitendilaje nahuli kubhoha uhakau pachilanda ja Izilaeli. <verse eid="DEU 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 17:13" />Bhandu bhokapi anabhajowanaje na kujoghopa, nabhombi ngabhikubhi bhandu bha kujojoha kabhete.<verse eid="DEU 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malaghalakilu kubhokana na Nkolongwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 17:14" />“Chikahi pamwijingalaje mu inchi jeampekeha Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, kubha jinu na kutama monihomu, nanamu anampwaghiki, ‘Tunhimakaje nkolongwa panani jitu ngati bhandu bha inchi yeyutuyongolota,’ <verse eid="DEU 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 17:15" />muweza kunhimika nkolongwa panani jinu mundu joanahaghuliwaje na Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu. Ipalika mumbekaje mundu kuhuma mu bhalongu bhinu mabhete kubha nkolongwa panani jinu. Ngamwambeka ngeni panani jinu ambaju nga Muizilaeli kubha nkolongwa. <verse eid="DEU 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 17:16" />Nambu nkolongwa jonihoju ngayitola falasi yamaheli kwa ndandi jaki mweni, wala ngaabhatenda bhandu kukelabhuka ku Misili nahuli kulipatila falasi nakanope, maghambu Bambo Chapanga akupwaghili, ‘Kutumbula sajenu ngamwikelabhuka kabhete indela jenijela ng'o.’ <verse eid="DEU 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 17:17" />Wala ngayitoghola akambomba bhamaheli ng'o, nahuli mtima waki ngawihobha. Wala ngayitenda madini gha feza na zahabu yaki kubha yamaheli nakanopi ng'o. <verse eid="DEU 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 17:18" />Chikahi payikubha nkolongwa na kutama pa chitehu chaki cha kikolongwa, impalika alilembilaje kabhete nakala ja chitabu cha shelia kwa ndandi jaki mweni, kuhuma mu chitabu cha shelia chechighohakeka na bhepenganyambiku Bhalawi. <verse eid="DEU 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 17:19" />Impalika akubhaje na nakala ja chitabu chenihechi chikahi chokapi, na kuchisoma matamu ghaki ghokapi, nahuli apataje kulibhola kuntopela Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waki, na kukamula malobhi ghokapi ghaghalembakiki mu shelia yenjenu na amuli yenjenu, na kuitenda. <verse eid="DEU 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 17:20" />Ngaalikweha mweni panani ja bhalongu bhaki Bhaizilaeli, wala kuileka shelia yenjenu kwa ntundu wokapi ghola, nahuli jombi na bhabhelakeka bhaki bhawezaje kutawala kwa chikahi chilachu, mu inchi ja Izilaeli.<verse eid="DEU 17:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="DEU 18" />
  <para style="s">Lifungu la bhapenganyambiku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 18:1" />“Bhapenganyambiku Bhalawi, yani likabila lokapi la Lawi, ngabhikubha na pandu pabhu pa inchi pachilanda ja Izilaeli. Bhombi anabhatamaje kwa kula nyambiku yeibhohakeka kwa ndandi jaka Bambo Chapanga ya kujochakeka kwa moto, maghambu yeniheyi nde lifungu labhu. <verse eid="DEU 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 18:2" />Ngabhikubhi na pandu pa inchi jabhu pachilanda ja bhalongu bhabhu Bhaizilaeli, lifungu labhu nde kubha bhapenganyambiku bhaka Bambo Chapanga, ngati moakabhalaghile.<verse eid="DEU 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 18:3" />“Haleli nde lifungu la bhapenganyambiku kuhuma kwa bhandu bhabhabhoha nyambiku, ikubhi nde ng'ombi au limbeleli, bhumpekyaje mpenganyambiku chigholu cha kulongi, inyama ja matukwa ghabheli, na hindu ya mkati ya chinyama hechi. <verse eid="DEU 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 18:4" />Mubhapekyaje pandu pa kutumbula pa mahunu ghinu, divai, mahuta ghinu gha zeituni, na sufu ja kutumbula kuhuma mu mangoma gha mambeleli ghinu. <verse eid="DEU 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 18:5" />Maghambu Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, abhahawili Bhalawi papamu na bhabhelakeka bhabhu kuhuma mu makabila ghinu ghokapi, nahuli bhajemaje na kutumika ngati bhapenganyamabiku kwa lihina laka Bambo Chapanga mileli.<verse eid="DEU 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 18:6" />“Ngati anakubhi Mlawi jokapi jola anahamiki kuhuma mu ghumu wa michi ja Izilaeli paakabhi atama, na kuhika kwa mtima waki wokapi pandu pala payihaghulaje Bambo Chapanga, <verse eid="DEU 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 18:7" />aweza kutumika panihapa kwa lihina laka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waki, ngati mobhahengela Bhalawi bhajaki bhabhatumika palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="DEU 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 18:8" />Anabhapataje lifungu labhu lelilengana la chilebhi, hata ngati anabhajopiki mbija kubhokana na kuhemalela mali gha bhalongu bhabhu.<verse eid="DEU 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malakalilu kubhokana na mitetu ja kigheni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 18:9" />“Chikahi pamwijingalaje mu inchi jeampekeha Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, ngamwalibhola kujigha indela ya mahakalilu ghaghahengakeka na bhandu bha inchi ya konihoku. <verse eid="DEU 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 18:10" />Ngapibhonikana mundu jokapi jola pachilanda jinu joamboha mwana waki wa chikambku au wa chimbomba kubha nyambiku ja kujochakeka kwa moto, wala mundu joatenda lamuli, wala joalondola, wala nhwabhi, <verse eid="DEU 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 18:11" />wala joategha kwa kukonga mahundwa, wala mlozi, wala joajojabhela mahoka na majobhi, wala joabhalobha bhabhapotile. <verse eid="DEU 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 18:12" />Maghambu mundu jokapi joahenga mambu ghanihagha nde lihakalilu kwaka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, na kwa ndandi ja mambu ghanihagha gha kuhakalia, Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, abhatopola bhandu bha ntundu ghonihoghu palongi jinu. <verse eid="DEU 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 18:13" />Ukubhaje undongwana palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku.<verse eid="DEU 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chilanga cha kupekewa mlota</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 18:14" />“Bhandu bha inchi ayeyi ambabhu anamubhatopulaje na kujitola inchi jabhu bhajengalela ulonguheku wa bhalondola na bhaganga, nambu kwinu mwehapa, Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, ngacheanjetakili kuhenga bhenibhela. <verse eid="DEU 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 18:15" />Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, anaanjinulyaje mlota ngati nepani kuhuma pachilanda ja bhalongu bhinu Bhaizilaeli, impalika munjowanya jombi.<verse eid="DEU 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 18:16" />“Maghambu bhenibhela nde momukundobhile Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, ku Holebu kola, lichobha lela lemukalibhongini na kupwagha, ‘Ngatwijowana kabhete sauti jaka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga witu, wala kuubhona moto aghoghu ukolongwa, nahuli ngatwihika kupotela.’ <verse eid="DEU 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 18:17" />Bhela Bambo Chapanga akambwaghile, ‘Bhahengiki wichu kupwagha bhenibhela. <verse eid="DEU 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 18:18" />Ananabhahaghulyaje mlota ngati wehapa kuhuma pachilanda ja bhalongu bhabhu Bhaizilaeli, nanatu ananyeghalaje malobhi ghangu mundomu waki, najombi anaampwaghilaje kila chindu chenandaghalakyaje. <verse eid="DEU 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 18:19" />Ngati mundu jokapi jola ngayijowaneli malobhi ghangu ghayipwaghaje mlota hoju kwa lihina langu, nepani namwete ananundapulaje. <verse eid="DEU 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 18:20" />Nambu mlota jokapi jola joanalongilaje kwa lihina langu chindu chokapi chela, ambachu ngachenundaghalaki kupwagha, au mlota joanapwaghaje kwa lihina la ichapanga nayenge, mlota hoju impalika akomakikaje.’<verse eid="DEU 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 18:21" />“Nambu anampwaghiki mu mitima jinu, ‘Bho, anatumanya bholi lilobhi langakuhuma kwaka Bambo Chapanga?’ ” <verse eid="DEU 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 18:22" />Ngati mlota jokapi jola anaapwaghiki lilobhi kwa lihina laka Bambo Chapanga, na lijambu heli nangakuhengakeka au nangakupitalila, mmanyaje kubha lijambu leniheli ngacheakapwaghiki Bambo Chapanga. Mlota hoju alipwaghiki kwa umanyi waki mweni, ngamwanjoghopa jonihoju.<verse eid="DEU 18:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="DEU 19" />
  <para style="s">Michi ja kukembalela</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="NUM 35:9-34">Hesabu 35:9-34</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 20:1-9">Yoshua 20:1-9</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 19:1" />“Chikahi Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, payikubhaje abhayoningi bhandu ambabhu inchi jabhu ampekeha mwehapa, chikahi pamwikubhaje mubhatopwili na kutama mu michi jabhu na munyumba ghabhu, <verse eid="DEU 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 19:2" />panihapa ntengaje michi jitatu jejibhili pachilanda ja inchi kwa ndandi jinu, mu inchi jeampekeha Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, kujitola kubha jinu. <verse eid="DEU 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 19:3" />Mujighabhaje inchi jeniheji jempekewa na Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, mu pandu patatu. Bhela mwihaghulaje muchi ghumu wa kukembalela mu kila pandu patatu hapa. Mwilenganakyaje indela hinyahi nahuli bhandu bhawezaje kukembalela ku michi jeniheji kwa kupepuka nakanope. Nahuli ngati mundu anaankomiki njaki awezaje kutilila ku ghumu wa michi jeniheji na kubha lukwale. <verse eid="DEU 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 19:4" />Ngati mundu jokapi jola anaankomiki njaki panga kuholakela, najombi ngacheakabhili adui waki, aweza kutilila mu ghumu wa michi jeniheji, na kughakengalela matamu ghaki. <verse eid="DEU 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 19:5" />Kwa ulenganesu, mundu aweza kujenda muchitengu na njaki kuheketa mikongu, najombi paayongoloha libhaghu kuheketa nkongu, libhaghu liweza kuholapoka kuhuma mu mpini waki, na kundapula njaki na kunkoma. Mundu jonihoju aweza kutilila mu ghumu wa michi jeniheji, na kughakengalela matamu ghaki. <verse eid="DEU 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 19:6" />Nambu ngati anakubhili na muchi ghumu pela, na utali wa muchi hoghu nde ukolongwa nakanope, mundu joapala kulepa kisasi hoju aweza kunjengalela kwa inyela ngolongwa, na kunkoma mundu joakuntendiki njaki kupotela hoju, hata ngati ngacheikampaliki kukomakeka, maghambu bhandu bhabheli habha ngachebhakabhili maadui kutumbu pakutumbula. <verse eid="DEU 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 19:7" />Kwa ndandi ajeji, nundaghalakila mwehapa kutenga michi jitatu ja kukembalela kwa ndandi jinu.<verse eid="DEU 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 19:8" />“Ngati Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, anaajonjukili malindakanilu gha inchi jinu, ngati moakalaghile kwa kulapa kwa akahokolu bhinu na kumpekeha inchi jokapi jeakalaghile kubhapekeha akahokolu bhinu, <verse eid="DEU 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 19:9" />nanamu ananjengalili wichu na kukamula amuli ayeyi yokapi yenundaghalakila lalenu, na kuitenda, kwa kumpala Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, na kujenda machobha ghokapi mu indela yaki, bhela, panihapa ntengaje michi jengi jitatu nakanope. <verse eid="DEU 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 19:10" />Mtendaje bhenibhela nahuli mwahi wangakubha na hatia ngawijitika mu inchi jinu, ambaju Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, ampekeha kubha jinu, nahuli ngamwikubha na lihoku la kujitila mwahi.<verse eid="DEU 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 19:11" />“Nambu anangati mundu anhakalila njaki, anaanjobhalili, kundapula na kunkoma, najombi anaakembalili mu ghumu wa michi jeniheji, <verse eid="DEU 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 19:12" />panihapa bhazee bha muchi waki anabhatumaje bhatenga kwaki, nahuli bhundetaje kuhuma ku muchi ghonighola, na kumpekeha kwaka mundu joalepa kisasi cha kujitila mwahi, na kunkoma. <verse eid="DEU 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 19:13" />Lihu laku ngalambonela chiha, nambu ikupalika ubhohaje mwahi waka mundu jwangakubha na hatia mu Izilaeli, nahuli upataje kutama kwa lukwali.<verse eid="DEU 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malindakanilu gha mwande</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 19:14" />“Ngawijonjukela alama ja malindakanilu ghaka njaku, ambaghu ghakabhekakiki na bhandu bha mwande mu upwelelu waku ghoujopalela mu inchi ambaju Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku, akupekeha kujitola.<verse eid="DEU 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malaghalakilu kwa ndandi ja bhalandilu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 19:15" />“Mlandilu jumu ngacheajaghanila kuntenda mundu joahokiye atemuliwaje, wala kunjeghela mu lihakau lokapi lela leaweza kulitenda. Ipalika litakilu lokapi lela litemuliwaje kwa ulandilu wa bhandu bhabheli au bhatatu. <verse eid="DEU 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 19:16" />Ngati mlandilu joabhi na ndandi ja kunhokela njaki anaajemiki kuntakila mundu kwa kuhenga mambu ghangakupalika, <verse eid="DEU 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 19:17" />bhela bhandu bhabheli bhabhahusika na matakilu ghanihagha ibhapalika bhajendaje pandu pa kunjojabhela Bambo Chapanga, palongi ja bhapenganyambiku, na palongi ja bhatemula bhabhikubhaje palihengu mu machobha ghanihagha. <verse eid="DEU 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 19:18" />Bhatemula ibhapalika kughachunguza matakilu ghanihagha kwa mkati nakanope, ngati mlandilu anaabhonakini kubha nde mpuhe, najombi abhohiki ulandilu wa upuhe panani jaka Muizilaeli njaki, <verse eid="DEU 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 19:19" />panihapa unhengilaje ngati moapalilaje kunhengela ndongu waki Muizilaeli. Bhenibhela nde momwibhokihaje uhakau pachilanda jinu. <verse eid="DEU 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 19:20" />Bhela bhandu bhabhihighalyaje anabhajowanaje na kujoghopa, na uhakau ngati ghonihoghu ngawihengakeki kabhete pachilanda jinu ng'o. <verse eid="DEU 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 19:21" />Ngawikubha na lihu la chiha kwaka mundu wa ntundu ghonihoghu. Malepu ghaki anaghakubhaje womi kwa womi, lihu kwa lihu, linu kwa linu, chiwoku kwa chiwoku, na chigholu kwa chigholu.<verse eid="DEU 19:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="DEU 20" />
  <para style="s">Malaghalakilu kubhokana na ngondo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 20:1" />“Pamwijendaje kungondo kukomana na maadui bhinu, na kubhona falasi, magali gha ngondo na lipogha likolongwa la manjolinjoli kupeta linu, ngamubhajoghopa, maghambu Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, joambohiki ku Misili, anaakubhaje papamu na mwehapa. <verse eid="DEU 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 20:2" />Chikahi pachiheghalyaje mwehapa kujenda kungondo, mpenganyambiku ahikaje palongi na kulongela na manjolinjoli, <verse eid="DEU 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 20:3" />akapwaghaje, ‘Mwenga manjolinjoli bha Izilaeli, nyowanyaje nepani! Lalenu njenda kungondo kukomana na maadui bhinu, ngamwipotela mitima jinu, wala ngamwijoghopa, ngabhunjoghoha, wala ngamwijeghaleka choghoi palongi jabhu. <verse eid="DEU 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 20:4" />Maghambu Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, nde joajenda papamu na mwehapa kunkomanela kwa maadui bhinu, nahuli kunkengalela mwehapa.’<verse eid="DEU 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 20:5" />“Bhela ihongozi anabhapwaghila manjolinjoli bha Izilaeli, ‘Bho, kubhi le na mundu joachengiki nyumba jangakubhekakeka palongi jaka Chapanga? Jonihoju akelabhukaje kunyumba jaki, ngayihika kupotela kungondo na mundu jongi kujibheka nyumba heji palongi jaka Chapanga. <verse eid="DEU 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 20:6" />Bho, kubhi le na mundu jokapi jola joalemiki ngonda wa mizabibu, na wala ngacheatumbwile kughatumila mapambiku ghaki? Jonihoju abhujaje kunyumba jaki, ngayihika kupotela kungondo, na mundu jongi kuhekalela mapambiku ghaki. <verse eid="DEU 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 20:7" />Bho, kubhi le na mwanalomi jokapi jola pambani joabhohiki hweku na abhi pambipi kutoghola? Jonihoju na abhujaje kunyumba jaki, ngayihika kupotela kungondo, na mbomba hoju kutoghuleka na mwanalomi jongi.’<verse eid="DEU 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 20:8" />“Bhela ihongozi bhajendalyaje kubhapwaghi bhandu, ‘Bho, kubhi le na mundu pambani joajoghopa na joapotili mtima? Jonihoju na abhujaje kunyumba jaki, nahuli bhalongu bhaki nabhombi ngabhipotela mtima ngati jombi.’ <verse eid="DEU 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 20:9" />Chikahi ihongozi pabhijomulaje kulongela na bhandu, ipalika bhahaghulaje ihongozi bha kubhalongoha manjolinjoli.<verse eid="DEU 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 20:10" />“Chikahi pamwiheghalyaje kuulapula muchi, kutumbula mubhalalukya hoti bhandu bha muchi ghonihoghu, na kubhapekeha mbekenyu ja kukweha mabhoku. <verse eid="DEU 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 20:11" />Ngati bhenei bha muchi ghonihoghu anabhajetakili kunhoghulela milyangu ja michi jabhu kwa lukwale, panihapa bhandu bhokapi bhabhabhi monihomu anabhuntumakya mwehapa kwa kuhenga lihengu lelinonwipe. <verse eid="DEU 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 20:12" />Nambu ngati anabhakaniki kuhenga majonganu gha lukwali na mwehapa, na kukomana ngondo na mwehapa, bhela manjolinjoli ghinu ghauyongalutaje muchi ghonihoghu kwa ngondo. <verse eid="DEU 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 20:13" />Chikahi Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, anaanjangatili kubhaweza handu bha muchi ghonihoghu, mubhakomaje kwa lipanga akanalomi bhokapi bhabhabhi monihomu. <verse eid="DEU 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 20:14" />Nambu akambomba na bhana, hinyama ya muchi, na hindu yokapi yeibhi mkati ja muchi, muweza kuitola kubha ngati mateka kwa ndandi jinu. Nanamu muweza kuitumila yentoliki mateka heyi ambayu Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, ampekihi kuhuma kwa maadui bhinu. <verse eid="DEU 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 20:15" />Bhenibhela nde moimpalakila kuhenga kwa michi jokapi jejibhili kutali na mwehapa, ambaju ngachejitawaliwa na bhandu bha inchi ya pambipe.<verse eid="DEU 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 20:16" />“Nambu mu michi ja inchi ayeyi yeakupekeha Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku, kubha jaku, ngawachileka kubha chomi chindu chokapi chela chekipomola. <verse eid="DEU 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 20:17" />Mubhayonangaje nakanopi bhandu bhokapi bha inchi ayeyi, yani, Bhahiti, Bhaamoli, Bhakanaani, Bhapelizi, Bhahivi na Bhayebusi, ngati Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, moandaghalakile. <verse eid="DEU 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 20:18" />Nanga bhela, anabhumbolaje kujengalela mambu ghokapi gha mahakalilu ghabhahenga gha kuijojabhela ichapanga yabhu, nanamu anamkubhaje munhengili mahoku Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu.<verse eid="DEU 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 20:19" />“Chikahi pamwikubhaje muyongolota muchi kwa chikahi chilachu, koni mkakomana ngondo nahuli kuutola kwa makili, ngamwiyonanga mikongu jaki kwa kujiheketa kwa mabhaghu, maghambu anamuwezaje kula mapambiku ghaki. Bhela ngamujiheketa. Bho, mikongu heji ja mumighonda le nde bhandu mbaka mujilapulaje? <verse eid="DEU 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 20:20" />Hata bhela, muweza kujiheketa mikongu ambaju nga ja mapambiku, na kujitumila kwa kuchenga ngazi ya kujingalila mu muchi, mbaka muchi ghoubhili mu ngondo na mwehapa pawihabhukaje.<verse eid="DEU 20:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="DEU 21" />
  <para style="s">Shelia kubhokana na kukoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 21:1" />“Ngati mundu anahimaniwi atehi kukomakeka, najombi aghoni kwitengu mu inchi ambaju Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, ampekeha mjitamaje, nanamu nangakummanya jola joankomike, <verse eid="DEU 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 21:2" />ihongozi bhinu na bhatemula bhinu bhabhokaje na kupema utali kuhuma ntuhi hoghu paughonile mbaka pa michi ja pambipi. <verse eid="DEU 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 21:3" />Bhela, ihongozi bha muchi ghola ghoubhi pambipi na ntuhi ghola, bhatolaje litoli ambalu ngachelitumiwi kuhenga lihengu lokapi lela, wala langakukongakeka ngoje, <verse eid="DEU 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 21:4" />na ihongozi bha muchi hoghu bhalitolaje litoli heli na kujenda nalu mbaka kulibondi ambalu ngachelilabhali kulemakeka au kupandwa mahunu, na papabhili na machi gha chemuchemu jejinyila. Panihapa ihongozi bhinu bhatunyulaje hingu ja litoli heli kulibondi hoku. <verse eid="DEU 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 21:5" />Nabhombi bhapenganyambiku bha lukolu lwa Bhalawi, bhaheghalyaje pambipi, maghambu Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, anhawili mwehapa kutumika na kubhoha mbengalelu kwa lihina laka Bambo Chapanga, na kutemula matakilu ghokapi gha kulochana na kupotikana. <verse eid="DEU 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 21:6" />Bhela ihongozi bhokapi bha muchi ghoubhi pambipi na mundu hoju joakomakike, bhachambaje machi mabhoku ghabhu panani ja litoli heli lelitunyuliwi hingu jaki ku libondi hoku, <verse eid="DEU 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 21:7" />na bhatangazaje, ‘Mabhoku ghitu ngacheghunkomiki mundu ajoju, wala mihu ghitu ngacheghaweni lijambu heli palakabhi lihengakeka. <verse eid="DEU 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 21:8" />Wenga wa Bambo Chapanga, ubhalekakyaje bhandu bhaku Izilaeli, bhaubhakombwile kuhuma ku Misili, wala ngaubhabhalangila bhandu bhaku mahakau gha mwahi waka mundu jwangakubha na mahakau. Panihapa mwahi ghoujitiki hoghu anaukubhaje uhengakiwi ujonganesu.’ <verse eid="DEU 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 21:9" />Bhela anamkubhaje mligholwili mabhete kubhokana na mahakau ghanihagha gha kunkoma mundu jwangakubha na mahoku, maghambu mlihengiki lijambu lela lelipalika palongi ja mihu ghaka Bambo Chapanga.<verse eid="DEU 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuntoghola mbomba mateka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 21:10" />“Ngati anampiti kungondo kukomana na maadui bhinu, najombi Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, anaantendiki kubhaweza maadui bhinu, na kubhatola kwa makili, <verse eid="DEU 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 21:11" />ngati pachilanda ja mateka bhanihabha anaumbweni mbomba mnyahi, anauntokulili na kupala kuntoghola kubha nhwanu waku, untoghulaje. <verse eid="DEU 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 21:12" />Bhela undetaje munyumba jaku, ummoghaje majunju ghaki na kunheketa yobhu yaki, <verse eid="DEU 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 21:13" />na ang'anambulaje ingobhu yaki yeakawati chikahi paakabhi bhuntola kwa makili. Atamaje munyumba jaku na kuombuleza panani jaka tati waki na mabhu waki kwa mwehi ghumu, panihapa uweza kuntoghola na kubha ndomi waki, najombi anaakubhaje nhwanu waku. <verse eid="DEU 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 21:14" />Nambu ngati ngawijendaleli kunyambakika naku, undekaje ajendaje pandu pokapi paapala. Ngawandombesa wala kuntendela ngati mtumwa ng'o, maghambu anaukubhaje unhekatili utopelu waki.<verse eid="DEU 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shelia panani jaka mbelakeka wa kutumbula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 21:15" />“Ngati mwanalomi anaabhili na mitala ja akabhahanu bhabheli, najombi ampala mbomba jumu, na jongi ngacheampala, na ngati bhokapi bhumbelakili bhana bha chikambaku, nambu mwana wa chikambaku wa kutumbula nde waka mbomba jola jwangakumpala, <verse eid="DEU 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 21:16" />chikahi cha kubhoha upwelelu kwa bhana bhaki anaachihikike, ngayibhoha haki jaka mbelakeka wa kutumbula kwaka mwana waka mbomba jola joampala kwa upendeleu ng'o, nambu impalika ampekyaje mwana jola waka mabhu jwangakumpala, ambaju nde mbelakeka wa kutumbula. <verse eid="DEU 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 21:17" />Ikupalika unjetakyaje mwana wa kutumbula waka mbomba jwangakumpala, kwa kumpekeha mafungu ghabheli gha hindu yokapi yeubhi nayu, maghambu jonihoju nde mwana wa utumbulilu wa makili ghaki, na haki jaka mbelakeka wa kutumbula nde jaki jombi.<verse eid="DEU 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwana jwangakutii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 21:18" />“Ngati mundu anaabhili na mwana joabhi na ing'omu na jwangakutii sauti jaka tati waki, wala sauti jaka mabhu waki, nabhombi pabhundapula ngacheabhajowanela, <verse eid="DEU 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 21:19" />panihapa tati waki na mabhu waki bhunkamulaje, na kumpeleka kuntakila kwa ihongozi bha muchi waki, pundyangu ukolongwa wa muchi ghonihoghu. <verse eid="DEU 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 21:20" />Bhabhapwaghila ihongozi bha muchi waki, ‘Mwana witu jonjoni abhi na ing'omu, na ngacheatii, wala ngacheajowanela sauti jitu. Jombi nde ndohu na ndobhela uwembi.’ <verse eid="DEU 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 21:21" />Bhela akanalomi bha mu muchi waki bhundapulaje kwa maganga mbaka apotilaje. Bhenibhela nde momwibhokihaje uhakau pachilanda jinu. Kila mundu mu Izilaeli anaajowanaje lijambu leniheli na kujoghopa.<verse eid="DEU 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shelia patalipatali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 21:22" />“Ngati mundu anahengiki lihoku lelumpalika kukomakeka, najombi anaakomakike, na kujijenjeha hyegha jaki panani ja nkongu, <verse eid="DEU 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 21:23" />ngawajileka hyegha jaki panani ja nkongu ikilu jokapi ng'o. Impalika kujitagha hyegha jaki lichobha lela lela, maghambu kila mundu joanyongakiki panani ja nkongu abhi pahi ja masolu ghaka Chapanga. Ngamwajijeghela uhakau inchi jempekewa na Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, kubha upwelelu winu.<verse eid="DEU 21:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="DEU 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 22:1" />“Ngati anaujiweni ng'ombi jaka Muizilaeli njaku au limbeleli laki litenda kuhobha, ngawajileka, nambu ujikelabhuhaje kwaka mweni jaki. <verse eid="DEU 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 22:2" />Nambu anangati nyumba jaka ndongu waku hoju jibhi kutali na wehapa, au ngati ngacheujimanyi mweni jaki, utolaje na kuchibheka chinyama hechi kunyumba jaku mbaka mweni chaki ahikaje kuchilonda, panihapa nde umpekyaje. <verse eid="DEU 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 22:3" />Uhengaje bhela bhela ngati anaulihimanili liponda laki au ingobhu jaki, au chindu chokapi chela cheahoiki ndongu waku. Ngawalihiya kubha ngati ngacheukiwene.<verse eid="DEU 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 22:4" />“Ngati anauliweni liponda laka ndongu waku, au ng'ombi jaki jihawiki paindela, ngawikotoka kulijangatila, ulijangatyaje kujema kabhete.<verse eid="DEU 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 22:5" />“Mbomba ngaiwata ingobhu ya chikambaku, wala nkambaku ngayiwata ingobhu ya chimbomba, maghambu kila mundu joahenga mambu ghanihagha nde lihakalilu kwaka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu.<verse eid="DEU 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 22:6" />“Ngati anauweni unhuwi wa chijuni punkeghi ja indela, chikubhi munani ja nkongu au pahi, na chijuni hechi anachijobhatili bhana bhaki au mahombi, ngawachitola chijuni hechi papamu na bhana bhaki. <verse eid="DEU 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 22:7" />Ikupalika uchilekaje chijuni hechi chijendaje, nambu bhana bhaki uweza kubhatola, nahuli mambu ghaku ghapataje kujenda wichu, na kughatenda machobha ghaku kubha ghamaheli.<verse eid="DEU 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 22:8" />“Chikahi pauchenga nyumba jahenu, ulenganakyaje lumatu munkeghi ja ugholu, nahuli ngawaliletela lihoku la kukoma panani ja nyumba jaku, ngati mundu jokapi jola anaahawiki na kupotela.<verse eid="DEU 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 22:9" />“Ngawipanda ntundu ubheli wa imbeju mu ngonda waku wa mizabibu, anauhengiki bhenibhela, nga mahunu pela ghaupandiki ghaghikubhaje mahakau, nambu hata mapambiku ghaupandiki mu ngonda wa mizabibu bhelabhela.<verse eid="DEU 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 22:10" />“Ngawilema ngonda kwa kutumila ng'ombi na liponda yeikongakiki lingolingoli kwa papamu.<verse eid="DEU 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 22:11" />“Ngawiwata ingobhu jejihangaghini kwa mangoma gha limbeleli na ingobhu jinyahi jihuhu.<verse eid="DEU 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 22:12" />“Ulenganakyaje mahundwa gha uzi mu kona nchechi ya lijoho laku.<verse eid="DEU 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shelia panani jaka ndomi na nhwanu waki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 22:13" />“Ngati mwanalomi anaantowili mbomba, na anaaghonili naku kihyegha, na panakatai anaapaliki kundeka, <verse eid="DEU 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 22:14" />kwa kunkopunganela na kundoha lihina lihakau, akapwaghaje: Nakuntowili mbomba ajoju, nambu panakaghonili naku kihyegha ngachenaweni ulandilu wokapi ghola ghoulangiha kubha jombi nde kamwali lenda.<verse eid="DEU 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 22:15" />“Bhela tati na mabhu bhaka mwali hoju anabhaletaje ulandilu ghoulangiha kubha chakaka akabhi bikila kwa ihongozi bha muchi pundyangu ukolongwa wa muchi. <verse eid="DEU 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 22:16" />Tati waka mwali hoju abhapwaghilaje ihongozi, ‘Nakuntoghukili mwali wangu kwaka mwanalomi ajoju kubha nhwanu waki, nambu sajenu ngacheampala.’ <verse eid="DEU 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 22:17" />Ndingalyaje, ankopunganili akapwaghaje, ‘Ngachenaweni ulandilu ghoulangiha kubha akabhi kamwali lenda. Nambu pambani pabhi na ulandilu ghoulangi kubha mwali wangu ngachealabhali kughone na mwanalomi. Bhela bhabheleka bhaki bhahatambulaje ingobhu yela ya ulandilu hoghu palongi ja ihongozi bha muchi.’ <verse eid="DEU 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 22:18" />Panihapa ihongozi bha muchi bhuntolaje mwanalomi hoju na kundapu iboko. <verse eid="DEU 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 22:19" />Bhelabhela bhundepishaje ipandi mia jimu ya madini gha feza na kubhapekeha bhabheleka bhaka mwali hoju, maghambu mwanalomi hoju ampekihi mwali lenda wa Izilaeli lihina lihakau. Na mbomba hoju anaajendalyaje kubha nhwanu waki, ngacheimpalika kundembela baluwa ja kundeka machobha ghokapi gha matamu ghaki ng'o.<verse eid="DEU 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 22:20" />“Nambu anangati litakilu heli nde la chakaka, na kubha njeta ulandilu ghoupatakini kulangiha kubha mwali hoju akabhili mwali lenda, <verse eid="DEU 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 22:21" />mwali hoju anaaletakikaje pundyangu wa nyumba jaka tati waki, na bhandu bha muchi waki anabhundapulaje kwa maganga mbaka apotilaje. Maghambu ahengiki lijambu la iyoni mu Izilaeli kwa kuhenga ukemi koni akabya munyumba jaka tati waki. Bhenibhela nde momwibhokihaje uhakau pachilanda jinu.<verse eid="DEU 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 22:22" />“Ngati mwanalomi anaahimaniwi ahenga ugoni na nhwanu waka mundu jongi, ibhapalika bhokapi bhabheli bhakomakikaje, mwanalomi joaghoni na mbomba hoju, papamu na mbomba hoju. Bhenibhela nde momwibhokihaje uhakau pachilanda jinu.<verse eid="DEU 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 22:23" />“Ngati mwanalomi anaanhimanili mwali lenda joabhowakiki nhweku kumbwane, na kughonela naku kihyegha, <verse eid="DEU 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 22:24" />ikupalika ubhatolaje bhokapi bhabheli mbaka pundyangu ukolongwa wa muchi na kubhalapula kwa maganga mbaka bhapotilaje. Mwali hoju anaakomakikaje maghambu ngacheakajamalili kwa kulobha ujangatilu hata koni akabhili kumbwane, na mwanalomi hoju anaakomakikaje maghambu antendili uhakau nhwanu waka mundu jongi. Bhenibhela nde momwibhokihaje uhakau pachilanda jinu.<verse eid="DEU 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 22:25" />“Nambu ngati mwanalomi anaahimangini na mwali joabhowakiki nhweku kungonda, na kutumila makili kunjingalila kihyegha, mwanalomi joahengiki bhenibhela kanjika jaki pela nde joanakomakikaje. <verse eid="DEU 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 22:26" />Nambu ngawantendela mwali hoju lijambu lokapi lela, maghambu ngacheabhili na lihoku lelumpalika kukomakeka. Kwa kubha lijambu leniheli lilengana na lela laka mundu kundapula mundu jongi na kunkoma kwa nahuli. <verse eid="DEU 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 22:27" />Maghambu mwanalomi hoju akunhimanili mwali hoju kumighonda, na hata koni mwali joabhowakiki nhweku hoju akatehi kujamalila kwa kujopa ujangatilu, nambu ngachepakabhi na mundu wa kunkengalela.<verse eid="DEU 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 22:28" />“Ngati mwanalomi anahimangini na mwali lenda jwangakubhowakeka nhweku, anaankamwili na kughone naku kihyegha kwa makili, nabhombi anabhakamuliki, <verse eid="DEU 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 22:29" />mwanalomi hoju impalika andepaje tati waka mwali hoju ipandi hamsini ya madini gha feza. Bhelabhela impalika antoghulaje mwali hoju na kubha nhwanu waki, maghambu anhengili lijambu lihakau. Ngacheimpalika kundembela baluwa ja kundeka machobha ghokapi gha matamu ghaki ng'o.<verse eid="DEU 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 22:30" />“Mwanalomi jokapi jola ngacheimpalika kuntoghola nhwanu waka tati waki, wala kughonela naku kihyegha nhwanu waka tati waki ng'o.<verse eid="DEU 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="DEU 23" />
  <para style="s">Kutengakeka na bhandu bhaka Bambo Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 23:1" />“Mwanalomi jokapi jola joahekitwi ntondola, au joahekitwi utopu waki, mundu jonihoju ngayibhalangika mu uhimanganu wa bhandu bhaka Bambo Chapanga.<verse eid="DEU 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 23:2" />“Mundu jokapi jola joabhelakiki mu ndowa jangakujetakalewa, ngayibhalangika mu uhimanganu wa bhandu bhaka Bambo Chapanga. Wala bhabhelakeka bhaka mundu jonihoju hata chibheleku cha komi, ngayibhalangika mu uhimanganu wa bhandu bhaka Bambo Chapanga.<verse eid="DEU 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 23:3" />“Mundu jokapi jola wa likabila la Bhaamoni au Bhamoabu, ngayibhalangika mu uhimanganu wa bhandu bhaka Bambo Chapanga. Wala bhabhelakeka bhabhu hata chibheleku cha komi ngayibhalangika mu uhimanganu wa bhandu bhaka Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="DEU 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 23:4" />Maghambu chikahi pamukabhi muhuma ku Misili ngachebhakahikiki kunjopalela koni bhakabya na chilebhi na machi, na kwa kubha bhakamuajili Balaamu mwana waka Beoli kuhuma ku Petoli jejibhili ku Alamu jejibhili ku Mesopotamia, nahuli kumpekeha masolu mwehapa. <verse eid="DEU 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 23:5" />Nambu Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, ngacheakajetakili kunjowanela Balaamu, nambu akang'anambwili masolu na kubha mbengalelu, maghambu Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, ampala mwehapa. <verse eid="DEU 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 23:6" />Bhela ngamwilonda majonganu gha lukwali na bhandu bhanihabha mu matamu ghinu ghokapi mileli.<verse eid="DEU 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 23:7" />“Nambu ngawamuhakalila Muedomu, maghambu jombi nde ndongu waku. Ngawamuhakalila Mmisili, maghambu ukabhili ungeni mu inchi jaki. <verse eid="DEU 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 23:8" />Bhabhelakeka bhabhu, kutumbula chibheleku cha katatu bhaweza kujingila mu uhimanganu wa bhandu bhaka Bambo Chapanga.<verse eid="DEU 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulitenda likambi kubha linyahi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 23:9" />“Pawibhokaje kujenda kukomana ngondo na maadui bhaku, na kuchenga likambi, ulijepaje na kila chindu chihakau. <verse eid="DEU 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 23:10" />Ngati mundu anahakihi kwa kupitwa na imbeju ya chikambaku ikilu, impalika apitaje kunja ja likambi na kutama konihoku, wala ngayijingila mulikambi. <verse eid="DEU 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 23:11" />Nambu pakamihi anajiheghalile, ajogha machi, na lyobha analijibhile anaajingalaje kabheti mulikambi.<verse eid="DEU 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 23:12" />“Impalika ntengaje pandu kunja ja likambi, ambapu muweza kujenda kulijangatila. <verse eid="DEU 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 23:13" />Pachilanda ja hindu hinu impalika mkubhaje na kaghela kangongwa, nanamu anantumilaje kukemba libhomba, chikahi pamulijangatila na kuhyelalela chela chechipitike. <verse eid="DEU 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 23:14" />Maghambu Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, ajenda mu likambi linu nahuli kundenda mwehapa na kubhatenda maadui bhinu kulepalela palongi jinu. Likambi linu lipalika likubhaje lihuhu, nahuli ngayibhona chindu chokapi chela chechibhi chihakau pachilanda jinu, nanga bhela aweza kung'anambuka na kundeka.<verse eid="DEU 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shelia patalipatali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 23:15" />“Ngati mtumwa anaakembalili kwaku wehapa nahuli kundenda, ngawankelabhuha kwaka bambo waki. <verse eid="DEU 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 23:16" />Impalika mundekaje atamaje pachilanda jinu, pandu pokapi paapala jombi, na mu muchi wokapi ghola ghoachaghula pamihu jaki. Ngamwambonela.<verse eid="DEU 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 23:17" />“Ngapikubha na nkemi pachilanda ja akakamwali bha Izilaeli, wala mwanalomi hanisi pachilanda ja bhandu bha Izilaeli. <verse eid="DEU 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 23:18" />Bhelabhela ngawileta mbija yeipatakini kwa kuhenga ukemi, ikubhi mbomba au mwanalomi mu Nyumba jaka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, kwa ndandi ja nazili jokapi jela, maghambu ghokapi ghabheli aghagha nde mahakalilu kwaka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu.<verse eid="DEU 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 23:19" />“Ngawanjahika chindu ndongu waku Muizilaeli kwa kupata nyonjeka, ikubhi nde nyonjeka ja mbija, nyonjeka ja chilebhi, au chindu chokapi chela cheuweza kupata nyonjeka. <verse eid="DEU 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 23:20" />Uweza kujopa nyonjeka paunkopesha ngeni, nambu nga kwaka ndongu waku Muizilaeli, nahuli Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku, apataje kukupengalela mu mambu ghokapi ghaubheka chiwoku chaku, mu inchi jeujingila kujitama.<verse eid="DEU 23:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 23:21" />“Ngati anaubhekiki nazili kwaka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku, ikupalika ngawikabhakila kujitimiza, maghambu Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku, anaakudayaje, nanau anaubhalangikaje kubha na lihoku. <verse eid="DEU 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 23:22" />Nambu anaulihibhalili na kukotoka kubheka nazili, ngalikubhi lihoku kwaku. <verse eid="DEU 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 23:23" />Nambu chindu chokapi chewilongilaje kwa ndomu waku, ikupalika utimizaje, maghambu ukabhekiki nazili ja nhupu waku kwa kupala wamwete palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku, kwa ndomu waku wamwete.<verse eid="DEU 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 23:24" />“Ngati anaujingili mu ngonda wa mizabibu waka njaku, uweza kula zabibu na kutupila kwa ntundu moupalila, nambu ngawitongola na kubheka mu chitonga chaku ng'o. <verse eid="DEU 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 23:25" />Ngati anaujingili mu ngonda wa mahunu waka njaku, uweza kukwachula mapukutu kwa chiwoku chaku na kula, nambu ngawitola chisenga na kuhuna mahunu ghaghajemiki ghaka njaku.<verse eid="DEU 23:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="DEU 24" />
  <para style="s">Baluwa ja kulekana na kutoghulana kabhete</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 24:1" />“Ngati mwanalomi anaantowili mbomba, na palongi anaanhakalili kwa kubha aweni lijambu lihakau kwaki, bhela, mwanalomi hoju apalika andembila baluwa ja kundeka, ampekyaje na kumboha panyumba jaki. <verse eid="DEU 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 24:2" />Ngati anaabhokiki kujenda kunyumba jaki, na kutoghuleka na mwanalomi jongi, <verse eid="DEU 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 24:3" />anangati ndomi waki wa kabheli anaanhakalili na kundembela baluwa ja kundeka, anaampekihi na kumboha kuhuma panyumba jaki, au anaapotili, <verse eid="DEU 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 24:4" />bhela ndomi waki wa kutumbula, jola joakumpekihi baluwa ja kundeka, ngacheimpalika kabheti kuntoghola mbomba hoju kubha nhwanu waki, maghambu ajomwili kujeghaleka uhakau. Ghanihagha anaghakubhaje mahakalilu palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga. Bhela ngawileta lihoku panani ja inchi jeakupekihe Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku, kujipwelela.<verse eid="DEU 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shelia patalipatali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 24:5" />“Ngati mwanalomi anaatowili henu kateki, ngacheimpalika kujenda kungondo, wala ngayipekewa lihengu lokapi lela, apalika atamaje kwa kulijeka kwa chaka chimu, nahuli atamaje panyumba na kuhekalela na nhwanu waki joantowile.<verse eid="DEU 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 24:6" />“Mundu jokapi jola ngayitola liganga la kuyaghila, lela la panani au la pahi, na kubheka poni, maghambu kwa kuhenga bhenibhela nde ngati kughatola matamu ghaka mundu.<verse eid="DEU 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 24:7" />“Ngati mundu anaabhonakini anjibhila Muizilaeli njaki, na kuntenda ngati mtumwa waki au kundombesa kubha mtumwa, mwihi hoju impalika akomakikaje. Bhenibhela nde momwibhokihaje uhakau pachilanda jinu.<verse eid="DEU 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 24:8" />“Ngati anapapitalili chitamu cha malohi, impalika kulilingalila namaa kwa kujengalela malaghalakilu gha bhapenganyambiku Bhalawi. Impalika kughajengalela wichu mambu ghala ngati monabhalaghalaki bhombi. <verse eid="DEU 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 24:9" />Nkombukaje lijambu lela Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, leakuntendili Miliamu ku indela kola chikahi mwehapa pamukabhi muhuma ku Misili.<verse eid="DEU 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 24:10" />“Chikahi paunjahika njaku chindu chokapi chela, ngawijingila munyumba jaki na kuchitola chindu chela cheachibheka kubha poni. <verse eid="DEU 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 24:11" />Ulendalyaje kunja, na undekaje mundu jola jounjahiki akuletilaje mweni chindu hechi cha poni. <verse eid="DEU 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 24:12" />Anangati mundu jonihoju nde kahochu, ngawijenda kughonela koni ukabya na poni heji. <verse eid="DEU 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 24:13" />Ikupalika ukelabhuhaje ingobhu jaki kila lichobha mangani ja lyobha kujibhila, nahuli apataje kulihyeka, na kukulobhela mbengalelu. Kuhenga bhenibhela nde lijambu lamboni kwaku palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku.<verse eid="DEU 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 24:14" />“Ngawambonela mundu kahochu au mtumika jounhajile joapalika kujangatiwa, ikubhi nde ndongu waku Muizilaeli au ngeni joatama mu ghumu wa michi jinu. <verse eid="DEU 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 24:15" />Undepaje malepu ghaki kila lichobha mangani ja lyobha kujibhila, maghambu jombi nde kahochu na mtima waki ughategamela malepu ghanihagha. Nanga bhela, aweza kundelela Bambo Chapanga, panani jaku, nanau uweza kubha na mahoku.<verse eid="DEU 24:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 24:16" />“Akatati ngabhikomakeka kwa ndandi ja mahakau ghabhahengiki bhana bhabhu, wala bhana ngabhikomakeka kwa ndandi ja mahakau ghabhahengiki akatati bhabhu. Kila mundu anaakomakikaje kwa ndandi ja lihoku laki mweni.<verse eid="DEU 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 24:17" />“Uhengaje ngati moipalakila pauntemula ngeni au nkebha, wala ngawitola ingobhu jaka mbomba joaweliwi na ndomi waki kubha poni. <verse eid="DEU 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 24:18" />Nambu nkombukaje kubha mkabhi bhatumwa ku Misili hoku, najombi Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, akunkombwi konihoku. Jeniheji nde ndandi nundaghalakila kuhenga bhenibhela.<verse eid="DEU 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 24:19" />“Chikahi pauhuna mahunu mungonda waku, na kughajewa mahunu kunyuma, ngawikelabhuka kujenda kughatola. Ughalekaje kwa ndandi ja bhagheni, bhakebha na akambomba bhabhaweliwi na bhalomi, nahuli Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku, awezaje kukupengalela wehapa mu mahengu ghokapi gha mabhoku ghaku. <verse eid="DEU 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 24:20" />Chikahi pautongola mapambiku gha zeituni kuhuma mu mikongu jaku, ngawikelabhukila kutongola mu mambandi mala ja kabheli. Ughalekaje mapambiku ghaghahighalili kwa ndandi ja bhagheni, bhakebha na akambomba bhabhaweliwi na bhalomi bhabhu. <verse eid="DEU 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 24:21" />Chikahi pauhuna mahunu gha zabibu kuhuma mu ngonda waku wa mizabibu, ngawikelabhukila mala ja kabheli. Wilekaje yeihighalile kwa ndandi ja bhagheni, bhakebha na akambomba bhabhaweliwi na bhalomi bhabhu. <verse eid="DEU 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 24:22" />Nkombukaje kubha nanamu mkabhi bhatumwa ku inchi ja Misili. Jeniheji nde ndandi nundaghalakila kuhenga bhenibhela.<verse eid="DEU 24:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="DEU 25" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 25:1" />“Ngati bhandu bhabheli bhatenda kulochana, ubhapelaka pachengu, na bhatemula anabhatemulaje litakilu labhu, bhundekakyaje jwangakubha na lihakau, na joabhi na lihakau atemuliwaje. <verse eid="DEU 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 25:2" />Ngati mundu joakamuliki kubha na lihakau anaatemuliwi kulapulika iboku, mtemula anaandaghalakyaje mundu hoju aghonila ukutama pahi nahuli alapulikaje palongi jaki, kwa ubhalangiku wa iboku kulengana na lihakau laki. <verse eid="DEU 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 25:3" />Mundu joabhi na lihakau hoju aweza kulapulika iboku alobaini, nambu nga nakanopi. Ngati anaalapuliki nakanopi ja iboku alobaini, ndongu waku anaabhonikanaje kubha umpohiki lihamu palanga.<verse eid="DEU 25:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 25:4" />“Ngawajikonga ng'ombi ndomu chikahi pajipumunda chilebhi.<verse eid="DEU 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cheapalika kuhenga mundu joaweliwi na ndongu waku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 25:5" />“Ngati bhalongu bhabheli akanalomi bhatama pandu pamu, na jumu wabhu anaapotili panga kubhaleka bhana, nhwanu waka mundu jola joapotili ngayitoghuleka kunja ja bhalongu bhanihabha ng'o. Ndongu wa chikambaku waka ndomi waki joapotile impalika antoghulaje mbomba hoju, na kubha nhwanu waki. <verse eid="DEU 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 25:6" />Mwana wa kutumbula joanaambelakaje ampekyaje lihina laka ndongu waki joapotile, nahuli lihina laki ngalihungulika mu Izilaeli. <verse eid="DEU 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 25:7" />Nambu anangati ndongu waka mundu joapotili hoju ngacheapala kuntoghola nhwanu waka ndongu waki, mbomba hoju ajendaje kwa ihongozi pundyangu ukolongwa wa muchi, na kupwagha, ‘Ndongu wa chikambaku waka ndomi wangu akana kuliendeleza lihina laka ndongu waki joapotili mu Izilaeli. Ngacheapala kutimiza lihengu laki kwangu nepani ndamu waki kwa ndandi jaka ndomi wangu joapotile.’ <verse eid="DEU 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 25:8" />Bhela ihongozi bha muchi anabhundohaje na kulonge naku, najombi anaapwaghiki, ‘Ngachembala kuntoghola kubha nhwanu wangu,’ <verse eid="DEU 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 25:9" />nhwanu waka ndongu waki joapotili hoju ajendaje palongi ja ihongozi, anhulaje ligubasi limu na kunhuni imata pamihu, na kumpwaghila, ‘Anana nde moipalakila kuhengewa mundu jola joakana kumpekeha ndongu waki bhabhelakeka.’ <verse eid="DEU 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 25:10" />Bhela lihina laka mundu jonihoju mu Izilaeli analilohakikaje, ‘Nyumba jaka mundu joahulakiki ligubasi.’<verse eid="DEU 25:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shelia nayengi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 25:11" />“Ngati akanalomi bhabheli bhatenda kukomana, na nhwanu waka jumu wabhu anahikiki kunkengalela ndomi waki kwa kunkamu utupu waka mundu jola joakomana na ndomi waki, <verse eid="DEU 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 25:12" />mbomba ipalika unhekataje chiwoku chaki, wala lihu laku ngalambone chiha.<verse eid="DEU 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 25:13" />“Ngawikubha na maganga gha ntundu ubheli gha kupemela mu mfuku waku, limu lelitopiki na lengi lelipepwike. <verse eid="DEU 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 25:14" />Ngawikubha na ipemu ya ntundu ubheli mu nyumba jaku, chimu chikolongwa, na chengi kichoku. <verse eid="DEU 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 25:15" />Ikupalika utumilaje ipemu yeibhi na kutopa kokupalika, nahuli upataje kutama machobha ghamaheli mu inchi jeakupekeha Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku. <verse eid="DEU 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 25:16" />Maghambu bhandu bhokapi bhabhahenga mambu ghanihagha, bhokapi bhabhahenga mambu gha kukolowa, nde mahakalilu palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku.<verse eid="DEU 25:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amuli ja kubhakoma Bhaamaleki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 25:17" />“Nkombukaje chela chebhakunhengili Bhaamaleki mu indela chikahi pamukabhi muhuma ku Misili. <verse eid="DEU 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 25:18" />Chikahi pamukabhi ntondiki na kujomukewa na makili kwa mwanja winu, bhakabhalapwili bhandu bhala bhabhakabhi bhajengalela kunyuma. Bhakahengiki bhenibhela maghambu Bhaamaleki ngachebhunjowipi Chapanga. <verse eid="DEU 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 25:19" />Bhela Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku, paakupekyaje lipomulelu kubhokana na adui bhaku bhokapi bhabhukuyongolota mu inchi jeakupekeha kujitama kubha upwelelu waku, ikupalika uhungulaje kombukombu lokapi la Bhaamaleki pahi ja mbengu. Ngawijewa!<verse eid="DEU 25:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="DEU 26" />
  <para style="s">Nhupu ya mahunu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 26:1" />“Chikahi pawikubha ujingili mu inchi jeakupekeha Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku, kutama mkati jaki ngati upwelelu waku, <verse eid="DEU 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 26:2" />utolaje mahunu gha kutumbula gha ghala ghamwihunaje mu inchi jeakupekeha Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku, ukabhekaje muchitonga, na kujenda naghu pandu pala payihaghulaje Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku, nahuli kubha pandu pa kunjojabhela. <verse eid="DEU 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 26:3" />Unjendilaje mpenganyambiku joanakubhaje mu machobha ghanihagha, na kumpwaghila, ‘Lalenu nyetakela kwaka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga wangu, kubha nyingili mu inchi jeakabhalapili akahokolu bhitu kubha anaatupekyaje.’<verse eid="DEU 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 26:4" />“Bhela mpenganyambiku anaajopalyaje chitonga hechi kuhuma mu mabhoku ghaku, na kuchibheka pahi palongi ja pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku paka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku. <verse eid="DEU 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 26:5" />Bhela witangazaje palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku: ‘Tati wangu akabhi Mwalamu joakabhi pambipi na kuhobha, akahelili ku Misili na kutama konihoku ngati ngeni. Jombi na bhalongu bhaki bhakabhi bhachokopi pela pabhakabhi bhajenda konihoku, akatami konihoku mbaka bhakabhi bhandu bha inchi ngolongwa, jejibhi na makili na bhandu bhamaheli. <verse eid="DEU 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 26:6" />Nambu Bhamisili bhakatubhonili, na kutung'aha, na kutujomalakela kuhenga mahengu ghaghanonwipi gha kitumwa. <verse eid="DEU 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 26:7" />Bhela twakundelili Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga wa akahokolu bhitu, najombi akajowini chilelu chitu, na kughabhona mang'ahiku ghitu, na mahengu ghaghanonwipi na kubhonewa kwitu. <verse eid="DEU 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 26:8" />Bhela, Bambo Chapanga akatubhohiki ku inchi ja Misili kwa chiwoku chaki chechibhi na makili na chechihatambwike, kwa kujoghoha kukolongwa, nginyulila na ngangachu. <verse eid="DEU 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 26:9" />Akatuletiki pandu pambani, na kutupekeha inchi jenjenu, inchi jejibhi na mahibha na buse. <verse eid="DEU 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 26:10" />Nanatu sajenu neta kwaku mahunu gha kutumbula ghanhuniki mungonda wangu mu inchi ambaju wehapa Bambo Chapanga, utehi kumbekeha.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 26:10">“Panihapa ubhekaje chitonga hechi pahi palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku, na kujojabhela palongi jaki Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku. <verse eid="DEU 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 26:11" />Bhela wehapa papamu na Bhalawi, na bhagheni bhokapi bhabhabhi pachilanda jinu muhekalyaje kwa hindu yokapi yamboni ambayu Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku, akupekihi wehapa papamu na bhandu bha munyumba jaku.<verse eid="DEU 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 26:12" />“Kila baada ja hyaka itatu, kila jumu winu anaimpalikaje kubhoha pandu pamu pa komi pa mahunu ghaki ghokapi kwa ndandi ja Bhalawi, bhagheni, bhakebha na bhabhaweliwi na bhalomi bhabhu, nahuli bhawezaje kula chilebhi mu michi jinu. <verse eid="DEU 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 26:13" />Bhela umpwaghila Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku, ‘Hindu yeibhili ihuhu niibhohiki munyumba jangu na kubhapekeha Bhalawi, bhagheni, bhakebha na bhabhaweliwi na bhalomi bhabhu, ngati mounaghalakili nhengaje. Ngachenhekiti amuli yaku wala kujijewa hata jimu. <verse eid="DEU 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 26:14" />Ngachenakuliki pandu pokapi pa zaka jaku panakabhili ndenda kuombuleza, wala ngachenagusiki hindu heyi chikahi panakabhi ngachenyetakalewa palongi jaku, wala ngachemohiki pandu pokapi pala pa hindu yeniheyi kwa ndandi ja bhakuwa. Nyendalili kukutii Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga wangu, na kuhenga kila chindu ngati mounaghalakile. <verse eid="DEU 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 26:15" />Ulingalyaje pahi kuhuma ku matamu ghaku mahuhu gha kunani kumahunde, na ubhapengalyaje bhandu bhaku Izilaeli papamu na inchi jeutupekihe ngati moukabhalapile akahokolu bhitu, inchi jejibhi na mahibha na buse.’<verse eid="DEU 26:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malakalilu kwa bhandu bhaka Bambo Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 26:16" />“Lalenu Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku, akulaghalakila kujengalela amuli na shelia ayeyi yokapi. Bhela uikamulaje na kuitii kwa mtima waku wokapi na kwa roho jaku jokapi. <verse eid="DEU 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 26:17" />Lalenu utangizi kubha Bambo Chapanga nde Chapanga waku, na kubha anaujengalyaje indela yaki, kwa kukamula amuli yaki, shelia yaki, malaghalakilu ghaki na kujijowanela sauti jaki. <verse eid="DEU 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 26:18" />Najombi Bambo Chapanga lalenu anjetakili mwehapa kubha nde bhandu bhaki bhahuhu bhabhatengakiki kwa ndandi jaki mweni, ngati moakalaghile, na kubha impalika kukamula amuli yaki yokapi. <verse eid="DEU 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 26:19" />Atangizi kubha anaambekaje panani kupeta bhandu bha inchi yengi bhokapi bhaabhabhombike. Nanamu anamulikengalyaje lihina laki, ulumbalilu waki na utopelu waki. Mwehapa anamkubhaje bhandu bhahuhu kwaka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, ngati moakalaghile.”<verse eid="DEU 26:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="DEU 27" />
  <para style="s">Amuli yaka Chapanga yeyalembakiki mu ibau ya maganga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 27:1" />Bhela, Musa na ihongozi bha Izilaeli bhakabhalaghalaki bhandu, bhakapwaghaje, “Nkamulaje amuli ayeyi yokapi yenundaghalaki lalenu. <verse eid="DEU 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 27:2" />Lichobha lela pamwikubhaje ndombwiki nkoka Yoludani na kujingila mu inchi jeampekeha Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, njemakaje maganga makolongwa na kughakilima kwa chokaa. <verse eid="DEU 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 27:3" />Ndembaje panani jaki malobhi ghokapi gha shelia yokapi ayeyi, chikahi pamwikubhaje ndombwiki na kujingila mu inchi jeampekeha Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, inchi jejibhi na mahibha na buse, ngati bhela Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga wa akahokolu bhinu, moakundaghalile. <verse eid="DEU 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 27:4" />Pamwikubhaje ndombwiki nkoka Yoludani, mughajemakaje maganga aghagha panani ja chitombi cha Ebali, ngati monundaghalaki lalenu, na kughakilima kwa chokaa. <verse eid="DEU 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 27:5" />Konihoku munchengilaje Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku, nchengaje kwa maganga. Ngamwitumila chombu chokapi chela cha choma panani jaki. <verse eid="DEU 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 27:6" />Munchengilaje Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku kwa maganga ghangakubhachakika, na mumbokihaje Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, nyambiku ya kujochakeka panani jaki. <verse eid="DEU 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 27:7" />Mbohaje nhupu ya kutama kwa lukwali panani jaki, mkulaje na kuhekalela palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu. <verse eid="DEU 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 27:8" />Nanamu ndembaje malobhi ghokapi gha shelia ajeji kwa palanga nakanopi panani ja maganga ghanihagha ghamughajemike.”<verse eid="DEU 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 27:9" />Bhela, Musa na bhapenganyambiku Bhalawi bhakabhapwaghi bhandu bhokapi bha Izilaeli, “Ntumbalaje na njowanyaje mwenga bhandu bha Izilaeli. Lalenu mwehapa mbili bhandu bha inchi jaka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu. <verse eid="DEU 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 27:10" />Bhela ujowanyaje na kutii sauti jaka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku, ujengalyaje amuli yaki na malaghalakilu ghaki ghanukulaghalakila lalenu.”<verse eid="DEU 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Masolu kwa bhangakutii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 27:11" />Bhela Musa akabhalaghalaki bhandu bhanibhala mu lichobha lenilela, akapwaghaje, <verse eid="DEU 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 27:12" />“Pamwikubhaje ndombwiki nkoka Yoludani, makabila aghagha anaghajemaje panani ja chitombi cha Gelizimu kubhapengalela bhandu: Bhandu bha likabila laka Simioni, Lawi, Yuda, Isakali, Yusufu na Benyamini. <verse eid="DEU 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 27:13" />Na makabila aghagha anaghajemaje panani ja chitombi cha Ebali chikahi cha kubhoha masolu: Likabila laka Leubeni, Gadi, Asheli, Zabuloni, Dani na Nafutali. <verse eid="DEU 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 27:14" />Bhela Bhalawi ibhapalika kubhapwaghila bhandu bhokapi bha Izilaeli kwa sauti ngolongwa:<verse eid="DEU 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 27:15" />“ ‘Apataje masolu mundu jola joalenganakela chimong'umong'u cha kubhacha au cha kuyeyusha, na kuchijemeka na kuchijojabhela kwa kulihiya, chindu ambachu nde lihakalilu kwaka Bambo Chapanga, chechilenganakiki kwa ufundi wa mabhoku ghaka mundu.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:15">“Na bhandu bhokapi bhayangaje, ‘Amina!’<verse eid="DEU 27:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 27:16" />“ ‘Apataje masolu mundu jola joanjojoha tati waki na mabhu waki.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:16">“Na bhandu bhokapi bhayangaje, ‘Amina!’<verse eid="DEU 27:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 27:17" />“ ‘Apataje masolu mundu jola joaheghakela liganga la ulindakanilu waka njaki.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:17">“Na bhandu bhokapi bhayangaje, ‘Amina!’<verse eid="DEU 27:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 27:18" />“ ‘Apataje masolu mundu jola joantenda ngalola kuhobha indela.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:18">“Na bhandu bhokapi bhayangaje, ‘Amina!’<verse eid="DEU 27:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 27:19" />“ ‘Apataje masolu mundu jola joahobheha utemulu waka bhagheni, bhakebha na akambomba bhabhaweliwi na bhalomi bhabhu.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:19">“Na bhandu bhokapi bhayangaje, ‘Amina!’<verse eid="DEU 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 27:20" />“ ‘Apataje masolu mwanalomi jola joaghonela kihyegha na nhwanu waka tati waki, maghambu akubha ampohiki lihamu tati waki.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:20">“Na bhandu bhokapi bhayangaje, ‘Amina!’<verse eid="DEU 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 27:21" />“ ‘Apataje masolu mwanalomi jola joaghonela kihyegha na chinyama cha ntundu wokapi ghola.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:21">“Na bhandu bhokapi bhayangaje, ‘Amina!’<verse eid="DEU 27:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 27:22" />“ ‘Apataje masolu mwanalomi jola joaghonela kihyegha na ndombu waki, yani mwali waka tati waki, au mwali waka mabhu waki.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:22">“Na bhandu bhokapi bhayangaje, ‘Amina!’<verse eid="DEU 27:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 27:23" />“ ‘Apataje masolu mmwanalomi jola joaghonela kihyegha na nkowanu waki wa chimbomba.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:23">“Na bhandu bhokapi bhayangaje, ‘Amina!’<verse eid="DEU 27:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 27:24" />“ ‘Apataje masolu mundu jola joankoma njaki kwa kulihiya.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:24">“Na bhandu bhokapi bhayangaje, ‘Amina!’<verse eid="DEU 27:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 27:25" />“ ‘Apataje masolu mundu jola joatola ngolukelu nahuli kunkoma mundu jwangakubha na mahakau.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:25">“Na bhandu bhokapi bhayangaje, ‘Amina!’<verse eid="DEU 27:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 27:26" />“ ‘Apataje masolu mundu jola jwangakukamulakila malobhi gha shelia jenjenu kwa kughatenda.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:26">“Na bhandu bhokapi bhayangaje, ‘Amina!’<verse eid="DEU 27:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="DEU 28" />
  <para style="s">Mbengalelu kwa bhandu bhabhatii</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LEV 26:3-13">Bhalawi 26:3-13</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 7:12-24">Kombukombu la Tolati 7:12-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 28:1" />“Bhela ngati anauntii Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku, kwa kukangamala, na kuitenda amuli yaki yokapi yenukupekeha lalenu, panihapa Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku, anaakupekyaje utopelu panani ja bhandu bha inchi yokapi ya pundema. <verse eid="DEU 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 28:2" />Bhela mbengalelu ayeyi yokapi anaihikaje panani jaku na kuipata, ngati anauntii Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku:<verse eid="DEU 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 28:3" />“Bambo Chapanga anaakupengalya kumbwani, na anaakupengalya kumighonda.<verse eid="DEU 28:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 28:4" />“Bambo Chapanga anaabhapengalya bhabhelakeka bha lutumbu lwaku, na mahunu gha inchi jaku, hinyama yaku ya kudimakika, yani mapogha gha ng'ombi yaku, na bhana bha mambeleli ghaku.<verse eid="DEU 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 28:5" />“Bambo Chapanga anaapengalya mahunu ghaku, na chombu chaku cha kuhunyila uhembi.<verse eid="DEU 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 28:6" />“Bambo Chapanga anaakupengalya chikahi paujingila panyumba, na anaupengaliwaje chikahi paupita munyumba.<verse eid="DEU 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 28:7" />“Bambo Chapanga anaabhatendaje maadui bhabhajinuka palongi jaku wehapa kulepalela. Anabhakuhikila kwa indela jimu, nambu anabhatila palongi jaku kwa indela saba.<verse eid="DEU 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 28:8" />“Bambo Chapanga anaalaghalakyaje mbengalelu ihikaje mu ugholu yaku, na kila chindu chewigusaje kwa chiwoku chaku. Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku, anaakupengalyaje mu inchi jeakupekeha.<verse eid="DEU 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 28:9" />“Bambo Chapanga anaakutendaje kubha bhandu bhaki bhahuhu, ngati moakakulaghile kwa kulapa, anaukamwi amuli yaki Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku, na kujenda mu indela yaki. <verse eid="DEU 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 28:10" />Ngati anamuntii Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, kwa kukangamala, na kujengalela amuli yaki yenumpeke lalenu, panihapa Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, anaantenda kubha na lujiniku panani ja bhandu bha inchi yokapi ya pundema. <verse eid="DEU 28:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 28:11" />Bambo Chapanga anaakutendaje kuneng'anela nakanopi, anaakupekyaje bhana bhamaheli, hinyama yamaheli ya kudimakika, na mahunu gha mumighonda, mu inchi jeakabhalapile kubhapekeha akahokolu bhaku. <verse eid="DEU 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 28:12" />Bambo Chapanga anaahoghulaje mbengu, na chikoku chaki cha mbengalelu, kwa kukutonyela iyula kuhuma mumahundi kwa chikahi chaki chechipalika, na kukupengalela wehapa mu mahengu ghokapi gha mabhoku ghaku. Anaubhajahikaje bhandu bhamaheli, nambu wehapa ngawijahiki kwaka jokapi jola. <verse eid="DEU 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 28:13" />Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku, anaakutendaje wehapa kubha mmutu, wala nga nkela. Nanau anaukubhaje kunani pela, wala ngawikubhi pahi, ngati anaukamwili na kuitenda kwa kukangamala amuli yaka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku, yenukulaghalakila lalenu. <verse eid="DEU 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 28:14" />Ngawikotoka ng'o kuitii amuli yangu yenukupekeha lalenu, kwa kujenda kumalelelu au kumangeja, kwa kujengalela ichapanga nayengi na kuitumakila.<verse eid="DEU 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Masolu kwa bhangakutii</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LEV 26:14-46">Bhalawi 26:14-46</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 28:15" />“Nambu hata bhela, ngati ngacheujitii sauti jaka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku, na kuikamula kwa kukangamala amuli yaki yokapi yenukulaghalakila lalenu, masolu aghagha ghokapi anaghahikaje panani jaku na kukupata:<verse eid="DEU 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 28:16" />“Anaupataje masolu paukubha kumbwani, na anaupataje masolu paukubha kumighonda.<verse eid="DEU 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 28:17" />“Anaupata masolu ngawikubha na mahunu, na chilebhi chechibhokana na mahunu ghanihagha.<verse eid="DEU 28:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 28:18" />“Bhabhelakeka bhaku anabhapata masolu, mahunu gha inchi jaku, mapogha gha ng'ombi yaku na bhanamambeleli ghaku ngaghijonjukeki.<verse eid="DEU 28:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 28:19" />“Anaupataje masolu chikahi paujingila munyumba jaku, na chikahi paupita munyumba jaku.<verse eid="DEU 28:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 28:20" />“Bambo Chapanga anaaletaje masolu panani jaku, kulepa kujongana na mang'ahiku mu kila chindu chewijeghalaje chiwoku chaku kuchihenga, mbaka pawikubhaje uyonangiki manyata kwa ndandi ja uhakau wa matendu ghaku, na kwa ndandi ja kundeka Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="DEU 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 28:21" />Bambo Chapanga anaandetilaje itamu yangakujomoka, mbaka ajomulaje kukuyonanga kuhuma mu inchi jeujingila kujitama. <verse eid="DEU 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 28:22" />Bambo Chapanga anaandapulaje kwa itamu ya kujambukila, chitamu, mapute, kupyopa kukolongwa, ulali, lipanga na likongobha, mambu ghanihagha anaghukupataje mbaka pawikubhaje uyonangiki. <verse eid="DEU 28:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 28:23" />Mbengu jejibhi kunani jaku anajijomaje ngati madini gha shaba panga iyula, na inchi anajijomaje ngati choma. <verse eid="DEU 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 28:24" />Bambo Chapanga anaajitendaje iyula ja inchi jaku kubha mpongu wa luhombi na mpongu wa luhanga, nayombi anayunelilaje kuhuma kunani mbaka pamwikubhaje njomwili kuyonangeka.<verse eid="DEU 28:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 28:25" />“Bambo Chapanga anaakutendaje ulapulikaje palongi ja maadui bhaku. Anaubhajendilaje kwa indela jimu, nambu anautilaje palongi jabhu kwa indela saba. Nanau anaukubhaje chindu cha kuhakaliha kwa bhandu bhokapi bha pundema. <verse eid="DEU 28:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 28:26" />Pawikubha upotili, ntuhi waku anaukubhaje chilebhi cha ijuni yokapi ya kunani, na hinyama yokapi ya pundema, wala ngapikubhi na mundu wa kuitopola. <verse eid="DEU 28:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 28:27" />Bambo Chapanga anaakulapulaje kwa maputi ghaghabhapatiki bhandu bha ku Misili, na kwa ilonda, ikwanda na kunyanya, ambayu ngawiwezi kulama. <verse eid="DEU 28:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 28:28" />Bambo Chapanga anaandapulaje kwa kubha na mangongo, kubha ngalola na kulepa kumanya cha kuhenga. <verse eid="DEU 28:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 28:29" />Chikahi cha muhi anaujendaje kwa kupapaha papaha ngati ngalola mu lubhendu, wala ngawijendaleli mu mahengu ghokapi ghaughahenga. Lichobha kwa lichobha anaubhoniwaje na kunyaghuliwa hindu, wala njeta jokapi jola joanaakukengalyaje.<verse eid="DEU 28:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 28:30" />“Anaubhohaje nhweku kwaka mbomba, nambu mwanalomi jongi anaaghonila naku kihyegha kwa makili. Anauchenga nyumba, nambu ngawitami mkati jaki. Anaupandaje ngonda wa mizabibu, nambu ngawikuli mapambiku ghaki ng'o. <verse eid="DEU 28:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 28:31" />Ng'ombi jaku anajichinjakikaje palongi ja mihu ghaku, nambu ngawikuli inyama jaki. Liponda laku analitolakikaje palongi ja mihu ghaku kwa makili, nambu ngawikelabhukiwe. Mambeleli ghaku anabhapekiwaje adui bhaku, wala ngapikubhi na mundu wa kukukengalela. <verse eid="DEU 28:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 28:32" />Bhana bhaku bha chikambaku na bha chimbomba anabhabhohakikaje kwa bhandu bha inchi nayengi nahuli kubha bhatumwa, koni ukatulaje mihu ghaku muhi jokapi kwa kubhalolakela lichobha kwa lichobha nahuli bhakelabhukaje, nambu ngawikubhi na makili gha kubhakelabhuha bhana bhaku. <verse eid="DEU 28:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 28:33" />Mapambiku gha inchi jaku na mahunu ghokapi gha inchi jaku ghaughahengi lihengu kwa kukangamala, anaitolakikaje na bhandu bha inchi najengi jangakujimanya wehapa, anaubhoniwaje na kutimbakika pahi machobha ghaku ghokapi. <verse eid="DEU 28:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 28:34" />Hindu yewaibhonaje kwa mihu ghaku, anayukutendaje kubha ngati mwanangongo. <verse eid="DEU 28:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 28:35" />Bambo Chapanga anaaghalapulaje majuwa ghaku na magholu ghaku kwa maputi ghaghabhili na mabhinilu makolongwa ghangakuweza kulama, naghombi anaghajaghanyaje kutumbula kulwaju mbaka ku lutohutolu lwa pamutu.<verse eid="DEU 28:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 28:36" />“Bambo Chapanga anaakupelaka wehapa, na nkolongwa joumbekiki panani jaku ku litaifa ambalu mwehapa ngachemulimanyi wala akahokolu bhinu. Konihoku anautumakyaje ichapanga nayengi ya mikongu na maganga. <verse eid="DEU 28:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 28:37" />Nanamu anamkubhaje chindu cha kuhakaliha, kupohakeka lihamu, na chindu cha kukangacha, pachilanda ja bhandu bhokapi koanaampelakaje Bambo Chapanga.<verse eid="DEU 28:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 28:38" />“Anaupandaje imbeju yamaheli mungonda, nambu anauhunaje pachokopi pela, maghambu nzige anaikulaje mahunu ghaku. <verse eid="DEU 28:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 28:39" />Anaupandaje mighonda ja mizabibu na kujikulaghalila, nambu ngawihuni mizabibu jeniheji na kunywa divai jaki, maghambu idudu anaikulaje. <verse eid="DEU 28:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 28:40" />Anaukubhaje na mizeituni pandu pokapi pa inchi jaku, nambu ngawalipaki mahuta ghaki, maghambu mizeituni jaku anajipolutaje. <verse eid="DEU 28:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 28:41" />Anaubhelakaje bhana bha chikambaku na bha chimbomba, nambu ngabhikubhi bhaku wehapa, maghambu anabhatolakika kwa makili na kupelekwa kuutumwa. <verse eid="DEU 28:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 28:42" />Nzige anaikulaje mapambiku ghaku, na mahunu ghaku ghokapi gha mumighonda.<verse eid="DEU 28:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 28:43" />“Ngeni joatama pachilanda jinu mwehapa anaakwelaje kunani nakanopi kupeta wehapa, nambu wehapa anauhelalaje pahi nakanopi. <verse eid="DEU 28:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 28:44" />Jombi anaakujahikaje wehapa, nambu wehapa ngawanjahiki jombi. Jombi anaakubhaje mmutu, nambu wehapa anaukubha nkela.<verse eid="DEU 28:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 28:45" />“Masolu aghagha ghokapi anaghakubhaje panani jaku wehapa, naghombi anaghakujengalyaje na kukupata wehapa mbaka pawikubhaje uyonangike, maghambu ngachewajowanili sauti jaka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku, kwa kukamula amuli yaki na malaghalakilu ghaki ghaakupekihe. <verse eid="DEU 28:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 28:46" />Yeniheyi anaikubhaje ulandilu wa utemulu waka Bambo Chapanga panani jaku na bhabhelakeka bhaku mileli. <verse eid="DEU 28:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="DEU 28:47" />Maghambu Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku, akakupengalili wehapa kwa kila ntundu, nambu wehapa ngacheuntumakili kwa chiheku na kwa mtima wa kuchengula. <verse eid="DEU 28:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="DEU 28:48" />Bhela anaubhatumakyaje maadui bhaku bhanaabhaletaje Bambo Chapanga panani jaku. Anamkubha na injala, inywita, kulepa kubha na ingobhu, na uhochu ghoupetalile. Jombi anaakukongaje chingolingoli cha choma pahingu jaku mbaka paikubhaje ajomwili kukuyonanga. <verse eid="DEU 28:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="DEU 28:49" />Bambo Chapanga anaakuletilaje bhandu bha inchi najengi kuhuma kutali, bhandu ambabhu ngacheujimanyi lugha jabhu, kuhuma ku ujomukelu wa ndema, ngati ngwahe mojihelela kujenda kukamu chindu pahi. <verse eid="DEU 28:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="DEU 28:50" />Bhandu bhabhabhi na sula yangakulangi chiha, na bhangakubhajali bhazee wala akakombu. <verse eid="DEU 28:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="DEU 28:51" />Anabhakulaje hinyama hinu ya kudimakika, na mahunu ghaku gha inchi mbaka pawikubha ujomwili kuyonangeka. Ngabhandekeli chindu chokapi chela, mahunu, divai, mahuta gha zeituni, ng'ombi na mambeleli na anampotilaje. <verse eid="DEU 28:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="DEU 28:52" />Bhandu bhanihabha anabhajiyongalutaje michi jaku jokapi, mbaka lumatu lwaku lulachu lwa ngomi jaku loukabhi ulutegamela palwikubhaje luhawiki pahi. Anabhayongalutaje michi jaku ipambala yokapi mu inchi ambaju Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku, atenda kukupekeha.<verse eid="DEU 28:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="DEU 28:53" />“Chikahi cha maadui bhaku kukuyongalota na kukung'aha, anaukulaje inyama ja bhana bhaku bha chikambaku na bha chimbomba ambabhu Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku, atehi kukupekeha, kubhokana na mang'ahiku ghala ambaghu maadui bhaku anabhakuletilaje pabhikubhaje bhakuyongalwite. <verse eid="DEU 28:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="DEU 28:54" />Hata mundu joabhi ndongwana nakanopi na joaleliwi wichu, na joalainiki nakanopi pachilanda jaku, ngayikubhi na lihu la chiha kwaka ndongu waki mweni, kwaka nhwanu waki joampala nakanopi, na kwa bhana bhaki bhabhahighalili naku. <verse eid="DEU 28:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="DEU 28:55" />Wala ngaangabhi hata jumu wabhu inyama ja bhana bhaki bhaikulaje. Maghambu njeta chindu chengi chechihighalili kwaki mu chikahi chenihechi cha kuyongolotwa na kung'ahakika kukolongwa, ambaku maadui bhaki anabhundetilaje mu michi jaki jokapi. <verse eid="DEU 28:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="DEU 28:56" />Hata mbomba joabhili ndongwana nakanopi na joaleliwi wichu, na joalainiki nakanopi pachilanda jaku, yani ambaju ngachealabhalili kukanyata luhombi kwa lwaju lwa chigholu chaki, najombi anaakubhaje na choju kwaka ndomi waki joampalike, na kwaka mwana waki mweni wa chikambaku na mwali waki mweni. <verse eid="DEU 28:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="DEU 28:57" />Anaabhakulaje bhana bhaki bhang'eng'a bhaabheleka, na lipyanda lelipita anaajomwili kubhelakeka mwana. Maghambu aholalela kubhakula kwa kulihiya bhana bhaki panga hata ndomi waki, au jumu wa bhana bhaki kumanya, mu chikahi cha kuyongolotwa na mang'ahiku ambaghu maadui bhaki anabhaletaje panani jaki mu michi jaki.<verse eid="DEU 28:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="DEU 28:58" />“Ngati ngacheupala kujengalela kwa kukangamala malobhi gha shelia ghaghalembakiki mu chitabu chenjenu, na ngati ngaulitopeli na kulilumbalila lihina la kujoghoha laka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku, <verse eid="DEU 28:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="DEU 28:59" />bhela Bambo Chapanga anaaletaje malapuliku gha kujoghoha panani jaku na kwa bhabhelakeka bhaku, malapuliku makolongwa na gha kutamakila, na itamu ikolongwa na ya kutamakila nakanopi. <verse eid="DEU 28:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="DEU 28:60" />Bhelabhela anaakuletilaje kabhete itamu yokapi yeyakabhapatiki bhandu bha ku Misili yeukaiweni na kuijoghopa, nayombi anayunjengalyaje chikahi chokapi. <verse eid="DEU 28:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="DEU 28:61" />Bhelabhela Bambo Chapanga anaandetilaje kila ntundu wa chitamu na mang'ahiku ghangi ambayu ngacheilembakiki momboni mu chitabu cha shelia, mbaka pawikubhaje ujomwili kuyonangeka. <verse eid="DEU 28:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="DEU 28:62" />Mwehapa ambabhu mkabhi bhamaheli ngati ndondwa ya kunani, anamuhighalyaje bhachokopi pela kwa ubhalangiku, maghambu ngachemwajowanili na kujitii sauti jaka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu. <verse eid="DEU 28:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="DEU 28:63" />Kabhete, anakukubhaje ngati Bambo Chapanga moakabheli ahekalela panani jinu chikahi mwehapa pamkabhi mneng'anela na kujonjukeka kwa ubhalangiku, bhenibhela nde Bambo Chapanga moanahekalyaje kunjonanga mwehapa. Nanamu anambohakikaje mu inchi jeniheji jenjingila kujenda kutama.<verse eid="DEU 28:63" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="DEU 28:64" />“Bhela Bambo Chapanga anaantendaje mwehapa kupechangana pachilanda ja bhandu bha inchi yokapi, kuhuma ku ujomukelu ghumu wa ndema mbaka ku ujomukelu ghongi. Nanamu anantumakyaje ichapanga nayengi konihoku, ichapanga ya mikongu na maganga, yangakuimanya wehapa wala akahokolu bhaku. <verse eid="DEU 28:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="DEU 28:65" />Pachilanda ja bhandu bha inchi yeniheyi ngamwipati chiheku cha ntundu wokapi ghola, wala pandu pinu mabhete pa kupomulela. Nambu Bambo Chapanga anaantendaje mpataje choghoi chikolongwa mu mitima jinu, mihu ghaghatondike kwa kulendalela na mtima ghouhekiti utokulelu. <verse eid="DEU 28:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="DEU 28:66" />Anautamaje mu mang'ahiku machobha ghokapi, na anaukubhaje na choghoi ikilu na muhi, wala ngawikubhi na uchakaka na matamu ghaku ng'o. <verse eid="DEU 28:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="DEU 28:67" />Chikahi cha lukela anaupwaghaje, ‘Anangati kukabhi pakamihi!’ Na pakamihi anaupwaghaje, ‘Anangati kukabhi lukela!’ Wiholalyaje bhenibhela kwa ndandi ja choghoi chela chechitwelakyaje mtima waku, papamu na hindu yela ambayu anawibhonaje kwa mihu ghaku. <verse eid="DEU 28:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="DEU 28:68" />Bambo Chapanga anaakukelabhuhaje kabhete ku Misili kwa sitima, mwanja ambau nakakupwaghili kubha ngawijendi kabhete ng'o. Konihoku anamulilombisaje mabhete kwa maadui bhinu ngati bhatumwa bha chikambaku na bha chimbomba, nambu njeta mundu jokapi jola joanaanhemalaje.”<verse eid="DEU 28:68" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="DEU 29" />
  <para style="s">Lulaghilu lwaka Bambo Chapanga na Bhaizilaeli mu inchi ja Moabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 29:1" />Aghagha nde malobhi gha lulaghilu ambalu Bambo Chapanga akundaghalaki Musa kutenda na bhandu bha Izilaeli mu inchi ja Moabu, kwa kujonjukela lulaghilu loakahengiki Bambo Chapanga ku chitombi cha Holebu hoku.<verse eid="DEU 29:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 29:2" />Musa akabhalohiki bhandu bhokapi bha Izilaeli na kubhapwaghila, “Mihu ghinu ghaweni mambu ghokapi Bambo Chapanga ghaakamuhengile nkolongwa Falao ku inchi ja Misili, papamu na ihongozi bhaki, bhatumwa bhaki, na kwa inchi jaki jokapi. <verse eid="DEU 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 29:3" />Kwa mihu ghinu mabhete mkaweni malapuliku makolongwa, nginyulila na ngangachu ikolongwa yeakahengiki Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="DEU 29:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 29:4" />Nambu mbaka lalenu Bambo Chapanga ngacheampekihi malangu gha kumanya, mihu gha kubhona, na makutu gha kujowana kwa ghala ghamughapetile. <verse eid="DEU 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 29:5" />Kwa chikahi cha hyaka alobaini, nepani nakabhi nundongoha mulipololu, ingobhu hinu ngacheyahakie, wala magubasi ghinu ngacheghahakie mu magholu ghinu. <verse eid="DEU 29:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 29:6" />Ngachemwakuliki libumunda, wala ngachemwakunywiki divai, wala chindu chokapi chela cha kulobhela. Nambu Bambo Chapanga akunjangatile, nahuli mpata kumanya kubha jombi nde Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu. <verse eid="DEU 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 29:7" />Chikahi patukahikiki pandu pambani, Sihoni nkolongwa wa Heshiboni, na Ogu nkolongwa wa Bashani, bhakahikiki kukomana ngondo na tepani, nambu tepani tukabhawezike. <verse eid="DEU 29:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 29:8" />Tukajitoliki inchi jabhu na kubhapekeha makabila gha Bhaleubeni, Bhagadi na nusu ja likabila laka Manase, kubha upwelelu wabhu. <verse eid="DEU 29:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 29:9" />Bhela, nkamulaje kwa ukangamalu malobhi gha lulaghilu londone, nahuli mpata kuneng'anela mu mambu ghokapi ghamughahenga.<verse eid="DEU 29:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 29:10" />“Lalenu mwehapa mabhokapi njemiki palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, koni mkabyaje papamu na ihongozi bha makabila ghinu, ihongozi bhinu, bhazee bhinu, na akanalomi bhangi bhokapi bha Izilaeli, <verse eid="DEU 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 29:11" />na akabhahanu bhinu, bhana bhinu, papamu na bhagheni bhabhatama mu makambi ghinu ambabhu bhunhalila hanju na kuntekela machi. <verse eid="DEU 29:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 29:12" />Mbili pambani lalenu nahuli kutenda lulaghilu na Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, lulaghilu ambalu Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, alutenda na mwehapa lalenu, na kulujeghela muhuli kwa kulapa, <verse eid="DEU 29:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 29:13" />na kundangiha kwa uchakaka lichobha la lalenu kubha mwehapa nde ngati bhandu bhaki mweni, nahuli awezaje kubha Chapanga winu, ngati moakakulaghile, na ngati moakabhalapile akahokolu bhinu Ibulahimu, Isaka na Yakobo. <verse eid="DEU 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 29:14" />Wala ngachendenda lulaghilu londoni na kulapa koni na mwehapa kanjika jinu pela, <verse eid="DEU 29:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 29:15" />nambu papamu na jola joajemiki na tepani pambani palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga witu, papamu na bhabhelakeka bhitu bhangakubha pambani lalenu.<verse eid="DEU 29:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 29:16" />“Mwehapa mabhete mmanyi ntundu motwatamile mu inchi ja Misili, na ntundu motwapetile pachilanda ja bhandu bha inchi nayengi mbaka kuhika pambane. <verse eid="DEU 29:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 29:17" />Mkaweni imong'umong'u yabhu ya kuhakaliha yebhakabhi bhaijojabhela, na ichapanga ya mikongu, maganga, madini gha feza na zahabu yebhakabhi nayu. <verse eid="DEU 29:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 29:18" />Mlilingalyaje kubha ngapikubha na mwanalomi au mbomba, lukolu au likabila lokapi lela pachilanda jinu, leanalundekaje Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga witu, na kujenda kuitumakila ichapanga nayengi ya mataifa ghanihagha. Lijambu leniheli analikubha ngati nkegha ghoumela na kupambika mapambiku mabhabha ngati chikau. <verse eid="DEU 29:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 29:19" />Mundu jokapi anaajomwili kujowana malobhi aghagha gha kulapa, na kutumbula kulipengalela mweni muntima waki, na kupwagha, ‘Anangubha lukwali, hata ngati ananyendalile kujijengalela indela jangu namwete.’ Lijambu leniheli analiletaje malapuliku kwa inchi jejitonyi iyula na kubha jijomu. <verse eid="DEU 29:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 29:20" />Bambo Chapanga ngaandekakeli mundu jonihoju ng'o, inyela na wihu waka Bambo Chapanga, anaibhelalaje panani jaka mundu jonihoju, na masolu ghokapi ghaghalembakiki mu chitabu chenjenu anaghuntamilaje panani jaki, na Bambo Chapanga anaalihungulaje lihina laki pahi pundema pani. <verse eid="DEU 29:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 29:21" />Bambo Chapanga anaantengaje mundu jonihoju kwa uhakau waki kuhuma mu makabila ghokapi gha Izilaeli, nahuli ghumpataje mayonangeku, kulengana na masolu ghokapi gha lulaghilu ghaghalembakiki mu chitabu chenjenu cha Shelia.<verse eid="DEU 29:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 29:22" />“Mu ibheleku yaku yeijengalyaje baada jaku wehapa, na ngeni joanahikaje kuhuma ku inchi ja kutali, anabhaghabhonaje malapuliku ghaghajipatiki inchi jenjenu, na hitamu na mang'ahiku ghaakaletiki Bambo Chapanga panani ja inchi jenjenu. <verse eid="DEU 29:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 29:23" />Inchi jokapi anajitwelalaje madini gha baluti na mwinyu, jiyonangiki na kubha jitopu, ngachejipandakika imbeju, wala ngachejipiha mahunu, wala ngapikubhi na manyonyoli ghaghimelaje panani jaki. Anaghakubhaje ngati mayonangeku gha Sodoma na Gomola, Adima na Seboimu, ambayu Bambo Chapanga akaiyoningi kwa inyela jaki jikali. <verse eid="DEU 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 29:24" />Bhela bhandu bha inchi yengi yokapi anabhapwaghaje, ‘Bho, maghambu kike Bambo Chapanga ajihengili inchi jabhu ajeji anana? Bho, inyela ayeyi ikali ndandi jaki kike?’ <verse eid="DEU 29:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 29:25" />Panihapa bhandu anabhayangaje, ‘Nde kwa ndandi bhandu abhabha bhakalulekiki lulaghilu lwaka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga wa akahokolu bhabhu, lulaghilu loakatendiki nabhu chikahi paakabhabhohiki mu inchi ja Misili. <verse eid="DEU 29:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 29:26" />Bhakapiti na kuitumakila ichapanga nayengi, na kuijojabhela ichapanga yangakuimanya, ambayu Bambo Chapanga akabhakanakili ngabhijojabhela. <verse eid="DEU 29:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 29:27" />Bhela inyela yaka Bambo Chapanga yakabhelili panani ja bhandu bha inchi ajeji, kwa kuleta panani jaki masolu ghokapi ghaghalembakiki mu chitabu chenjenu. <verse eid="DEU 29:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 29:28" />Bhela, Bambo Chapanga akabhabhohiki kuhuma mu inchi jabhu kwa inyela jikali, na imbuka ikolongwa, na kubhakangila mu inchi najengi, ngati mokubheli lalenu.’<verse eid="DEU 29:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 29:29" />“Mambu ghaghalihiike nde ghaka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga witu, nambu ghala ghaghayekuliwi nde ghitu tepani na bhana bhitu mileli, nahuli tuwezaje kughahenga malobhi ghokapi gha shelia jenjenu.<verse eid="DEU 29:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="DEU 30" />
  <para style="s">Bambo Chapanga abhapengalyaje bhandu bhaki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 30:1" />“Bhela Musa akajendalili kupwagha: Chikahi mambu aghagha ghokapi paghakuhikilaje palongi jaku, gha kuhaghula mbengalelu na masolu, nanau pawikubhaje ughakomboka pachilanda ja bhandu bha ichi yokapi, pandu ambapu Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku, anaakupelakaje, <verse eid="DEU 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 30:2" />nanau pawankelabhukyaje Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku, na kujitii sauti jaki kwa roho jaku jokapi na kwa mtima waku wokapi, kulengana na mambu ghokapi ghanukulaghalakila lalenu, wehapa papamu na bhana bhaku, <verse eid="DEU 30:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 30:3" />panihapa Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku, anaakukelabhukyaje ghamboni ghaku, najombi anaakubhonila chiha, na kukubhongana kabhete kuhuma mu inchi yokapi ambayu Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku, akakupechangine. <verse eid="DEU 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 30:4" />Hata ngati bhandu bhaku bhapechangini ku inchi ya kutali nakanopi pundema, kuhuma konihoku Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku, anaabhabhonganaji na kubhakelabhuha. <verse eid="DEU 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 30:5" />Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku, anaakukelabhuhaje ujingalaje mu inchi jebhakatami akahokolu bhaku, nanau anautama monihomu. Najombi anaakutendilaje mambu ghamboni na kukujonjukela kubha bhandu bhamaheli kupeta akahokolu bhaku. <verse eid="DEU 30:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 30:6" />Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku, anaakutendaje wehapa na bhana bhaku mkubhaje na mtima wa kutii, nahuli muwezaje kumpala Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, kwa mtima winu wokapi, na kwa roho jinu jokapi, na mpataje kubha bhomi. <verse eid="DEU 30:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 30:7" />Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku, anaatendaje masolu aghagha ghokapi ghabhapataje maadui bhaku bhabhakuhakalila, na bhabhakabhili bhakung'aha wehapa. <verse eid="DEU 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 30:8" />Nanau anaukelabhukaje na kujitii sauti jaka Bambo Chapanga kabhete, na kuikamula amuli yaki yokapi yenukulaghalakila lalenu. <verse eid="DEU 30:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 30:9" />Bhela Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku, anaakutendaje uneng'anyaje mu mahengu ghokapi ghaughahenga kwa mabhoku ghaku, anaukubhaje na bhabhelakeka bhamaheli, ng'ombi yamaheli na mighonda jaku anajipihaje mahunu ghamaheli. Bambo Chapanga anaakuhekalyaje kabhete na kukutenda uneng'anyaje, ngati moakahekalile papani ja akahokolu bhaku. <verse eid="DEU 30:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 30:10" />Nambu ikupalika kuntii Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku, kwa kughakamula malaghalakilu ghaki, na amuli yaki yeilembakiki mu chitabu chenjenu cha shelia, na kung'anambukila Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku, kwa mtima waku wokapi, na kwa roho jaku jokapi.<verse eid="DEU 30:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 30:11" />“Maghambu amuli ayeyi yenukulaghalakila wehapa lalenu, ngacheinonwipi kuikamula, wala ngacheibhi kutali na wehapa. <verse eid="DEU 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 30:12" />Ngacheibhi kunani kumahunde, mbaka upwaghaje, ‘Bho, nde nane joanakwelaje kunani kumahunde kujenda kutuletela, na kuhika kutupwaghila tujowanyaje, nahuli tupata kuitii?’ <verse eid="DEU 30:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 30:13" />Wala ngacheibhi kwihi ja kabheli ja bahali, mbaka upwaghaje, ‘Bho, nde nane joanalombuka bahali kujenda kutuletela, na kuhika kutupwaghila tujowanyaje, nahuli tupata kuitii?’ <verse eid="DEU 30:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 30:14" />Ngabhela, nambu lilobhi leniheli libhi pambipi na wehapa namaa, libhi mundomu waku na muntima waku, nahuli uwezaje kulitii.<verse eid="DEU 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 30:15" />“Lingalyaje, lalenu nukubhekili palongi jaku nahuli uhaghulaje ghamboni au mahakau, na womi au nyiwa. <verse eid="DEU 30:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 30:16" />Nukulaghalakila lalenu kubha umpalaje Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku, na ujendaje mu indela yaki yokapi, na kukamula malaghalakilu ghaki, amuli yaki na shelia yaki, nahuli upataje kubha wamwomi na kujonjukeka. Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku, anaakupengalyaje mu inchi jeujingila kujenda kujitama. <verse eid="DEU 30:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 30:17" />Nambu anangati mtima waku anaung'anambukili kutali, na kukana kuitii, ngati anauhutakiki kutali kujenda kuijojabhela ichapanga nayengi, na kuitumakila, <verse eid="DEU 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 30:18" />nukutangazi lalenu kubha chakaka anauyonangikaje. Ngawitami kwa machobha ghamaheli mu inchi jeulomboka nkoka Yoludani, na kujingila kujenda kujitama. <verse eid="DEU 30:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 30:19" />Niiloha mbengu na ndema kubha ngati bhalandilu panani jaku lalenu, kubha nukubhekili palongi jaku womi au nyiwa, mbengalelu au masolu. Bhela, uhaghulaje womi, nahuli wehapa na bhabhelakeka bhaku mpataje kutama, <verse eid="DEU 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 30:20" />na kumpala Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku, kwa kujijowanela sauti jaki, na kukamulana naku. Maghambu kuhenga bhenibhela nde womi waku, na kulangiha kubha anaupataje kutama machobha ghamaheli, na kutama mu inchi ambaju Bambo Chapanga akabhalapili akahokolu bhaku, Ibulahimu, Isaka na Yakobo, kubha anaabhapekyaje.”<verse eid="DEU 30:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="DEU 31" />
  <para style="s">Yoshua atola pandu paka Musa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="NUM 27:12-23">Hesabu 27:12-23</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 31:1" />Bhela Musa akajendali kubhapwaghi Bhaizilaeli malobhi aghagha ghokapi, <verse eid="DEU 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 31:2" />akabhapwaghile, “Nepani sajenu mili na umuli wa hyaka mia jimu na ishilini, nanatu ngachemili kabhete na makili gha kupita na kujingila. Bhelabhela Bambo Chapanga ambwaghili, ‘Ngawilomboki nkoka aghoghu wa Yoludani.’ <verse eid="DEU 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 31:3" />Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, anaalombukaje palongi jinu, na kubhayonanga bhandu bha inchi ayeyi palongi jinu, nanamu anamujitamaje inchi jabhu, na Yoshua anaalombukaje palongi jinu, ngati Bambo Chapanga moakapwaghile. <verse eid="DEU 31:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 31:4" />Bambo Chapanga anaabhayonangaje bhandu bhanihabha ngati moakabhahengile Sihoni na Ogu, bhakolongwa bha Bhaamoli, ambabhu akabhayoningi papamu na inchi jabhu. <verse eid="DEU 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 31:5" />Bambo Chapanga anaabhajeghalaje bhandu bhanihabha mumabhoku ghinu, nanamu impalika mubhahengilaje kulengana na amuli jela jenundaghalakile. <verse eid="DEU 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 31:6" />Mkangamalaje na kubha na mtima ghoubhi na makili. Ngamwijoghopa wala ngamubhahola, maghambu Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, anaajendaje papamu na mwehapa, ngayikotoki kunjangatila wala ngaandeki mwehapa.”<verse eid="DEU 31:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 31:7" />Bhela Musa akundohiki Yoshua, na kumpwaghila palongi ja bhandu bhokapi bha Izilaeli, “Ukangamalaje na ukubhaje na mtima ghoubhi na makili, maghambu ikupalika ujendaje papamu na bhandu abhabha ku inchi jela ambaju Bambo Chapanga akabhalapili kubhapekeha akahokolu bhaku, nanau ikupalika ubhaghabhilaje kubha upwelelu wabhu. <verse eid="DEU 31:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 31:8" />Bambo Chapanga mweni anaakulongulyaje, na anaakubhaje papamu na wehapa, ngaakukepakeli wala kukuleka ng'o. Bhela ngawijoghopa, wala ngawihola.”<verse eid="DEU 31:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kusoma kabhete Shelia mu kila chaka cha saba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 31:9" />Bhela, Musa akajilembiki shelia ajeji na kubhapekeha bhapenganyambiku bha lukolu lwaka Lawi, bhabhakatoliki Lisanduku la Lulaghilu laka Bambo Chapanga, bhelabhela akabhapeki na bhazee bhokapi bha Izilaeli. <verse eid="DEU 31:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 31:10" />Musa akabhalaghalakili, akapwaghaje, “Mu ujomukelu wa kila chaka cha saba, mu chaka cha kulekakela madene, mu chikahi chechilaghalakiwi cha Uwangalalu wa Indamba, <verse eid="DEU 31:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 31:11" />chikahi bhandu bhokapi bha Izilaeli pabhahika kunjojabhe Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, pandu pala paanahaghulaje, wisomaje shelia ajeji palongi ja bhandu bhokapi bha Izilaeli koni bhakajowanaje. <verse eid="DEU 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 31:12" />Ubhabhonganaje bhandu bhokapi, akanalomi, akambomba, bhana na bhagheni bhabhabhi mu michi jinu, nahuli kila mundu apataje kujowana na kulibhola kuntopela Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, na kujengalela kwa kughatenda malobhi ghokapi ghaghalembakiki mu shelia jenjenu. <verse eid="DEU 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 31:13" />Bhana bhabhu ambabhu ngachebhajimanyi shelia ajeji, ibhapalika bhajowanaje na kulibhola kuntopela Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, machobha ghokapi ghamwitamaje mu inchi jela jendomboka kwihi ja nkoka Yoludani kujenda kujitama.”<verse eid="DEU 31:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malaghalakilu gha kujomulela ghaka Bambo Chapanga kwaka Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 31:14" />Bhela, Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Musa, “Lingalyaje, lichobha laku la kupotela liheghalile, undoha Yoshua, na muhikaje mabhokapi mu lihema la kuhimanganila, nahuli numpekyaje malaghalakilu ghaki gha lihengu.” Bhela Musa na Yoshua bhakapiti, na kubhonikana mkati ja lihema la kuhimanganila. <verse eid="DEU 31:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 31:15" />Bambo Chapanga akabhonakini mu Lihema mu nguzu ja lihundi, nalombi lihundi heli lakajemiki panani ja ndyangu wa kujingalila mu Lihema.<verse eid="DEU 31:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 31:16" />Bhela Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Musa, “Lingalyaje, wehapa anaupotilaje na kujenda kutaghakika papamu na akahokolu bhaku, na anaujomwili kupotela bhandu abhabha anabhatumbulaje kuneka nepani na kujenda kuijojabhela ichapanga ya chigheni ya mu inchi jebhajenda kutama mkati jaki. Anabhanekaje na kuheketa lulaghilu lwangu lonahengiki nabhu. <verse eid="DEU 31:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 31:17" />Panihapa inyela yangu anaibhelalaje panani jabhu, nanatu ananabhalekaje na kubhahiya pamihu jangu, nabhombi anabhayonangikaje. Mahakau ghamaheli na mang'ahiku ghamaheli anaihikaje panani jabhu, mbaka pabhipwaghaje, ‘Bho, mahakau ghangani le ghahika panani jitu maghambu Chapanga ngacheabhi pachilanda jitu?’ <verse eid="DEU 31:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 31:18" />Chakaka nanatu nganabhajangatili lichobha leniheli, maghambu bhahengiki mahakau ghokapi hagha kwa kuing'anambukila ichapanga nayenge.<verse eid="DEU 31:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 31:19" />“Bhela sajenu ulembaje lujembu londone, ubhabholaje bhandu bha Izilaeli na kubhalaghalakila bhajembaje, nahuli lupataje kubha mlandilu wangu, pachilanda ja bhandu bha Izilaeli. <verse eid="DEU 31:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 31:20" />Ananyomwili kumpeleka mu inchi jejibhi na mahibha na buse, inchi jenakabhalaghili akahokolu bhabhu kwa kulapa, nabhombi anabhakuliki na kutupila na kuneng'anela, anabhang'anambukaje na kuijojabhela ichapanga nayengi, kwa kunyojoha nepani na kuheketa lulaghilu lwangu. <verse eid="DEU 31:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 31:21" />Mahakau na mang'ahiku ghanihagha anaghajomwili kuhika panani jabhu, lujembu alolu analubhalandilaje pachilanda jabhu, maghambu ngalwijewakeki na bhabhelakeka bhabhu. Ndandi manyi lijambu lela lebhaholalela kulihenga, hata mangani ngachenabhajingihi mu inchi jenakabhalaghili kwa kulapa.”<verse eid="DEU 31:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 31:22" />Bhela, Musa akalulembiki lujembu loniholu mu lichobha leleli, na kubhabhola bhandu bha Izilaeli.<verse eid="DEU 31:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 31:23" />Bhela Bambo Chapanga akundaghalaki Yoshua mwana waka Nuni, akapwaghaje, “Ukangamalaje na ukubhaje na makili, maghambu anaubhapelakaje bhandu bha Izilaeli mu inchi jenabhalaghili kwa kulapa, nanatu namwete anangubhaje papamu na wehapa.”<verse eid="DEU 31:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 31:24" />Bhela Musa paakajomwili kulemba malobhi gha shelia ajeji mu chitabu kutumbu pakutumbula mbaka pakujomukela, <verse eid="DEU 31:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 31:25" />Musa akabhalaghalaki Bhalawi bhabhakabhi bhalitotola Lisanduku la Lulaghilu laka Bambo Chapanga, na kubhapwaghila, <verse eid="DEU 31:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 31:26" />“Ntolaje Chitabu achechi cha Shelia, mkachibhekaje pambipi na Lisanduku la Lulaghilu laka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, nahuli chikubhaje ngati mlandilu pachilanda jinu. <verse eid="DEU 31:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 31:27" />Maghambu nummanyi ntundu mombelile bhangakutii na mwembi na ing'omu. Ndingalyaje, ngati mkana kuntii Bambo Chapanga chikahi nepani mili papamu na mwehapa, bho, anamkotukaje kuntii mala palenga chikahi nepani anambotile? <verse eid="DEU 31:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 31:28" />Mubhabhonganaje bhazee bhokapi bha makabila ghinu, na ihongozi bhinu, nahuli mbata kulonge nabhu malobhi ghangani koni bhakajowanyaje, nayombi mbengu na ndema ilandilaje panani jabhu. <verse eid="DEU 31:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 31:29" />Maghambu manyi kubha nepani anambotili, chakaka anamkubha bhahakau nakanopi na kung'anambuka kuhuma mu indela jenundaghalaki kujijengalela. Mu machobha ghaghahika, mang'ahiku anaghumpataje kwa ndandi anamtenda mahakau palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga, na kuchochakela inyela yaki kwa mambu ghala ghamwihengaje kwa mabhoku ghinu.”<verse eid="DEU 31:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lujembu lwaka Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 31:30" />Bhela Musa akaghasomiki malobhi gha lujembu alolu palongi ja lipogha lokapi la bhandu bha Izilaeli, mbaka paghajomwike.<verse eid="DEU 31:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="DEU 32" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 32:1" />“Mwenga mbengu na ndema, njowanyaje malobhi ghangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:1">njowanya wichu ghala ghanongela.<verse eid="DEU 32:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 32:2" />Mabholu ghangu na ghatonyaje ngati iyula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:2">na malobhi ghangu anaghabhajangatya bhandu bhabhajowanela.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:2">Ngati lumeme lwa iyula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:2">molujangatila mimea kukola.<verse eid="DEU 32:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 32:3" />Ndandi ananilitangazaje lihina laka Bambo Chapanga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:3">Na kila mundu apalika amanya kubha Chapanga witu nde nkolongwa namaa.”<verse eid="DEU 32:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 32:4" />“Bambo Chapanga nde Lindalaghu la kubha lukwali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:4">mahengu ghaki ghokapi ghakamilike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:4">ndandi indela yaki yokapi nde ya chakaka.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:4">Jombi nde Chapanga ndongwana, jwangakubha na uhakau,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:4">jombi ahenga mambu gha chakaka na ghaghapalika.<verse eid="DEU 32:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 32:5" />Mwehapa mlepiki kubha na ulongwana palongi jaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:5">mwehapa nga mabhana bhaki kabhete kwa ndandi ja uhakau winu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:5">mwehapa nde chibheleku chihakau na chechihobhike.<verse eid="DEU 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 32:6" />Bho, anana le nde indela ja kundepa Bambo Chapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:6">mwenga mabhandu bhang'ang'a na bhangakubha na mbulau?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:6">Bho, jombi le nga Atati winu joambombike, joantendike na kumbeka kubha mwembi na makile?”<verse eid="DEU 32:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 32:7" />“Ukombukaje machobha gha mwande, uholalyaje hyaka ya ibheleku yamaheli yeipetike.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:7">Mubhalalukya akatati bhinu, nabhombi anabhumpwaghila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:7">ubhalalukyaje bhazee bhaku, nabhombi anabhakulandilaje.<verse eid="DEU 32:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 32:8" />Chapanga Joabhile Kunani Nakanopi paakabhapekihi bhandu bha inchi nayengi upwelelu wabhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:8">paakabhagabhinyi bhandu bhokapi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:8">akabhekiki malindakanilu kwa ndandi ja inchi, kwa kulengana na ubhalangiku wa bhandu bha Izilaeli.<verse eid="DEU 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 32:9" />Maghambu pandu paka Bambo Chapanga nde bhandu bhaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:9">bhabhelakeka bhaka Yakobo nde mali gha upwelelu waki.”<verse eid="DEU 32:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 32:10" />“Akabhahimanili bhayongolota mu inchi ja lipololu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:10">na mulipololu litopu lelijoghoha.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:10">Akungohiki na kundenda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:10">na akundendiki ngati lihu laki mweni.<verse eid="DEU 32:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 32:11" />Ngati ngwahe joayonanga chinhuwi chaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:11">na kuhomba homba panani ja makenda ghaki.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:11">Akahatambula mapapanilu ghaki, nahuli kubhakamulakila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:11">na kubhatola panani ja mapapanilu ghaki.<verse eid="DEU 32:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 32:12" />Bambo Chapanga kanjika jaki nde joakabhalongwihe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:12">wala ngachepakabhili na kichapanga wa chigheni papamu naku.”<verse eid="DEU 32:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 32:13" />“Akabhatendiki bhakwelaje pandu pa inchi papajinwike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:13">nabhombi akabhalehiki mahunu gha mumighonda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:13">Akundetili buse kuhuma mu lindalaghu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:13">na mahuta gha zeituni kuhuma mu mizeituni jejibhi mu luhombi lwa maganga.<verse eid="DEU 32:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 32:14" />Akabhapekihi mahibha ghaghagandiki gha ng'ombi na mahibha gha mambeleli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:14">papamu na mahuta gha bhanambeleli, na imbuhi, mambeleli makambaku kuhuma ku Bashani, na inganu jinyahi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:14">Na mkanywili divai jinyahi kuhuma mu mizabibu.”<verse eid="DEU 32:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 32:15" />“Nambu bhandu bha Izilaeli bhakanenipi, na kulapula mateke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:15">bhakanenipi na kubha na chitambi, na kuneng'anela namaa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:15">Bhela bhakundekiki Chapanga joabhabhombike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:15">na kunjojoha Lindalaghu la Ukengaleku wabhu.<verse eid="DEU 32:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 32:16" />Bhakuntendiki Chapanga kubha na wihu kwa ichapanga yabhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:16">na kuntenda kubha na inyela kwa imong'umong'u yabhu ya mahakalilu.<verse eid="DEU 32:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 32:17" />Bhakabhohiki nyambiku kwa majobhi, ambayu nga Chapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:17">bhakaijendili ichapanga ambayu ngachebhimanyi ng'o,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:17">ichapanga yahenu yeyapitalile mu machobha gha henu kateki, ichapanga ambayu akahokolu bhabhu ngachebhitopile.<verse eid="DEU 32:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 32:18" />Ngachemunkomboka Lindalaghu joambelike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:18">mundibhalili Chapanga joambeliki mwehapa.”<verse eid="DEU 32:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 32:19" />“Bambo Chapanga akaliweni lijambu leniheli na kubhaleka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:19">akabhakaniki bhana bhaki bha chikambaku na bha chimbomba.<verse eid="DEU 32:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 32:20" />Panihapa akapwaghike, ‘Nepani nganabhajangati kabhete,’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:20">na anamonaje ujomukelu wabhu anaukubha kike.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:20">Maghambu nde chibheleku chechibhi na ing'omu namaa, na nde bhana bhangakuhobhaleka.<verse eid="DEU 32:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 32:21" />Bhandendiki ngubha na wihu kwa bhombi kuitumakila ichapanga ya upuhe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:21">na bhandendiki ngubha na inyela kwa imong'umong'u yabhu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:21">Nanatu ananabhatendaje bhabhonaje wihu kwa bhandu bhala ambabhu nga litaifa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:21">ananabhatendaje bhahakalyaje,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:21">kwa kutumila litaifa la bhandu bhang'ang'a.<verse eid="DEU 32:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 32:22" />Maghambu moto upambakiki kwa inyela yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:22">na uyonanga mbaka pahi kuwawa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:22">ujocha ndema papamu na mahunu ghaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:22">na kujocha misingi ja itombi.”<verse eid="DEU 32:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 32:23" />“ ‘Ananundikaje malapuliku panani jabhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:23">na kubhalapula kwa mishali jangu mbaka jijomukaje.<verse eid="DEU 32:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 32:24" />Anandumaje injala ngolongwa kwabhu bhakombalaje,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:24">na kubhayonanga kwa itamu ihakau.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:24">Anambelakaje hinyama yeibhili na minu ghaghatema kubhayonanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:24">na majoka ghaghabhi na chikau ghaghakwabha muluhombi.<verse eid="DEU 32:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 32:25" />Ngondo anajipelakyaje nyiwa yamaheli kunja,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:25">na mumanyumba ghabhu anachitawala choghoi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:25">Akakombu bhabhu akanalomi na akambomba anabhayonangikaje,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:25">bhelabhela kwa bhana bhang'eng'a na bhazee bhabhabhi na huliya.<verse eid="DEU 32:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 32:26" />Nakapwaghiki kubha ananabhapechangana kutali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:26">na kuhungula kombukombu labhu pachilanda ja bhandu.<verse eid="DEU 32:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 32:27" />Nambu nganabhaleki maadui bhabhu bhalilumbalyaje,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:27">maadui bhabhu ngabhihika kupwagha malobhi gha upuhe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:27">ngabhihika kupwagha kubha bhaweziki kubhayonanga, nanatu Bambo Chapanga ngachenhengiki chindu chokapi chela kwabhu.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 32:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 32:28" />“Bhaizilaeli nde litaifa langakubha na malangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:28">ngachebhabhi na umanyi mkati jabhu.<verse eid="DEU 32:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 32:29" />Ngati bhakabhi na malangu, bhakabya bhaghamanyi aghagha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:29">na kuholalela ujomukelu wabhu anaukubha bhole.<verse eid="DEU 32:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 32:30" />Bho, mundu jumu aweza bholi kubhatopola bhandu elufu jimu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:30">au bhandu bhabheli kubhatopola bhandu elufu komi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:30">ngati Lindalaghu labhu ngaakabhalombisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:30">na Bambo Chapanga wabhu ngaakabhalekike?<verse eid="DEU 32:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 32:31" />Hata adui bhitu bhajetakile kubha ichapanga yabhu ngachelibhi na makili</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:31">ngacheibhi na makili ngati moabheli Chapanga wa Izilaeli.<verse eid="DEU 32:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 32:32" />Ndandi, mizabibu jabhu jihuma mu mizabibu ja ku Sodoma, na mighonda ja Gomola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:32">zabibu yabhu itwelili ubhabha, na ishada yaki nde ibhabha.<verse eid="DEU 32:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 32:33" />Divai jabhu nde ngati chikau cha lijoka, jibhili na chikau chikali cha lijoka.”<verse eid="DEU 32:33" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 32:34" />“Bho, aghagha le ngacheghabhekakiki kughaghoha kwangu nepani?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:34">Na kughakongela mu yumba yangu ya chikoku?<verse eid="DEU 32:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 32:35" />Kulepa kisasi nde lihengu langu nepani, nanatu ananepaje,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:35">chikahi magholu ghabhu paghinyelambukaje, maghambu lichobha labhu la chilelu lihenghalile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:35">na ujomukelu wa mambu ghaghabhapataje uheghalili namaa.<verse eid="DEU 32:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 32:36" />Kwa kubha Bambo Chapanga anaabhakengalya bhandu bhake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:36">na kubhabhonela chiha bhatumika bhake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:36">chikahi paanabhonaje kubha makili ghabhu ghajomwiki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:36">wala njeta joahighalile, mtumwa wala joabhi wakulijeka.<verse eid="DEU 32:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 32:37" />Bhela Bambo Chapanga anaapwaghaje, ‘Ibhi kwaku ichapanga hinu, lindalaghu lemukalikembalile?<verse eid="DEU 32:37" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 32:38" />Ibhi kwaku ichapanga yela yeyakuliki nyambiku hinu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:38">na kunywa divai na nhupu hinu ya kunywa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:38">Bhela, na ijumukaje na kunjangatila mwehapa. Na kubha bhalonda bhinu!’ ”<verse eid="DEU 32:38" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 32:39" />“ ‘Henu mmanyaje kubha Nepani nde Chapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:39">wala njeta Chapanga jongi nambu Nepani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:39">Nepani ngoma, na Nepani niyoha, nyeghela mabhanga na kulamiha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:39">wala njeta joaweza kukengalela kuhuma mu mabhoku ghangu nepani.<verse eid="DEU 32:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 32:40" />Ndandi ngweha chiwoku changu kunani kumahunde,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:40">na kulapa: Chakaka ngati nepani mondamila mileli,<verse eid="DEU 32:40" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 32:41" />chikahi panihyola lipanga langu lelimelameta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:41">na kuhatambula chiwoku changu nahuli kutemula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:41">ananabhalepa kisasi adui bhangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:41">na kubhalapula bhala bhabhanhakalila nepani.<verse eid="DEU 32:41" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 32:42" />Ananijitendaje mishali jangu jiholula mwahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:42">na lipanga langu analabhakomaje bhandu bhabhambenga nepani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:42">Analitepatyaje mwahi wa bhala bhabhakomakiki na bhabhatolakiki kwa makili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:42">na kuheketa mimutu ja ihongozi bha maadui.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 32:42" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 32:43" />“Muhekalyaje, mwenga bhandu bha inchi nayengi, papamu na bhandu bhaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:43">maghambu anaalepaje kisasi cha mwahi wa bhatumika bhaki.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:43">Anaalepaje kisasi kwa maadui bhaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:43">na kutenda ujonganeshu kwa ndandi ja inchi ja bhandu bhaki.”<verse eid="DEU 32:43" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 32:44" />Musa na Haluni mwana waka Nuni, bhakahiki na kupwagha malobhi aghagha ghokapi gha lujembu alolu palongi ja bhandu bhokapi bha Izilaeli nahuli bhajowanyaje.<verse eid="DEU 32:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malaghalakilu gha kujomulela ghaka Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 32:45" />Bhela Musa paakajomwili kubhapwaghila bhandu bha Izilaeli malobhi ghanihagha ghokapi, <verse eid="DEU 32:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 32:46" />akabhapwaghile, “Mughabhekaje mumitima jinu na kughatii malobhi ghokapi ghanuntangazila lichobha la lalenu. Impalika mubhalaghalakyaje bhana bhinu, nahuli bhaghaghohaje na kughajengalela malobhi ghokapi gha shelia jenjenu. <verse eid="DEU 32:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="DEU 32:47" />Maghambu shelia jenjenu nga malobhi matopu pela kwinu, nambu nde womi wino. Kwa kujengalela shelia ajeji anantamaje matamu malachu mu inchi jela jendomboka nkoka Yoludani kujenda kujitama.”<verse eid="DEU 32:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="DEU 32:48" />Mu lichobha leleli, Bambo Chapanga akalongi na Musa, akapwaghaje, <verse eid="DEU 32:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="DEU 32:49" />“Ukwelaje mu chitombi achechi cha Abalimu, mbaka ku chitombi cha Nebo, chechibhili mu inchi ja Moabu, kujenda mbaka ku muchi wa Yeliko, na ukajilingaje inchi ja Kanaani, inchi jenabhapekeha bhandu bha Izilaeli kubha upwelelu wabhu. <verse eid="DEU 32:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="DEU 32:50" />Bhela anaupotilaje ku chitombi chenihechi na kutaghakika kunani kuchitombi hoku, ngati moakapotile ndongu waku Haluni, na kutaghakika kunani ja chitombi cha Holi. <verse eid="DEU 32:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="DEU 32:51" />Maghambu mwehapa mabhokapi mwabheli mkahekiti ulongwana winu kwangu nepani palongi ja bhandu bhokapi bha Izilaeli chikahi pamukabhili pa machi gha Meliba, pambipi na muchi wa Kadeshi, ku lipololu la Sini, na kwa ndandi mkalepiki kulangiha utopelu wangu pachilanda ja bhandu bha Izilaeli. <verse eid="DEU 32:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="DEU 32:52" />Bhela anaujibhona pela inchi cha kutali palongi jaku, nambu wehapa ngawijendi kujingila mu inchi jeniheji jenabhapekeha bhandu bha Izilaeli.”<verse eid="DEU 32:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="DEU 33" />
  <para style="s">Musa aghapengalela makabila gha Izilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 33:1" />Ajeji nde mbengalelu jaka Musa, mundu waka Chapanga, jeakabhapengalili bhandu bha Izilaeli mangane ja kupotela kwaki.<verse eid="DEU 33:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 33:2" />Akapwaghike, “Bambo Chapanga akahikiki kuhuma ku chitombi cha Sinai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:2">akatupitalili ngati lyobha kuhuma ku chitombi cha Seili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:2">na kumulika kuhuma pa chitombi cha Palani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:2">Akahikiki papamu na bhatumika bhaki bha kunani kumahunde makomi elufu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:2">upambala wa chiwoku chaki cha kumalelelu, pakabhi na shelia ja moto.<verse eid="DEU 33:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 33:3" />Chakaka wehapa nde weubhapala makabila gha bhandu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:3">bhahuhu bhaku bhokapi bhabhi mumabhoku ghaku.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:3">Bhokapi bhatama palongi ja magholu ghaku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:3">na anabhajopalyaje malobhi ghokapi kuhuma kwaku.<verse eid="DEU 33:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 33:4" />Musa akatulaghalakili kutii shelia jenjenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:4">nde upwelelu wa lipogha lokapi laka Yakobo.<verse eid="DEU 33:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 33:5" />Bhela Bambo Chapanga akabhi nkolongwa kwa bhandu bha Izilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:5">pabhakalibhongini ihongozi bha bhandu, papamu na makabila ghokapi gha Izilaeli.”<verse eid="DEU 33:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 33:6" />Musa akalongili panani ja likabila laka Leubeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:6">“Leubeni na atamaje, ngayipotela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:6">wala bhandu bhaki ngabhikubha bhachokope.”<verse eid="DEU 33:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 33:7" />Malobhi gha mbengalelu gha likabila laka Yuda ghakabhi aghagha, akapwaghike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:7">“Wenga wa Bambo Chapanga, ujowanyaje chilelu chaka Yuda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:7">unkelabhuhaje kabhete kwa bhandu bhaki bhangi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:7">Ukomanaje kwa mabhoku ghaku kwa ndandi jaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:7">nanau ukubhaje ujangatilu waki kubhokana na maadui bhaki.”<verse eid="DEU 33:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 33:8" />Kwa likabila laka Lawi, akapwaghike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:8">“Wenga wa Bambo Chapanga ulipekyaje likabila laka Lawi malobhi ghaku gha Sumimu na Ulimu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:8">kwa bhatumika bhaku bhalongwana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:8">ambabhu ukabhalengiki ku Masa, na kulongalanela naku pa machi gha Meliba.<verse eid="DEU 33:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 33:9" />Akapwaghiki anana kubhokana na tati waki na mabhu waki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:9">‘Nepani ngachenumbwene,’ akabhajewiki bhalongu bhaki, wala ngacheakabhamanyi bhana bhaki.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:9">Ndandi bhalijengalili lilobhi laku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:9">na kulukamula lulaghilu laku.<verse eid="DEU 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 33:10" />Likabila laka Lawi bhabholaje bhabhelakeka bhaka Yakobo kuikamula amuli yaku, na bhandu bha Izilaeli shelia yaku.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:10">Anabhahuwa ubani palongi jaku, na nyambiku jihilima ya kujochakeka panani ja pandu paku pa kubhokeha nyambiku.<verse eid="DEU 33:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 33:11" />Wenga wa Bambo Chapanga, ughapengalyaje mali ghaki ghokapi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:11">na ughajetakyaje mahengu gha mabhoku ghabhu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:11">Ughahekataje makili gha maadui bhabhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:11">na bhala bhabhunhakalila, ngabhijinuka kabhete.”<verse eid="DEU 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 33:12" />Kwa likabila laka Benyamini, akapwaghike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:12">“Aleli nde likabila lelipalakika na Bambo Chapanga, nalombi litama lukwale pambipi jaki.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:12">Maghambu alilenda muhi jokapi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:12">na kutama pachilanda jabhu.”<verse eid="DEU 33:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 33:13" />Kwa likabila laka Yusufu, akapwaghike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:13">“Bambo Chapanga na ajipengalyaje inchi jake, kwa mbengalelu jinyahi ja lyangame kuhuma kunani kumahunde,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:13">na kwa chemuchemu ya machi ghaghabhi kokunyoliki pahi nakanopi.<verse eid="DEU 33:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 33:14" />Apengaliwaje kwa mapambiku manyahi nakanopi ghaghapili kwa lyobha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:14">na kwa mapambiku manyahi nakanopi ghaghapambika mu kila mwehi.<verse eid="DEU 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 33:15" />Apengaliwaje kwa mapambiku manyahi nakanopi gha itombi ya mwande, na mahunu ghamaheli gha itombi ya mileli.<verse eid="DEU 33:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 33:16" />Inchi jaki jokapi jitwelalaje ghaghabhi ghambone,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:16">jipengaliwaje na wamboni waka Bambo Chapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:16">joakabhi alongela kupetela mu chitutu chechibhelala moto chela.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:16">Mbengalelu ayeyi yokapi na ikubhaje kwa bhandu bha likabila laka Yusufu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:16">maghambu jombi nde joakabhi nkolongwa pachilanda ja bhalongu bhaki.<verse eid="DEU 33:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 33:17" />Ulumbalilu waki nde ngati ulumbalilu waka mbelakeka wa kutumbula wa likambaku la ng'ombi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:17">na manyelu ghaki nde manyelu gha chinyama chechilowakeka nyati.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:17">Anaatumilaje manyelu ghanihagha kubhakanga bhandu bha inchi yokapi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:17">mbaka ku ujomukelu wa inchi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:17">Anabhakubhaje makomi elufu ghaka Efulaimu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:17">nabhombi nde maelufu ghaka Manase.”<verse eid="DEU 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 33:18" />Kwa likabila laka Zabuloni, akapwaghike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:18">“Uhekalyaje wa Zabuloni, chikahi cha kupita kunja,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:18">na wenga wa Isakali, uhekalyaje mu mahema ghaku.<verse eid="DEU 33:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 33:19" />Anabhabhalohaje bhagheni bhahikaje kuitombi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:19">na kubhoha nyambiku yeijetakalewa konihoku.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:19">Maghambu bhombi anabhapataje wamaheli wa hindu yabhu kubhokana na bahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:19">na hindu yeihiyakiki mumaheku ja luhanga.”<verse eid="DEU 33:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 33:20" />Kwa likabila laka Gadi, akapwaghike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:20">“Apengalikaje Chapanga joampekeha Gadi pandu pakolongwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:20">Gadi atama konihoku ngati lihimba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:20">nahuli ahekataje chiwoku na lutohutohu lwa mmutu.<verse eid="DEU 33:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 33:21" />Akalihaghulili pandu panyahi kupeta pokapi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:21">maghambu konihoku nde kolabhekakiki lifungu laka mboha shelia.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:21">Akahikiki papamu na ihongozi bha bhandu, na kuhenga mpangu waka Bambo Chapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:21">na ndemulu yaki kwa bhandu bha Izilaeli.”<verse eid="DEU 33:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 33:22" />Kwa likabila laka Dani, akapwaghike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:22">“Dani nde mwanalihimba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:22">joahomba kuhuma ku Bashani.”<verse eid="DEU 33:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 33:23" />Kwa likabila laka Nafutali, akapwaghike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:23">“Nafutali atwelili namaa upendeleu waka Bambo Chapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:23">najombi atwelili mbengalelu yaki, upwelelu waku anaukubhaje ku upambala wa kolijibhi lyobha na kunkache ja nhwanga wa Galilaya.”<verse eid="DEU 33:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 33:24" />Kwa likabila laka Asheli, akapwaghike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:24">“Bhana bhaka Asheli na bhapengaliwaje nakanopi kupeta bhangi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:24">jombi na ajetakaliwaje pachilanda ja bhalongu bhaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:24">inchi jaki na jitwelalaje kwa wamaheli wa mikongu ja mahuta gha zeituni.<verse eid="DEU 33:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 33:25" />Milyangu mikolongwa ja michi jaku na jijighalikaje na kabali ya choma na shaba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:25">na makili ghaku anaghalenganaje na machobha ghaku gha kutama.”<verse eid="DEU 33:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 33:26" />“Mwenga mabhandu bha Izilaeli, njeta jongi joalengana na Chapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:26">joahika koni akweliki panani ja mbengu nahuli kutujangatila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:26">na panani ja mahunde mu ulumbalilu waki.<verse eid="DEU 33:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 33:27" />Chapanga wa mileli nde matamu ghaku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:27">na mabhoku gha mileli ghabhi pahi jaku.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:27">Akabhatopwili kutali adui bhaku palongi jaku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:27">na kukulaghalakila, ‘Ubhayonanga bhokapi.’<verse eid="DEU 33:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 33:28" />Bhela bhandu bha Izilaeli bhatama lukwale, na bhabhelakeka bhaka Yakobo kanjika jabhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:28">mu inchi jejitwelile mahunu na divai jahenu, na pandu ambapu mbengu jaki jihabhuha iyula.<verse eid="DEU 33:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 33:29" />Mpengaliwi mwenga, Bhaizilaeli!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:29">Bho, nde nane joabhi ngati mwehapa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:29">mabhandu mwenkengaliwi na Bambo Chapanga?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:29">Jombi nde ngau jinu na ujangatilu winu, na lipanga la ulumbalilu winu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:29">Adui bhinu anabhahika palongi jinu nahuli kundobha mubhabhonila chiha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:29">nanamu anamupakanyataje pandu pabhu papajinwike.”<verse eid="DEU 33:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="DEU 34" />
  <para style="s">Kupotela kwaka Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 34:1" />Bhela, Musa akakweliki kuhuma ku uwanda wa Moabu, na kujenda mbaka ku chitombi cha Nebo, na kukwela mbaka panani nakanopi ja chihongu cha Pisiga, ku upambala wa kolipita lyobha wa Yeliko. Panihapa Bambo Chapanga akundangihi inchi jokapi: Kutumbula ku Gileadi mbaka ku Dani, <verse eid="DEU 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 34:2" />pandu pokapi pa Nafutali, inchi jokapi jaka Efulahimu na Manase, inchi jokapi ja Yuda mbaka ku bahali ja Meditelania, <verse eid="DEU 34:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 34:3" />pandu pajomu ku upambala wa kunkache wa Yuda, uwanda wokapi wa libondi la Yeliko, muchi wa Mitende, mbaka ku Soali. <verse eid="DEU 34:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 34:4" />Bhela Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Musa, “Ajeji nde inchi jenakabhalaghili Ibulahimu, Isaka na Yakobo kwa kulapa, nakapwaghaje, ‘Ananabhapekyaje bhabhelakeka bhabhu.’ Bhela nukulangihi wehapa ujibhonaje kwa mihu ghaku, nambu ngawilomboki kujingi monihomu.”<verse eid="DEU 34:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 34:5" />Bhela, Musa mtumika waka Bambo Chapanga, akapotili ku inchi ja Moabu hoku, ngati Bambo Chapanga moakapwaghile. <verse eid="DEU 34:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 34:6" />Bambo Chapanga akuntaghiki ku libondi la inchi ja Moabu, pambipi na Beti Peoli, nambu njeta joalimanyi litengeli laki mbaka lalenu. <verse eid="DEU 34:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 34:7" />Musa akabhi mundu wa hyaka mia jimu na ishilini chikahi paakapotile. Hata bhela mihu ghaki ghakabhi ghakali na makili gha kulola wichu, wala makili gha hyegha jaki ngacheghakepike.<verse eid="DEU 34:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 34:8" />Bhandu bha Izilaeli bhakaombulizi kupotela kwaka Musa kwa chikahi cha machobha selasini ku inchi ja uwanda wa Moabu. Bhakahengiki bhenibhela mbaka machobha gha maombulezu kwa ndandi ja kupotela kwaka Musa ghakajomwike.<verse eid="DEU 34:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 34:9" />Bhela Yoshua, mwana waka Nuni, akabhi atwelili roho ja mbulau, maghambu Musa akabhi ambekili mabhoku ghaki panani jaki. Panihapa bhandu bha Izilaeli bhakunjowanili Yoshua, na kuhenga ghokapi ngati Bambo Chapanga moakundaghalaki Musa.<verse eid="DEU 34:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 34:10" />Kutumbula chikahi chenihechi, ngacheapitalili mlota jongi ngati Musa, ambaju Bambo Chapanga akummanyi pamihu kwa pamihu. <verse eid="DEU 34:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 34:11" />Njeta mlota jongi joakahengiki nginyulila na ngangachu ngati yela ambayu Bambo Chapanga akuntumiki Musa kuhenga ku inchi ja Misili, yani kwaka Falao, kwa bhatumika bhaki bhokapi, na kwa inchi jaki jokapi. <verse eid="DEU 34:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 34:12" />Ndandi njeta mlota jongi jokapi jola joalabhalili kulangiha makili ghamaheli, au kuhenga mambu makolongwa gha kujoghoha, ngati moakahengi Musa palongi ja bhandu bhokapi bha Izilaeli.<verse eid="DEU 34:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 34" />
</usx>